<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">- Siwu Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">EZEKIEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ezk</para>
  <para style="mt1">EZEKIEL</para>
  <para style="imt1">ATƆ̃MEƉEAKATƆ̃</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɣaa kanyaɖidze Ezekiel ɔwe ngbã i kafɔrɔ̃ iso i Babilon ku ɔwi wɔ loɖekatɔ̃ fiɛ Yerusalem ɔkpase, gu ne kama i akɔ alafa aru gu fasinafasina-ikuɔ fiɛ maɣe Yesu (586 B.C.). Ɔɣɛ ɔ̃ atɔ̃me ɔsese mafɔrɔĩ i Babilonia gu Yerusalem maturi. <char style="bk">Ezekiel ɔko</char> ba kusɛ nyaa kukuɔ: (1) Ɣaa ɔkpere Ezekiel sɔ ɔɖe kanyaɖidze. (2) Kusɛ̃kutã atɔ̃me i Ɣaa kutsueikpadzɛ̃ iso itã maturi, i nnɛ loaba i ma iso gu Yerusalem ikpase gu iwɔra. (3) <char style="nd">Bosate</char> atɔ̃me wa ɔsese ise i kutsueikpadzɛ̃ gɔ loaba i nɖebi agbã mɛ loyika, ɔ̃ maturi mabɔkarɔ̃ fiɛ makɔ ma mayura iso. (4) Kaɣɔra ga loaba i Israel iso ku Yerusalem ikpase kama gu kaɣɛkasɛ i kɔrãkaɖe ame isaruɛ iso. (5) Kanyaiɖi ita iya i Gog iso. (6) Ezekiel kumiamia gɔ ɔnya ɔsese i Isɔrɛyo gu kaɖe ga maledza isɛra iso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ezekiel ɔɖe ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ lowe kafɔkaɖe wodoroa fiɛ ɔsɛkatɔ̃ i arainyɔ isese ame. Ɔ̃ arainyɔ isese gbodzoo ɔba i kuɖikute kuseme ame. Ana ne i ɔ̃ atɔ̃me gbodzoo ame ne, ɔɖi abarara wa nɣɛ lɛ ikparĩ ɔte, i ɔri wɔ lokpa iso. Ezekiel ɔɣɛ fiɛ ɔledza iɣɛ gɔ inya sɔ ɔturi aaledza ɔ̃ ɔtu gu siwarã ibara aɣɛtɛ, gu kumɛgɔ ɔbiara aafɔ ɔ̃ mɔmɔ akpi kuso. Ana ne ɔɖikayi ɔɣɛ ɔ̃ ɔriinyɔ sɔ kaɖe to kaasɛ ngbã ɣɛtɛ. Gɔ ɔɖe sɔrɛdze fiɛ ɔkpese ɔɖe Ɣaa kanyaɖidze ne, ɔwe kuɖuɛ igbaɔ ɔtã Isɔrɛyo gu kumɛgɔ isekele ɔnya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ɔko ame atɔ̃medziri</para>
  <para style="io1">Ezekiel ikpere (1.1- 3.27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Atɔ̃me wa masese i iranyanyariã nɛ nto iaba i Yerusalem iso (4.1- 24.27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɣaa nɖebi kutsueikpadzɛ̃ (25.1- 32.32)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɣaa kaɣɛkasɛ katã ɔ̃ maturi (33.1-37.28)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kanyaiɖi ita iya i Gog iso (38.1-39.29)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaɖikate i Isɔrɛyo gu karɔ̃ iso ku ngbɔ iase i kɔrãkaɖe ame (40.1-48.35)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Sigaraiyara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1" />Iyi ruva ku ma Yudase kuwa naare i ikɔ sitɛare ame ne, gɔ lowe i mafɔrɔĩndɛ̃ i Kebar Ɔwore kɔrɛ ne, mabusi kato ne lonya Ɣaa kuɖikute.<verse eid="EZK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2" />Iyi ruva i kuwa ame ne - iɖe ikɔ ruva gɔ mamɔɛ̃ Igara Yexoyakin makɛlɛgu i kafɔrɔ̃ iso- <verse eid="EZK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba Buzi ɔbibirɛrɛĩ sɔrɛdze Ezekiel kɔrɛ, i Kebar Ɔwore kɔrɛ i ma Babiloniase karɔ̃ iso. Mmɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɔ̃ ɔsia i ɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="EZK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4" />Lonyɔ, ne lonya ɔwiri to ɔkpɛ̃ teteree ɔbɔrɛ i katikpe ɔba - idɔdɔ siare ku ɔtɔimama fiɛ ɔtɔ ifiɛ siare ɔki ilɔ ne. Ɔtɔ ndɛndɛ̃ ɔbe ɔrɛtɛ lɛ ibɔra lomɔɛ̃ ɔtɔ ito. <verse eid="EZK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5" />I ɔtɔ ame ne iraɔ pia gɔ inyɔ lɛ ara ana wa mba ngbã awe. Si anyɔ wã ne, kuseme ɔnyɔ lɛ ɔturi awune awe. <verse eid="EZK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6" />Ɣɛɛ wã ibiara ɔwe ntɔ̃ mina gu abue ana. <verse eid="EZK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7" />Wã ngba ɔse siĩ ne ngbatɔ̃ ɔnyɔ lɛ inantsuĩbi mire ne ito ifiɛ lɛ ayiwa wa lotsue awe. <verse eid="EZK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8" />Abue wa mpia i wã ababa ana ɔwe ɔturi awune nrɔɔ̃ i kayirinɔ. Wã ana ɔɖuɖu ɔwe ntɔ̃ gu abue, <verse eid="EZK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9" />fiɛ ara wã ana abue ɔpɛgu so. Ma ɔbiara ɔsɛ siĩ ɔkɛlɛ katɔ̃, maisɛ mapɛ mafiriki si masɛ.<verse eid="EZK 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10" />Kumɛgɔgbe i ma ntɔ̃ ɔnyɔ ne: Ma ina ɔbiara ɔwe ɔturi awune katɔ̃, ne i kuɖearɔ̃ isɛ ne ma ɔbiara ɔwe dzata katɔ̃, ne i kubena iso ne mawe nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ katɔ̃ fiɛ ma ɔbiara ɔwe finikpo katɔ̃ ana. <verse eid="EZK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11" />Kumɛgɔgbe i ma ntɔ̃ ɔse ne. Mawarɛ ma abue makɛlɛgu i kato. Ma ɔbiara ɔwe abue aka anyɔ, abue anyɔ ika iwɛ̃ ɔpɛgu ɔmama are i kasɛ biara iso, ne abue aka anyɔ ana ɔfu i ma mɔmɔ iso. <verse eid="EZK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12" />Ma ɔbiara ɔsɛ siĩ ɔkɛlɛ katɔ̃. Kakɔi karere ga i siwarã ɔkɛlɛ ne, masɛ makɛlɛ, gɔ maisɛ mafiriki si mato makɛlɛ. <verse eid="EZK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13" />Ara wa mba ngbã ɔnyɔ lɛ akaĩ wa lowara ku ɔtɔ ato atsue ɣee lɛ kaka. Ɔtɔ ɔsɛ katɔ gu kama i ara wa mba ngbã ndɛ̃, ikpa fiɛ ɔtɔimama ɔfiɛ ibɔrɛ i ne ame. <verse eid="EZK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14" />Ara wa mba ngbã ɔtere ise akɛlɛ katɔ̃ gu kama lɛ ɔtɔ imama awe.<verse eid="EZK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15" />Gɔ ame nto lonyɔ ara wa mba ngbã ne, lonya kakai i ara wa mba ngbã ku ma ntɔ̃ mina ibiara ibaba i karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16" />Kumɛgɔgbe i kukai ɔnyɔ gu kɔ̃ kuseme ne: Kufiɛ lɛ itafɔkuɣa Kirisolit, fiɛ kɔ̃ kuna ɔɖuɖu ɔre so. Ibiara ɔnyɔ lɛ kakai kawɛ̃ mpia i kamama ame. <verse eid="EZK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17" />Si kukai sɛ ne, kusɛ kukɛlɛ isɛ irere i ababa ana irere nɛ i ara wa mba ngbã to anyɔ. Kukai iisɛ kupɛ kufiriki gɔ i ara wa mba ngbã ɔsɛ akɛlɛ. <verse eid="EZK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18" />Kɔ̃ situeti ɔkɔlɛ fiɛ iɖe ifɔ̃ra, ne situeti ina ɔɖuɖu ɔyigu anɔmi aki alɔ.<verse eid="EZK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19" />Si ara wa mba ngbã ɔsɛ ne, kukai gɔ i wã ababa ɔsɛ. Si ara wa mba ngbã ɔta i karɔ̃ ne, kukai ana ata. <verse eid="EZK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20" />Kakɔi karere ga i siwarã aakɛlɛ ne, wã wũ akɛlɛ fiɛ kukai ana aatagu wã, alasɔ ara wa mba ngbã siwarã ɔwe i kukai ame. <verse eid="EZK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21" />Si ara wa mba ngbã ɔsɛ ne, kɔ̃ wũ kusɛ; si ara wa mba ngbã ɔtuĩ aya ne, kɔ̃ wũ kutuĩ kuya. Si ara wa mba ngbã ɔta i karɔ̃ ne kukai ɔta ku wã, alasɔ ara wa mba ngbã siwarã ɔwe i kukai ame.<verse eid="EZK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22" />Ira nɛ lonyɔ lɛ ndunyia ita nɛ nto ifiɛ fiɛ iɖe ifɔ̃ra ɔwarɛ i ɔwiri ame ifere i ara wa mba ngbã ati kato. <verse eid="EZK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23" />I nnɛ lowarɛ i ma ati kato i ɔwiri ame kayirinɔ ne, ara wa mba ngbã abue ɔbusi abɔrɛ akɛlɛ imama kɔrɛ, ne ibiara ɔwe abue anyɔ wa lofu i ne mɔmɔ iso. <verse eid="EZK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24" />Si ara wa mba ngbã ɔsɛ ne, lonɔ wã abue silɔ, lɛ ndu mɛ ntere silɔ, lɛ Ɔlesate silɔ, lɛ makpakpɛ̃dze kulu. Si matuĩ maya ne, mabɔ ma abue karɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25" />Kere ne silɔ ɔbɔrɛ i nnɛ nfu kato i ɔwiri ame i ara wa mba ngbã ati kato, gɔ ame matuĩ maɣɛ fiɛ mabɔ abue karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26" />I nnɛ nfu i ɔwiri ame i ma ati kato ne, ira nɛ lonyɔ lɛ itafɔkuɣa safir ise bulu sigaraiyara ɔwe. Ira nɛ lonyɔ lɛ ɔturi awune kuseme ɔwe i kakɔlɛkɔ̃ i sigaraiyara iso. <verse eid="EZK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27" />Lonya sɔ nnɛ lote so lɛ ɔ̃ ɔsɔ kato ne, ɔnyɔ lɛ ibɔra nɛ lobe irɛtɛ ku ɔtɔ, ne ita i mmɔ ikɛlɛ kala ne ɔnyɔ lɛ ɔtɔ, ne ɔtɔ ifiɛ siare ɔki ilɔ wũ. <verse eid="EZK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28" />Ifiɛ nɛ loki ilɔ wũ ne, inyɔ lɛ ɔbebei i adɔdɔ ame ku kado iyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 1:28">Nnɛgbe loɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ kuseme lɛ iɖi so ite. Gɔ lonya ne ne, loturi lorɛ lofu anɔ i karɔ̃, ne lonɔ ɔwɛ̃ silɔ ɔto ɔɖeika.<verse eid="EZK 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Makpere Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1" />Ne silɔ ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ta ya i fɔ ngba iso si loaɖe-ɔ ika." <verse eid="EZK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2" />Gɔ ɔɖeika ne, Siwarã ɔbo i wũ ame ne sikɔlɛ me siɣedza i wũ ngba iso, ne lonɔ ɔto ɔɖe me ika.<verse eid="EZK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3" />Ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, nto losese-ɔ Israel mabi kɔrɛ, i kaɖe ga mba atsuele fiɛ mata maya me iso. Ma gu ma mawa ɔɔta maya me iso iba iapɛ nɔme iyi. <verse eid="EZK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4" />Maturi ma kɔrɛ nto losese-ɔ ba atsuele fiɛ mainɔ ara. Ɣere ma sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne.' <verse eid="EZK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5" />Ne si makãatsue ɣee maikãatsue ne - alasɔ kaɖe ga mba atsuele maɖe - mato maatsue sɔ Ɣaa kanyaɖidze ɔwɛ̃ ɔɔwe i ma ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6" />Ɔturi ɔwune ɔbi, ɣɛɛ fɔ ne, daanigã ma ɣee daanigã ma atɔ̃me. Daanigã kɔraa atoasɔ miyu gu kuposɛ̃ ɔki alɔ-ɔ fiɛ asi i siboitɛtɛ ndɛ̃. Daanigã ala nnɛ mato maɣɛ ɣee daati akpakpa ala ma ɔso, atoasɔ maɖe kaɖe ga mba atsuele. <verse eid="EZK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7" />Ikote sɔ aaɣere ma wũ atɔ̃me, si masɛ makãatsue ɣee maisɛ makãatsue ala maɖe matsuelese ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8" />Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɣɛɛ fɔ ne, kã nnɛ nto loɣere-ɔ atsue. Daawe atsuele lɛ kaɖe ga mba atsuele. Busi kanya si aɖe nnɛ nto lotã-ɔ."<verse eid="EZK 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9" />Kere ne lonyɔ, ne lonya kɔrɔ̃ ɔbɔrɛ kusɔ̃ me. Ɔko pia i kɔ̃ ame, <verse eid="EZK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10" />ne ɔwarɛ wũ i wũ katɔ̃. I kusɛ kunyɔ ɔɖuɖu iso ne matsɛrɛ sipini gu isoma gu ndzo itã atɔ̃me masia iso.<verse eid="EZK 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekiel Kaɖikate Ɖeakatɔ̃ Ɔwiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1" />Ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖe nnɛ nse-ɔ i katɔ̃, we ɔko wɔgbe. Iyɔ si asɛ aaɖe Israel kaɖe ika." <verse eid="EZK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2" />Ne ɔso lobusi kanya ne ɔsu ɔko ɔtã me lowe.<verse eid="EZK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3" />Kere ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, we ɔko wɔ nto lotã-ɔ i ngbe si amidza fɔ iyiri ku wũ." Ne ɔso lowe wũ, ne iwe ɔmɛrɛ̃ lɛ maɣendu awe i wũ kanya ame.<verse eid="EZK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4" />Kere ne ka ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, kiniɔ ne, ka kɛlɛ Israel kaɖe kɔrɛ si asɛ aaɣere ma wũ atɔ̃me. <verse eid="EZK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5" />Loito losese-ɔ maturi ma siɖe aibanɔ ɣee mma siɖe mba ɔle kɔrɛ, ɣɛɛ Israel kaɖe kɔrɛ - <verse eid="EZK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6" />nto losese-ɔ maturi ma siɖe aanɔkarɔ̃, mma siɖe nna ɔle fiɛ aanɔ ma atɔ̃me karɔ̃. Gbaã ne, si ɔsese losese-ɔ i maturi ma siɖe mba ɔle ku karɔ̃inɔ kɔrɛ ne, tee maɔkã-ɔ atsue. <verse eid="EZK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7" />Ɣɛɛ Israel kaɖe iito maakã-ɔ atsue alasɔ maisɛ mabie sɔ maakã me atsue. Ala Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu ba ɔtu gbogboroa fiɛ maisɛ manɔ ara. <verse eid="EZK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8" />Ɣɛɛ nto loabara-ɔ sɔ aibatã iti fiɛ aawe ɔle lɛ kumɛgɔ awe mase. <verse eid="EZK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9" />Nto loabara fɔ anɔ ɔwe ɔle lɛ ita nɛ lokpokporo iɖo, ikore iɖo itoreta. Daanigã ma ɣee ati akpakpa ala ma ɔso, atoasɔ kaɖe ga mba atsuele maɖe."<verse eid="EZK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10" />Ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, kã atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu wa nto loɣere-ɔ atsue kukaakɔ si amɔɛ̃ wã apia i fɔ ɔtu ame. <verse eid="EZK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11" />Kɛlɛ fɔ manyiibi ma i kafɔrɔ̃ ame kɔrɛ, si aɖe ma ika. Ɣere ma sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne,' si mato mabie sɔ maakã atsue ɣee maito mabie sɔ makãatsue."<verse eid="EZK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12" />Kere ne siwarã ɔkɔlɛ me kato ne lonɔ iwuwũti silɔ teteree i wũ kama sɔ - Si maale <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ i ɔ̃ kawekɔ̃! <verse eid="EZK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13" />Lonɔ ara wa mba ngbã abue silɔ gɔ ato abobore so iso, ne lonɔ kukai gɔ i wã ababa silɔ, iɖe iwuwũti teteree. <verse eid="EZK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14" />Siwarã ɔkɔlɛ me kato ne sikɔ me siruigu. Lowe i kaɖo gu sikpã i wũ ame, ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔmɔɛ̃ me ɔla teteree ku ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15" />Kere ne loba mafɔrɔĩ ma nsi i Tel Abib i Kebar Ɔwore kɔrɛ. Mmɔ, i ngbegɔ masɛ ne, lobɔdzo losɛ i ma ndɛ̃ ayi akɔdzɛ - lokpɔkpɔtɔ.<verse eid="EZK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosate Ɔɖi Ezekiel Lɛ Dzuɛ̃se Ɔtã Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16" />Ayi akɔdzɛ kawirikɔ̃ ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, loɔbara-ɔ dzuɛ̃se lotã Israel kaɖe, ne ɔso nɔ itɔ̃me nɛ nto loɣɛ si asu wũ isɛ̃itã atã ma. <verse eid="EZK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18" />Si loɣere ɔtilese sɔ, 'Gbaã ne ato aakpi,' fiɛ aisɛ̃ atã wũ ɣee aika wũ sɔ ɔnyua nsɛgbai nyanyariã si ɔ̃aɖi ɔ̃ ngbã ne, ɔtilese wɔmɔ to ɔ̃akpi ala ɔ̃ ikpi iti, iyɔ nto loakarɛ ɔ̃ ima lobɔrɛ i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19" />Ɣɛɛ si asɛ̃ atã ɔtilese fiɛ ɔ̃ifiriki i ɔ̃ nsɛgbai nyanyariã ame ɣee ɔ̃ifiriki i ɔtile ame ne, ɔto ɔ̃akpi i ɔ̃ ikpi iti ɣɛɛ ne ɔɔɖi fɔ mɔmɔ ngbã.<verse eid="EZK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20" />"Ana ne si ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa ɔfiriki i ɔ̃ sibɔlɔ ame fiɛ ɔbara iranyanyariã, fiɛ lotã ara lalaa ɔba i ɔ̃ iso ne ɔto ɔ̃akpi. Ala aisɛ̃ atã wũ ɔso ɔto ɔ̃akpi i ɔ̃ ikpi iti. Ara bɔlɔlɔa wa ɔ̃ɔbara ne maisibanyigi wã, fiɛ loakarɛ ɔ̃ ima iti i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21" />Ɣɛɛ si asɛ̃ atã ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa sɔ ɔdaabara ikpi fiɛ ɔ̃ibara ikpi ne, gbaã ne ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã ala ɔfɔ isɛ̃itã ɔpia i kame, iyɔ ɔɔɖi so."<verse eid="EZK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɔ̃ ɔsia me iso i mmɔ, ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ta ya si akɛlɛ katɛfɛkɔ̃ mmɔ loaɖe-ɔ ika ne." <verse eid="EZK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23" />Ne ɔso lota ne lokɛlɛ katɛfɛkɔ̃. Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ ɔya i mmɔ. Ise lɛ ikpawaĩ nɛ loɔnya i Kebar Ɔwore kuruɛ ne loturi lofu anɔ i karɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24" />Kere ne Siwarã ɔba i wũ ame sitara me siɣedza i wũ ngba iso. Ɔɖe me ika ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Kɛlɛ, si asɛ̃ so apia i fɔ iyo ame. <verse eid="EZK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25" />Ɔturi awune ɔbi, fɔ ne mato maanyi-ɔ ku siwɛ̃; maanyi-ɔ gɔ aibawo ɔbɔrɛ akɛlɛ maturi ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26" />Nto loatã fɔ ɔnyagɛmi ɔpɛ ɔmatã i fɔ kanyato sɔ aalokanana aibawo ma ɔnyagalagu, atoasɔ maɖe atsuele kaɖe. <verse eid="EZK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27" />Ɣɛɛ si loɖe-ɔ ika ne, nto loabusi fɔ kanya fiɛ aaɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ,' Ɔrere wɔ loakãatsue ne, mitã si ɔkãatsue, si ɔrere wɔ loasɛ̃ atsueikã ne, si mitã ɔsɛ̃. Ala atsuele kaɖe maɖe ɔso."<verse eid="EZK 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Itɛ̃ipia Ikparĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1" />Ɣaa ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Kiniɔ, ɔturi awune ɔbi, su ita nɛ masu kupɔse mabara sɛ i fɔ katɔ̃, si ata Yerusalem ɔmagɛ̃siare asia i ne iso. <verse eid="EZK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2" />Iyɔ si atɛ̃ wũ apia lɛgbe. Ɣedza itɛ̃ipia ara i ɔ̃ iso, si abara sikparuɛ siri asia i ɔ̃ iso, si abara kusɛkɔ̃ aki alɔ wũ si ali akpo aki alɔ wũ. <verse eid="EZK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3" />Iyɔ si asu ibɔrakpinaa igbɛɛ, si asu ne asɛ lɛ ibɔrakpinaa ibere i mi gu ɔmagɛ̃siare ndɛ̃, si apɛ fɔ katɔ̃ afiriki anyɔ ɔmagɛ̃siare isɛ. Ɔto ɔ̃awe i itɛ̃ipia ame, ne ato aatɛ̃ wũ apia. Nnɛgbe nto iaɖe ikparĩ itã Israel kaɖe.<verse eid="EZK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4" />"Iyɔ rɛ i fɔ kubena iso si asu Israel kaɖe ikpi asia so iso. Ato aasore ma akpi itã ayi wa ato aarɛ i fɔ kasɛ iso. <verse eid="EZK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5" />Loɔsɛ-ɔ ayi kusime lɛ ma akpi akɔ kusime kanya. Ne ɔso ayi kulafa gu kasiwɛ̃ ato aasore Israel kaɖe akpi.<verse eid="EZK 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6" />"Si ɔɔro nnɛgbe kama ne, rɛ i fɔ kuɖearɔ̃ iso ana, ku ɔwi wɔgbe, si asore Yuda kamele akpi. Loɔsɛ-ɔ ayi sina, iyi biara itã ikɔ iwɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7" />Pɛ fɔ anɔ firikira nyɔ i Yerusalem itɛ̃ipia isɛ. Ne ku nrɔɔ̃ mɛ ɔɔledza atã ikpɛ̃ si aɖikanya ata aya i ɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8" />Nto loanyi-ɔ ku siwɛ̃ si aibawo ɔrɛ i kasɛ kawɛ̃ akɛlɛ kasɛ mama gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ɔɔro fɔ itɛ̃ipia ayi.<verse eid="EZK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9" />"Su kamɔ gu kakpã, kaɣakpei gu ayiforobi, kakpã rɛtɛa gu atitabi. Ledza wã sɛ i kabui ame si asu wã abara aɖera atã so. Wã ato aaɖe i ayi alafa atɛ gu kasiwɛ̃ wa ame ato aarɛ i fɔ kasɛ iso. <verse eid="EZK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10" />Kere sekel sinyɔ araɖea wa aaɖe itã iyi biara, si aɖe wã ku ɔwi wɔ masɛ iso. <verse eid="EZK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11" />Si asusu ndu lɛ lita kaku si anɛ me ku ɔwi wɔ masɛ iso. <verse eid="EZK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12" />Ɖe aɖera lɛ kumɛgɔ aaɖe atitabi boɖoboɖo awe. Su maturi mmi lɛ ɔtɔipiara wa aɖera i maturi anɔmi ame." <verse eid="EZK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ sɔ, "I ɔri wɔgbe iso ne Israel maturi to maaɖe aɖera wa mapukutura i nɖebi mɛ ame nto loasa ma lokɛlɛgu."<verse eid="EZK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14" />Kere ne loɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso! Ooɣo iibase kumɛɔ, loipukutura so kuiyikuiyi. Ita i wũ sibiɛtɛ ame iba iabo kiniɔ ne, loiɖe kuira nɛ lokpi ɣee kaputubɔi ɔkɛkɛ kasɛ lonya kuiyikuiyi. Sina dzɛ loisekele kusiwɛ̃ iibo me i kanya kuiyikuiyi."<verse eid="EZK 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15" />Ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ilɛ gbaã, loatã awa aɖera ku nantsuĩ mmi i ɔturi awune mmi kanya."<verse eid="EZK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16" />Kere ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, nto loatuĩdza araɖea ibɔ Yerusalem siri. Maturi to maayasoiso maaɖe aɖera wa maɣɛ fiɛ maanɛ ndu mɛ maɣɛ gɔ maayu ɔriinyɔ, <verse eid="EZK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17" />ala araɖea gu ndu idaawe ɔso. Sitsue to siabɔrɛ ma si manya so fiɛ mato maakore maɖi akui ala ma akpi ɔso."<verse eid="EZK 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekiel Ɔkparɛ̃ ɔ̃ Siwɛrɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ, "Kiniɔ ne, ɔturi awune ɔbi, su ipɛmi nɛ mba ɔbe si abara ne iso karabara lɛ tikparɛ̃dze siwɛrɛ̃ ikparɛ̃ra si akparɛ̃ fɔ iti gu fɔ ɔkore. Su siwɛrɛ̃ dzɛ akparɛ̃ sia i akerera iso si aɣɛ sɛ̃ apia aka atɛ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2" />Ɔwi wɔ i fɔ itɛ̃ipia ayi ɔwiri ne, tsuedza siwɛrɛ̃ ika iwɛ̃ i ɔtɔ ame i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame. Su ika iwɛ̃ si awuĩ ne ku ipɛmi aki alɔ ɔmagɛ̃siare. Si asa ika iwɛ̃ afere i ɔwiri ame. Ala nto loatere losiai ma ku ipɛmi. <verse eid="EZK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3" />Ɣɛɛ ɖi siwɛrɛ̃ siwɛ̃ si asu ama apia i fɔ arapia sitsueti dzɛ mafɛ̃ masia ame. <verse eid="EZK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4" />Ana ne, su sɛ̃ siwɛ̃ dzɛgbe si afuĩdza apia i ɔtɔ ame atsuedza. Ɔtɔ to ɔ̃aɣele ɔbɔrɛ i mmɔ ɔfɔ Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu.<verse eid="EZK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5" />"Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Yerusalem i ngbe ne, nwɔ loɣedza i nɖebi ndɛndɛ̃, gɔ nrɔ̃ ɔki milɔ wũ pelepele. <verse eid="EZK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6" />Ɣɛɛ i ɔ̃ ɔtile ame ne ɔ̃ɔta ɔya i wũ mmara gu asɛ̃ra iso ɔɖo nɖebi gu nrɔ̃ mɛ loki milɔ wũ. Ɔ̃ɔsɛ̃ wũ mmara fiɛ ɔ̃isiai wũ asɛ̃ra.<verse eid="EZK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7" />"Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ɔɔbara atsuele aɖo nɖebi mɛ loki milɔ-ɔ fiɛ aisiai wũ asɛ̃ra ɣee aimɔɛ̃ wũ mmara ala. Kɔraa ne aisɛ ngbã abo i nɖebi mɛ loki milɔ asɛra kanya.<verse eid="EZK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8" />"Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Mme, wũ mɔmɔ ka loɔta loɣɛ-ɔ iso Yerusalem, fiɛ nto loakpadzɛ̃-ɔ kutsue i nɖebi anɔmi ame. <verse eid="EZK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9" />Ala fɔ anyanya arapɔa ɔso ne, nto loabara-ɔ nnɛ loibara lonya kuiyikuiyi fiɛ loisibabara ne kuiyikuiyi ana. <verse eid="EZK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10" />Ne ɔso i fɔ ame ne, mase to maawe ma mabi fiɛ mabi to maawe ma mase. Nto loakpadzɛ̃-ɔ kutsue fiɛ loasamera mma ɔɖuɖu lokuti mapia ngbã lopia i kasɛ biara. <verse eid="EZK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11" />Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔkã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, ala mipukutura wũ isɔrɛyo ku mi aranyanyariã kumiamia ɔɖuɖu gu kubarara nyanyariã ɔso ne, Mme wũ mɔmɔ loarera wũ kayiribielea kama. Loibanyɔ mi nnya fiɛ loakpadzɛ̃ mi ɔɖuɖu kutsue. <verse eid="EZK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12" />Fɔ maturi ikatɛa to maakpi ala kukpakpi ɔso ɣee maawɔ i fɔ ame ala kukãsiare iti. Ikatɛa mama to marɔ̃ kakpa i ma matsirise ipɛmi kanya i fɔ abere kama. Ne loasemera ikatɛa ana lopia i kasɛ biara fiɛ loatere losiai ma ku ipɛmi.<verse eid="EZK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13" />"Iyɔ wũ sikpã aɣɔ me fiɛ wũ sikpã teterea aaba karɔ̃ i ma iso, iyɔ ne loɔbara lotikuso. Ne si loɔɖi wũ sikpã teterea losia i ma iso ne, mato maatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne loɖeika ku wũ kubie teteree.<verse eid="EZK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14" />"Nto loabara-ɔ ikpakpi gu simaira i nɖebi mɛ loki milɔ kɔrɛ, i mma ɔɖuɖu loaki mafe anɔmi ame. <verse eid="EZK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15" />Ato aakpese ira nɛ maabara aɣiãra gu atɔ̃me wa loapia-ɔ sikpã. Ato aaɖe ira nɛ loaɖe isɛ̃itã gu ifɔ̃ra atã nɖebi mɛ loki milɔ-ɔ si lokpadzɛ̃-ɔ kutsue i sikpã gu i sikpã teterea gu inyagalagu nɛ loabo-ɔ ame. Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika. <verse eid="EZK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16" />Si losese kukãsiare lɛ mirɛ̃ mɛ loɖue fiɛ miwɔra ira awe ne, loapɛ me si lowɔra mi. Nto loakpadzɛ̃ kukãsiare lobɔ loledza ibɔ i mi iso fiɛ loatuĩdza mi araɖea ina siri. <verse eid="EZK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17" />Loto loasese kukãsiare gu kuputubɔi nyanyariã i fɔ iso fiɛ maabara-ɔ aisibawe ɔbi. Kukpakpi gu imaiferekarɔ̃ aaba-ɔ iso fiɛ loakpadzɛ̃ ipɛmi losia-ɔ iso. Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika."<verse eid="EZK 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Israel Abe Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsese me kanya mama sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, su fɔ anɔ nyɔ Israel abe isɛ; si aɖikanya ata aya i wã iso <verse eid="EZK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3" />si aɣɛ sɔ, 'O Israel abe, minɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso itɔ̃me. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣere abe gu abemi, kuwɛlagbolomi gu kugbolomi sɔ: Ka nto loba loakpadzɛ̃ ipɛmi losia i mi iso fiɛ loawɔra mi kusɔrɛkɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4" />Mato mabibiɛ mi isɔrɛkusege fiɛ maakɔtɛ mi kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã isɔrɛkusege, fiɛ loaɖue mi maturi i mi arapɔa katɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5" />Loto loarara Israel makpise kuturidziri i ma arapɔa katɔ̃. Ne loasamera mi akui lofere loki lolɔ mi isɔrɛkusege. <verse eid="EZK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6" />Mato maawɔra mi simagɛ̃ dzɛ i kakɔi karere ga misi fiɛ maawɔra kusɔrɛkɔ̃. Mato maawɔra mi isɔrɛkusege, maakɔtɛ mi arapɔa mawɔra wã fiɛ maabibiɛ mi isɔrɛkusege mafere i karɔ̃. Ne mato maawɔra ara wa mibara maɖi pelepele. <verse eid="EZK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7" />Mato maaɖue mi maturi mafere i karɔ̃ iso. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8" />" 'Ɣɛɛ nto lonyua mawɛ̃, ala mi mawɛ̃ to maatere i ipɛmi kanya si maɔsamera mi mapia i nrɔ̃ gu i nɖebi ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9" />Iyɔ i nɖebi mɛ ame maakɛlɛgu ma lɛ mafɔrɔĩ ne, mma lorui matere to maanyigi me. Mato maanyigi kumɛgɔ ibo me so, ala ma ɔtu wɔ loiki i ɔri ɔwɛ̃ iso fiɛ mapɛ mafiriki i wũ kɔrɛ, fiɛ ku ma anɔmi ne mawe ɔrakolo matã ma arapɔa. Mato maatsiri ma mɔmɔ so ala iranyanyariã nɛ maɔbara gu ma anyanya kubarara ɔɖuɖu ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10" />Ne mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, loifura sɔ loakpadzɛ̃ kukpakpi gɔgbe lobɔ i ma iso siefe.<verse eid="EZK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11" />" ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Pɛ arɔ̃kpasa si atutuĩ fɔ ngba i karɔ̃ si abiɛ ku kulu "Ndzo mitã mi!" ala Israel kaɖe ɔtile gu anyanya kubarara iti. Ala mato maarɔ̃ kakpã i ipɛmi kanya, kukãsiare gu i inyɛpɛ̃ nrɔɔ̃ ame ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12" />Nwɔ i kadzorokɔ̃ to ɔ̃akpi ala inyɛpɛ̃ iti, ne nwɔ i kakotekɔ̃ to ɔ̃arɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya. Nwɔ lona ngbã fiɛ manyua wũ ne ɔto ɔ̃akpi ala kukãsiare iti. Ne ɔso ngbɔ nto loaɖi wũ sikpã teterea losia i ma iso ne. <verse eid="EZK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13" />Ne mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, si ma maturi ɔkpi marɛ i ma arapɔa ndɛ̃ maki malɔ wã isɔrɛkusege, gu i kabemi biara gu abe atititɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso, kudziri siare ku akpai biara kayirinɔ gu oɖum siare ku ayata kɔrɛ - nkɔi mɛ masɔrɛ kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã matã ma arapɔa ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14" />Ne loaɖi wũ kɔrɔ̃ losia i ma iso fiɛ loatã karɔ̃ ɔkpese ikpakpi ita i fafuĩ ame ikɛlɛ Dibla - kakɔi karere ga masi. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' "<verse eid="EZK 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Kawirikɔ̃ Ɔɔbore Kabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣere Israel karɔ̃ ne: Kawirikɔ̃! Kawirikɔ̃ ɔɔba i karɔ̃ siɣokã ana iso. <verse eid="EZK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3" />Kawirikɔ̃ ɔɔba i mi iso fiɛ nto loaɖi wũ sikpã lofere i mi iso. Nto loaɣɛgu mi itɔ̃me i mi nsɛgbai kanya fiɛ loati mi kuso i mi anyanya kubarara ɔɖuɖu iti. <verse eid="EZK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4" />Loito loanyɔ mi nnya ɣee lonyua mi, gbaã nto loabara mi lotikuso i mi nsɛgbai iti gu i anyanya kubarara gɔ i mi ndɛ̃ iti. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5" />"Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Kukpakpi! Ngɔ mainɔ - manɔ, kukpakpi to kuba. <verse eid="EZK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6" />Kawirikɔ̃ ɔɔba! Kawirikɔ̃ ɔɔba! Kaɔtara so kaɣɛ-ɔ iso. Kaɔba! <verse eid="EZK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7" />Kukpakpi ɔɔba i mi iso - mi ma nsi i karɔ̃ iso. Ɔwi ɔɔba, iyi ɔɔbore ibo, ifɔ̃ mpia i abe iso, iiɖe isoɣɔ. <verse eid="EZK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8" />Ka nto loba loaɖi wũ sikpã teterea kayi i mi iso fiɛ loasia sikpã i mi iso. Loto loaɣɛgu mi itɔ̃me i mi nsɛgbai kanya fiɛ nto loabara mi lotikuso i mi anyanya kubarara ɔɖuɖu iti. <verse eid="EZK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9" />Loibanyɔ mi nnya ɣee lonyua mi. Nto loabara mi lotikuso i mi nsɛgbai kanya gu i anyanya kubarara gɔ i mi ndɛ̃. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mme nsɛ lowuĩ mi ikama.<verse eid="EZK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10" />"Iyi ka ipia i ngbe! Iɔba!. Kukpakpi ɔbiɛ kufere, ɔdziri ɔɔre anɔmi, iteso ɔɔɣɔ̃ aɣɔ̃la! <verse eid="EZK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11" />Amumuɣɔ ɔɔmɔ akpese ibɔradziri wɔ loakpadzɛ̃ ɔtile kutsue, ɔturi kuwɛ̃ iibabɔrɛ i kame, kuwɛ̃ i iturikuri ame iibabɔrɛ i kame - karana kukawɛ̃, kuira nɛ lofɔkuɣa iibabɔrɛ i kame. <verse eid="EZK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12" />Ɔwi ɔɔɣo, iyi ɔɔba iabo. Midaatã nwɔ loɣa ara si ɔna isoɣɔ ɣee nwɔ lorɔdɛ̃ ara si ɔmararã so, alasɔ sikpã teterea kasisia i iturikuri ɔɖuɖu iso. <verse eid="EZK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13" />Nwɔ lorɔdɛ̃ karɔ̃ iibafɔ kã ayi kumɛgɔ i ma inyɔ ɔɖuɖu pia ngbã, alasɔ kaɖikate ise i iturikuri ɔɖuɖu iso iibakpese kama. Ala ma akpi iti ɔso ne kuwɛ̃ iibana ngbã i ma ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14" />Atoasɔ masɛ mafɛ̃ kadadã fiɛ masɛ maledza ara matã kakpã ne, kuwɛ̃ iisɛ ɔkɛlɛ kakpã alasɔ wũ sikpã teterea sia i iturikuri ɔɖuɖu iso.<verse eid="EZK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutsueikpadzɛ̃ Israel i Akpi Iti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15" />"Ipɛmi pia i inyamɔ fiɛ inyɛpɛ̃ gu kukãsiare to i ayo ame. Mma i karɔ̃ ame to maakpi i ipɛmi kanya, ne mma i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame to maakpi ala kukãsiare gu inyɛ̃pɛ̃ iti. <verse eid="EZK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16" />Mma ɔɖuɖu lona ngbã fiɛ matere ne, mato maawe i abe iso. Mato maatɔrɛ̃ lɛ kugbolomi ame mabɔrɔnuma, ɔbiara ala ɔ̃ akpi ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17" />Kɔrɔ̃ biara to kuafɛ̃, ne igɛgɛ̃ biara to iati lɛ ndu. <verse eid="EZK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18" />Mato maapia ipundusikoto fiɛ maapia itiikpakpa lɛ arapia. Kunuarɛ to kuafu i ma ntɔ̃ fiɛ maakparɛ̃ ma ati. <verse eid="EZK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19" />Mato maafuĩdza ma sikãfudza masɛ i sivurã iso, ne ma sikãrɛtɛa aakpese ira nɛ loisekele. Ma sikãrɛtɛa gu sikãfudza iibaɖi ma ku <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sikpã teterea iyi. Maibawo ma kukã ɔnidza ɣee mayira ma ayiri alasɔ iɔtã ma marɔ̃ mabo i ikpi iso. <verse eid="EZK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20" />Mate so ku ma akɛrɛra wa nto alɛnyɔ fiɛ masu wã mabara arapɔa nyanyariã gu kumiamia. Ne ɔso nto loafirikira nwagbe ira nɛ loisekele lotã ma. <verse eid="EZK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21" />Nto loasu wã lotã mafɔ lɛ kakpãramɔɛã gu lɛ ara wa mayu lotã karɔ̃ iso matilese, ne mato maapukutura wã. <verse eid="EZK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22" />Loto loapɛ wũ anɔmi lofirikira i ma iso, ne mato maapia wũ kasɛkɔ̃ nyaa ɔgu. Mayukukpe to maabo i ne ame mapia ne ɔgu.<verse eid="EZK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23" />"Miledza kugbagɔrɔĩ misɛ, alasɔ karɔ̃ ɔyigu ima fiɛ ɔmagɛ̃siare ɔyigu amumuɣɔ. <verse eid="EZK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24" />Nto loakpadzɛ̃ nɖebi maturi ma nɖe matilese maɖo lobɔ si mafɔ ma ayo. Loto loatuĩdza masiare iteso, ne maapukutura ma kusumukɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25" />Si itiikpakpa ɔba ne, mato maabie isobuɛ ɣɛɛ maibana kuiwɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26" />Kukpakpi i kukpakpi iso to kuaba, ɔwiri ame atɔ̃me i ɔwiri ame atɔ̃me iso to aaba. Mato maapia kubɛ si mana kaɖikate mabɔrɛgu i Ɣaa kanyaɖidze kɔrɛ, sɔrɛdze mmara ite to iayu, lɛ kumɛgɔ i makpakpa kuka itã to kuayu. <verse eid="EZK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27" />Igara to ɔ̃amararã so, igarabirɛrɛĩ to ɔ̃ayu ɔriinyɔ. Ne karɔ̃ iso maturi nrɔɔ̃ to miati mikpakpa. Nto loabara ma i ma nsɛgbai kanya fiɛ i ma mɔmɔ asɛra kanya loaɣɛgu ma atɔ̃me. Iyɔ ne mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>."<verse eid="EZK 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Iɣɔsɔrɛ i Isɔrɛyo Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1" />Iyi ruva i kuwa kuɔva i ikɔ kuɔva ame ne, gɔ lokpase losɛ i wũ iyo ne Yuda makpakpa ɔsɛ i wũ anɔmi ame. Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso kɔrɔ̃ ɔsia i wũ iso i mmɔ. <verse eid="EZK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2" />Lonyɔ, ne lonya ira nɛ lonyɔ lɛ ɔturi awune. Kakɔi ga lonyɔ lɛ ɔ̃ ɔsɔ ikɛlɛ karɔ̃ ne ɔse lɛ ɔtɔ, ne ita i mmɔ ikɛlɛ kato ne ɔ̃ kuseme ɔnyɔ lɛ ibɔra ifiɛ awe. <verse eid="EZK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3" />Ɔɖi ira nɛ lonyɔ lɛ kɔrɔ̃ ne ɔmɔɛ̃ me ku wũ iti siwɛrɛ̃. Siwarã ɔtara me kato sipia i karɔ̃ gu kato ndɛ̃. Ne i Ɣaa kuɖikute ame ne ɔkɔ me ɔkɛlɛgu i Yerusalem, i kame kasarɛkɔ̃ katikpe kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya, ngbegɔ i irapɔa nɛ nsɛ itara sirerɛ ibɔ ɔya. <verse eid="EZK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4" />Israel Ɣaa ikpawaĩ ɔwe i wũ anɔ ame i mmɔ, lɛ i kaɖikate ga loɔnya i katɛfɛkɔ̃ awe.<verse eid="EZK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5" />Kere ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, nyɔ katikpe isɛ." Ne ɔso lonyɔ, ne i kabɔrɛnya ga i isɔrɛkasege kayogodɔ̃ katikpe ne lonya sirerɛ irapɔa.<verse eid="EZK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6" />Ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ato anya nnɛ mato mabara - anyanyara wa i Israel kaɖe to mabara i ngbe, ara wa loarera me kama dzoroo i wũ isɔrɛyo kɔrɛ? Ɣɛɛ ato aanya ara wa lonyanyarĩ kɔraa aɖo."<verse eid="EZK 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7" />Ne ka ɔkɔ me ɔbɔ kasarɛkɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya. Lonyɔ ne lonya iyoi i ibere ame. <verse eid="EZK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8" />Ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, kiniɔ ne ɖi iwo i ibere ame." Ne ɔso loɖi iwo i ibere ame ne lonya kabɔrɛnya i mmɔ.<verse eid="EZK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9" />Ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Bo i kame si asɛ aanyɔ ɔtile gu anyanyara wa mato mabara i ngbe." <verse eid="EZK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10" />Ne ɔso lokɛlɛ kame ne lonyɔ, ne lonya sɔ mapɔ ara agbãagbã wa nto akpɛ̃ i karɔ̃ gu anyanya mabɔi gu Israel kaɖe arapɔa ɔɖuɖu i abere iso. <verse eid="EZK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11" />Ara wagbe katɔ̃ ne Israel kaɖe makpakpa sikɔdzɛ ɔya, ne Safan ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yaazania ɔya i ma ndɛ̃. Ma ɔbiara ɔla kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã iwɛwɛrɛ̃bui i kɔrɔ̃, ne kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã kuyɔ to kuta kukɛlɛ kato.<verse eid="EZK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12" />Ɔɣere me sɔ,"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɔɔnya nnɛ i Israel kaɖe makpakpa ɔbiara to ɔbara i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ irapɔa katɔ̃ i idududu ame? Masɛ maɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iisɛ ɔnya bo, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsɛ̃ karɔ̃.' " <verse eid="EZK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13" />Ana ne, ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ato aanya ma mato mabara ara wa lonyanyarĩ kɔraa aɖo."<verse eid="EZK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14" />Kere ne ɔkɔ me ɔkɛlɛgu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyo katikpe kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya, ne lonya marɔ̃go si i mmɔ, mato mabiɛ Tamuz.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tamuz: Ma Babilonse kuɣɔ gɔ losɛ kutã marɔ̃go ɔɣe mabi. </char></note> <verse eid="EZK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15" />Ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ato anya nnɛgbe? Ato aanya ara wa lonyanyarĩ kɔraa aɖo nnɛgbe."<verse eid="EZK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16" />Kere ne ka ɔkɔ me ɔbogu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> isɔrɛyo kame kasarɛkɔ̃. Marɛrɛ̃ lɛ sinyɔ-iru ɔwe i pato gu isɔrɛkasege ndɛ̃ i isɔrɛyo kabɔrɛnya i mmɔ. Mapɛ ma kama masɔ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> isɔrɛyo ne ma ntɔ̃ to minyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃, mato mabɔ ati karɔ̃ matã kuɣɛ̃ i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ.<verse eid="EZK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17" />Ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔɔnya nnɛgbe, ɔturi awune ɔbi? Ira koso iɖe sɔ Yuda iyo to mabara anyanyara wa mato mabara i ngbe? Ikote sɔ maala maɔbara amumuɣɔ i karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso, makɛlɛ i katɔ̃ mapia me sikpã? Nyɔ kumɛgɔ mato matia me nyanyarĩ mapia me sikpã! <verse eid="EZK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18" />Ne ɔso loto loabara ma ku sikpã. Loibanyɔ ma nnya ɣee lonyua lotsɛ ma. Atoasɔ mato kulu ta i wũ atsue ame kɔraa ne loibakã ma atsue."<verse eid="EZK 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Maɖue Maɣɔsɔrɛse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1" />Kere ne lonɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkpere ku silɔ teteree sɔ, "Mikɔ ɔmagɛ̃siare madzuɛ̃se mibɔ i ngbe. Ma ɔbiara si ɔla ikpira i kɔrɔ̃." <verse eid="EZK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2" />Ne lonya marɛrɛ̃ ikuɔ ɔbɔrɛ i Kakpagɛkɔ̃ kayogodɔ̃ isɛ, nga nto kanyɔ katikpe isɛ, ne ma ɔbiara ɔla ikpira i kɔrɔ̃ ame maba. Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ wɔ lopia ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa ara fiɛ iratsɛrɛra ɔkoto ɔse i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ ɔwe i ma ndɛ̃. Mabo i kame ne maya i ayiwa isɔrɛkasege kuruɛ.<verse eid="EZK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3" />Kiniɔ ne Israel Ɣaa ikpawaĩ ɔbɔrɛ ikɛlɛ kato i makerubi kato, i ngbegɔ iɔse, ne ka ikɛlɛ isɔrɛyo kabɔrɛnya. Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkpere ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ lopia ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa ara fiɛ ɔwe iratsɛrɛra ɔkoto i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Kɛlɛ aaki i Yerusalem ɔmagɛ̃siare ɔɖuɖu ame si asɛ, mma ɔɖuɖu nto mamararã so fiɛ mato sipini i anyanyara ɔɖuɖu wa mato mabara i ɔ̃ ame iti, ikparĩ i ma ntɔ̃."<verse eid="EZK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5" />Gɔ ame nto lokãatsue ne, ɔɣere mamama sɔ, "Misiai wũ si miɖue maturi i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame, midaanyɔ kuwɛ̃ nnya ɣee midaabara wũ kayiribielea. <verse eid="EZK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6" />Miɖue marɛrɛ̃kpakpa, maporoporoi gu mabitɛ, marɔ̃go gu mabiɛtɛ, ɣɛɛ midaaɖue kuwɛ̃ wɔ masɛ ikpo. Misɛ ne karɔ̃ i wũ isɔrɛyo ame." Ne ɔso masɛ karɔ̃ ne maɖue makpakpa ma lowe i isɔrɛyo katɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7" />Kere ne ɔɣere ma sɔ, "Mipukutura isɔrɛyo si misu maturi ma lokpi miyira kusarɛkɔ̃. "Mikɛlɛ!" Ne ɔso makɛlɛ ne masɛ maturi iɖue karɔ̃ iki i ɔmagɛ̃siare ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="EZK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8" />Gɔ mato maɖue maturi fiɛ ikuti wũ ɔnɔwɛ̃ ne, lorɔ̃ losu anɔ lofu i karɔ̃, lobiɛ teteree loɣɛ sɔ, "Ao, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso! Ato aawɔra Israel maturi ma lokuti ɔɖuɖu i fɔ sikpã teterea dzɛ aɖi afere i Yerusalem iso ame?"<verse eid="EZK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9" />Ɔtã me mmuai sɔ, "Israel iyo gu Yuda ikpi ɔɔfe imɔ, karɔ̃ ɔyigu ima ne ɔmagɛ̃siare ɔyigu itɔ̃me idaaɣɛ i ɔri iso. Masɛ maɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsɛ̃ karɔ̃, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iisɛ ɔnya.' <verse eid="EZK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10" />Ne ɔso loibanyɔ ma ku nnya ɣee lonyua lotsɛ ma, ɣɛɛ loakpadzɛ̃ nnɛ mabara losia i ma mɔmɔ ati iso."<verse eid="EZK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11" />Kere ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ mpia ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa arapia ku iratsɛrɛra ɔkoto i ɔ̃ kuruɛ ɔkpesegu itɔ̃me ɔbɔ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Loɔbara lɛ kumɛgɔ aɣɛ."<verse eid="EZK 9:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bosate Ikpawaĩ Ɔrui i Isɔrɛyo Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1" />Lonyɔ, ne lonya nnɛ lonyɔ lɛ itafɔkuɣa safir sigarakaɖekɔ̃ i igbado nɛ mpia i makerubi ati kato. <verse eid="EZK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ lopia ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa arapia sɔ, "Kɛlɛ kukai ndɛ̃ i makerubi kayirinɔ. Ɖi atɔgirĩ wa lowara ato i makerubi ndɛ̃ yira i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame bɔrɛgu si asamera wã afere i ɔmagɛ̃siare iso." Ne gɔ nto lonyɔ ne, ɔkɛlɛ kame.<verse eid="EZK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3" />Kiniɔ ne makerubi ɔya i isɔrɛyo kagbalɔ ibaba isɛ, ku i ɔwi wɔ i ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ ɔkɛlɛ kame. Ne idɔdɔ ɔyi i kame kasarɛkɔ̃ ame ne. <verse eid="EZK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ ɔta i makerubi kato ne isɛ ikɛlɛ isɔrɛyo kabɔrɛnya. Idɔdɔ ɔyi i isɔrɛyo ame, ne kasarɛkɔ̃ ɔyigu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ ifiɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5" />Mato mawo makerubi abue ipɛ silɔ ɔnɔ ta kuruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃, gɔ sire lɛ Ɣaa Ɔlesate silɔ awe si ɔsɛ ɔɖeika.<verse eid="EZK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6" />Ɔwi wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖisilɔ ɔtã ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ i ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa arapia ame sɔ, "Ɖi ɔtɔ bɔrɛgu i makerubi ndɛ̃ i kukai ndɛ̃ ne," ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔsɛ ɔkɛlɛ ɔ̃aya i kakai kɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7" />Kere ne makerubi ndɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ ɔɖi ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ ɔpia i ɔtɔ wɔ lowe i ma ndɛ̃ ame. Ɔɖi ɔtɔ̃ ɔwɛ̃ ne ɔsu ɔpia i ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ lopia ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa arapia nrɔɔ̃ ame. Ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔfɔ ɔtɔ ne ɔbɔrɛ ne. <verse eid="EZK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:8" />(Maawo ira nɛ lonyɔ lɛ ɔturi nrɔɔ̃ ɔnya i makerubi abue kayirinɔ.)<verse eid="EZK 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9" />Lonyɔ, ne lonya kukai kuna i makerubi iso, kakai kawɛ̃ ɔwe i kerubi biara isɛ. Kukai to kufiɛ lɛ itafɔkuɣa nɛ marɔ sɔ Kirisolit. <verse eid="EZK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10" />Ma ina ɔɖuɖu ɔre so i ma kuseme kanya, ɔbiara ɔnyɔ lɛ kakai losakanya ku kakai mama. <verse eid="EZK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11" />Si mato masɛ ne, masɛ makɛlɛ kusɛ kuna karere isɛ i ngbegɔ i makerubi to manyɔ. Kukai iisɛ kupɛ kufiriki si makerubi to makɛlɛ. Makerubi sɛ makɛlɛ kasɛ karere ga i ma ati to anyɔ, gɔ maisɛ mapɛ mafiriki gɔ mato makɛlɛ. <verse eid="EZK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12" />Anɔmi ɔyi ma kuturidziri ɔɖuɖu iso, ibua i ma kama, ma nrɔɔ̃ gu abue iso pelepele ɔyigu anɔmi, ngbɔ ame i ma kukai kuna ɔyigu anɔmi ne. <verse eid="EZK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13" />Lonɔ mato makpere kukai sɔ, "kagbadadururu kukai." <verse eid="EZK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14" />Kerubi biara ɔwe ntɔ̃ mina: Katɔ̃ kawɛ̃ ɔɖe nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ kare, katɔ̃ nyɔare ɔɖe ɔturi awune kare, katɔ̃ tɛare ɔɖe dzata kare, ne katɔ̃ naare ɔɖe finikpo kare.<verse eid="EZK 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15" />Kere ne makerubi ɔta makɛlɛ kato. Nwagbe loɖe ara wa mba ngbã wa loɔnya i Kebar Ɔwore kɔrɛ ne. <verse eid="EZK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16" />Si makerubi ɔsɛ ne, kukai gɔ i ma ababa ɔsɛ, ne si makerubi ɔwarɛ ma abue gɔ maata i karɔ̃ ne, kukai iirui i ma ababa iso. <verse eid="EZK 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17" />Si makerubi ɔya kaa ne, kukai ana ɔya kpoo, si makerubi ɔta ne, kukai ana ɔtagu ma, alasɔ ara wa mba ngbã siwarã ɔwe i kɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ ɔrui i isɔrɛyo kabɔrɛnya kato ne ituĩ i makerubi kato. <verse eid="EZK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19" />Gɔ nto lonyɔ ne, makerubi ɔwarɛ ma abue ne mata i karɔ̃, ne gɔ makɛlɛ ne kukai ana ɔkɛlɛgu ma. Matuĩ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyo kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya, ne Israel Ɣaa ikpawaĩ ɔwe i ma kato.<verse eid="EZK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20" />Nwagbe loɖe ara wa mba ngbã wa loɔnya, i Israel Ɣaa kayirinɔ i Kebar Ɔwore kuruɛ. Ne lotsue sɔ ma loɖe makerubi ne. <verse eid="EZK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21" />Ma ɔbiara ɔwe ntɔ̃ mina gu abue ana ne i ma abue kayirinɔ ne ira ɔwe nɛ lonyɔ lɛ ɔturi awune nrɔɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22" />Ma ntɔ̃ ɔwe kuseme lɛ mma loɔnya i Kebar Ɔwore kɔrɛ kure. Ma ɔbiara ɔkɛlɛ katɔ̃ siĩ.<verse eid="EZK 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bosate Ɔɣɛ Kutsueikpadzɛ̃ Gɔ Loaba i Yerusalem Maɖeisoi Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1" />Kere ne Siwarã ɔkɔlɛ me kato sikɔ me sibɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyo kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. Marɛrɛ̃ sinyɔ-iru ɔwe i kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya i mmɔ. Lonya Azur ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yaazania gu Benaya ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Pelatia, ma loɖe maturi matɔ̃ɖedze i ma ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, " Ɔturi awune ɔbi, mmagbe nɖe marɛrɛ̃ ma nto mabara adzuni nyanyariã fiɛ mato matã maturi ɔtile kuka, i ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔgbe ame ne. <verse eid="EZK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3" />Masɛ maɣɛ sɔ, 'Ikuti kɛkɛĩ boto boatsue ayo. Ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔgbe nɖe iwabui, fiɛ bo nɖe sina ne.' <verse eid="EZK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4" />Ne ɔso ɖikanya ta ya i ma iso, ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya."<verse eid="EZK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Siwarã ɔba i wũ iso, ne siɣere me sɔ loɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ: Nnɛmɔ ato aɣɛ, Israel iyo, ɣɛɛ loɣe nnɛ nto iki i mi adzuni ame. <verse eid="EZK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6" />Miɔɖue maturi gbodzoo i ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔgbe ame, ne miɔyira ɔ̃ sivurã ku makpise.<verse eid="EZK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7" />"Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Maturi kuturidziri gɔ miɔfuĩdza misɛ i mmɔ nɖe sina ne, ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔgbe nɖe iwabui, ɣɛɛ nto loasa mi loɖi i ɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8" />Misɛ minigã ipɛmi, ne ipɛmi nɖe ira nɛ loabɔ i mi iso, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9" />Loto loasa mi loɖi i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame losu mi lopia i mafɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame si makpadzɛ̃ mi kutsue. <verse eid="EZK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10" />Mito miarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya, ne loakpadzɛ̃ mi kutsue i Israel karɔ̃ ta i ame iso. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="EZK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11" />Ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔgbe iibaɖe iwabui itã mi, ɣee miibakpese sina i ɔ̃ ame. Loto loakpadzɛ̃ mi kutsue i Israel karɔ̃ kame ku kã kume iso. <verse eid="EZK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12" />Ne mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, alasɔ miisɛ i wũ asɛ̃ra iso ɣee miimɔɛ̃ wũ mmara mila ɣɛɛ misiai nɖebi mɛ loki milɔ mi asɛra iso."<verse eid="EZK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13" />Kiniɔ gɔ lola loɔɖikanya ne, Benaya ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Pelatia ɔkpi. Kere ne lorɔ̃ lofu anɔ i karɔ̃ ne lolakulu teteree sɔ, "Ao, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso! Ato aawɔra Israel maturi ma lokuti pelepele aɖi?"<verse eid="EZK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Kaɣɛkasɛ i Mafɔrɔĩ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, fɔ manyii - fɔ manyii ma nɖe ima iwɛ̃ gu Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu - nɖe mma iso i Yerusalem maturi ɔɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Madzoro kaɖu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ. Bo masu karɔ̃ gagbe matã lɛ bo kare.'<verse eid="EZK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16" />"Ne ɔso ɣɛ sɔ, '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Atoasɔ losese ma dzoroo i nɖebi ndɛ̃ fiɛ losamera ma lopia i nrɔ̃ ame ne, ɣɛɛ ɔwi kɛkɛĩ ne loɖe kasekelekɔ̃ lotã ma i nrɔ̃ mɛ ame makɛlɛ.'<verse eid="EZK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17" />"Ne ɔso ɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Nto loasa mi kanya lobɔrɛgu i nɖebi mɛ ame miɔsame mipia, lokpesegu mi lobɔ fiɛ loasu Israel karɔ̃ lotã mi ana.'<verse eid="EZK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18" />"Mato maakpese maba i kã iso fiɛ maaɖi kã kumiamia nyanyariã gu anyanya arapɔa ɔɖuɖu i kã iso. <verse eid="EZK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19" />Nto loatã ma ɔtu wɔ nsɛ ɔki ɔri ɔwɛ̃ fiɛ loasu siwarã ɣɛtɛ lopia i ma ame. Loto loaɖi ɔtu wɔ mba ɔle lɛ ita i ma ame fiɛ loatã ma ɔtu wɔ loɣɔ lɛ sina. <verse eid="EZK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20" />Iyɔ mato maasiai wũ asɛ̃ra fiɛ maamɔɛ̃ wũ mmara mala kukaakɔ. Mato maaɖe wũ maturi fiɛ Mme wũ loaɖe ma Ɣaa. <verse eid="EZK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21" />Ɣɛɛ mma losu ma situ masia i kumiamia nyanyariã gu anyanya arapɔa iso ne, loto loakpadzɛ̃ nnɛ mabara losia i ma mɔmɔ ati iso, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ."<verse eid="EZK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22" />Kere ne makerubi, ku kukai i ma ababa, ɔwarɛ ma abue, ne Israel Ɣaa ikpawaĩ ɔwe i ma kato. <verse eid="EZK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ ɔta ibɔrɛ i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame ikɛlɛ kato, ne ituĩ i kube kato i ɔmagɛ̃siare kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24" />I kaɖikate ga i Ɣaa Siwarã ɔtã me ame ne, Siwarã ɔkɔlɛ me kato ne sikɔ me sikɛlɛgu i mafɔrɔĩ kɔrɛ i Babilonia ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 11:24">Kere ne kaɖikate ga loɔnya ɔrui i wũ kɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25" />Ne loɣere mafɔrɔĩ irabiara nɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔ̃ɔɖi ɔte me ne.<verse eid="EZK 11:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaɖidze Ɔse Lɛ Ɔfɔrɔĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, maturi ma mba atsuele ndɛ̃ asi. Maba anɔmi maanya ara ɣɛɛ maisɛ manya fiɛ maba atsue maanɔ ara ɣɛɛ maisɛ manɔ, alasɔ maɖe atsuele maturi.<verse eid="EZK 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3" />"Ne ɔso ɔturi awune ɔbi, sira fɔ ara kanya itã kafɔrɔ̃ ame ikɛlɛ. Gɔ i maturi to manyɔ ku anɔwã ne, ɣo ɔri bɔrɛ i ngbegɔ asi si akɛlɛ kakɔi mama. Siainyɔ maturi to maanɔkarɔ̃, atoasɔ matsuelese kaɖe maɖe. <verse eid="EZK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4" />I ikpɛnɛ ame ne, gɔ mato manyɔ ne, ɖi fɔ ara wa ɔɔsirakanya itã kafɔrɔ̃ ame ikɛlɛ, bɔ i inyamɔ. Iyɔ kutsuɛ ne, gɔ mato manyɔ ne, ɣo ɔri kɛlɛ lɛ mma nsɛ makɛlɛ kafɔrɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5" />Gɔ ame mato manyɔ ne, ɖi iyoi kigu i ibere ame, si aɖi fɔ ara abɔrɛgu i iyoi ame. <verse eid="EZK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6" />Su wã sia i fɔ imɔiti gɔ mato manyɔ si asore wã abɔrɛgu ku kumɛgɔ ito ibara fulufulu. Fu fɔ katɔ̃ ara si aibanya karɔ̃, alasɔ loɔsu-ɔ lobara ikparĩ lotã Israel kaɖe."<verse eid="EZK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7" />Ne ɔso lobara lɛ kumɛgɔ maɖisilɔ matã me. Ikpɛnɛ ame loɖi wũ ara wa losakanya lotã kafɔrɔ̃ ame ikɛlɛ lobɔ i inyamɔ. Iyɔ kutsuɛ ne loɖi iyoi i ibere ame ku wũ nrɔɔ̃. Losu wũ ara losia i wũ amɔiti iso lobɔrɛgu si kato ibara fulufulu, gɔ maturi to manyɔ.<verse eid="EZK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me ku kaya sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, atsuele Israel kaɖe iikarɛ-ɔ sɔ, 'Be ato abara ɣɛɛ?'<verse eid="EZK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10" />"Ɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Itɔ̃me nɛgbe ɔpɛgu Yerusalem tɔ̃ɖedze gu Israel iyo ɔɖuɖu ma mpia i mmɔ.' <verse eid="EZK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11" />Ɣere ma sɔ, 'Loɖe ikparĩ lotã mi.'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 12:11">"Lɛ kumɛgɔ loɔbara ne, kumɛɔ mato maabara ma ne. Mato maakɛlɛ kafɔrɔ̃ iso lɛ mayorɛdze.<verse eid="EZK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12" />"Tɔ̃ɖedze wɔ mpia i ma ndɛ̃ to ɔ̃asu ɔ̃ ara ɔsia i imɔiti, ɔrui si kaɖe kato kabara fulufulu. Ne mato maaɖi iyoi i ibere ame matã wũ ɔki i kame. Ɔto ɔ̃afu ɔ̃ katɔ̃ ara si ɔ̃ibanya karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13" />Loto loawarɛ wũ asabu losɛ wũ, ne wũ iyebi to iamɔɛ̃ wũ. Loakɔ wũ lobɔ i Babilonia, ma Kaldease karɔ̃ iso, ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ibanya kã, ne ɔto ɔ̃akpi i mmɔ. <verse eid="EZK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14" />Loto loasamera mma ɔɖuɖu loki malɔ wũ lopia i kakɔi biara - ɔ̃ marabaradze gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu - loatere losiai ma ku ipɛmi.<verse eid="EZK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15" />"Si loɔfuĩdza ma lopia i nɖebi ndɛ̃ fiɛ losamera ma lopia i nrɔ̃ ame ne, mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="EZK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16" />Ɣɛɛ nto loanyɔ maturi kɛkɛĩ nnya loɖi ma i ipɛmi kanya, kukãsiare gu inyɛpɛ̃ ame, si maafɔ nrɔ̃ mɛ ame maakɛlɛ anyanya kubarara mapia i kame. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>."<verse eid="EZK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itiikpakpa Kanyaɖidze Ikparĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, tikpakpa gɔ ato aɖe fɔ aɖera, si ayasoiso ku ifɔ̃ gɔ ato anɛ ndu.<verse eid="EZK 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19" />Ɣere maturi ma i karɔ̃ iso sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ i mma nsi i Yerusalem gu mma i Israel karɔ̃ ame sɔ: Mato maayasoiso maaɖe ma aɖera fiɛ maanɛ ndu ku ɔriiyu, alasɔ irabiara to iaro i ma karɔ̃ ame ala mma ɔɖuɖu nsi i mmɔ ɔtile ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20" />Mato maawɔra simagɛ̃ dzɛ ame i maturi ɔsɛ, ne karɔ̃ to kaakpese ikpakpi. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne.' "<verse eid="EZK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, be ɔso maturi sɛ mapɛ igbã nɛgbe i Israel karɔ̃ iso sɔ, 'Ɔwi sɛ ɔfe ne kaɖikate biara iisɛ kabɔ kuira'? <verse eid="EZK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23" />Ɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Nto loabɔ igbã nɛgbe i kawirikɔ̃, iyɔ maisibapɛ ne i Israel karɔ̃ iso.' Ɣere ma sɔ, 'Ɔwi ɔɔbore ɔbo gɔ i kaɖikate biara to kaaba i kame. <verse eid="EZK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24" />Ala ne mila kuɖikute iisibawe ɣee kanyamɛrɛ̃ sibɔipɛ iisibawe i Israel maturi ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25" />Ɣɛɛ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nto loaɣɛ nnɛ loaɣɛ, ne ito iaba i kame gɔ iibadzroo. Ala i mi atsuele iyo ɔwi ame ne, loatã ibiara nɛ loɣɛ ɔba i kame, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ.' "<verse eid="EZK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, Israel kaɖe sɛ maɣɛ sɔ, 'I Kaɖikate ga ɔsɛ ɔnya ne, kase katã akɔ gbodzoo ita i kiniɔ, ne ɔsɛ ɔɖikanya ɔsegu i kɔrãkaɖe ame dzoroo iso.'<verse eid="EZK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28" />"Ne ɔso ɣere ma sɔ, '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Wũ itɔ̃me kuiwɛ̃ iisibasɛ kama ana. Itɔ̃me irere nɛ loɣɛ to iaba i kame, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ.' "<verse eid="EZK 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Mila Kanyamaɖidze Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya ta ya i Israel kanyamaɖidze ma ka nto maɖikanya kiniɔ iso. Ɣere mma nsɛ maɖikanya ku ma mɔmɔ adzuni sɔ, 'Minɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me! <verse eid="EZK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ndzo mitã madzunisɛĩ kanyamaɖidze ma nsɛ masiai ma mɔmɔ siwarã fiɛ mainya kuira! <verse eid="EZK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4" />O Israel, fɔ kanyamaɖidze se lɛ aboroi i akpakpi ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5" />Miiya mikɛlɛ miabara kuira i ibere kubiɛkɔ̃ iledza iso mitã Israel kaɖe. Miibuai ne sɔ iaya teteree i kakpã ame ku <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyi. <verse eid="EZK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6" />Ma kuɖikute ɖe kasɔla ne ma sibɔipɛ ɖe mila. Masɛ maɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔɣɛ sɔ," ku ɔwi wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iipia ma katɔ̃me. Ɣɛɛ mato manyɔ ɔri sɔ ma atɔ̃me si aba i kame. <verse eid="EZK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7" />Miɔnya kasɔla kuɖikute ne miɔɣɛ mila sibɔipɛ ku ɔwi wɔ miɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɣɛ," atoasɔ loiɖeika.<verse eid="EZK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8" />" 'Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ala mi kasɔla atɔ̃me gu mila kuɖikute ɔso ne, lota loɣɛ i mi iso, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9" />Wũ kɔrɔ̃ to kuata kuya i kanyamaɖidze ma nsɛ manya kasɔla kuɖikute fiɛ masɛ mapɛ mila sibɔ iso. Maibawe i wũ maturi isarɛ ikuri ndɛ̃ ɣee maibatsɛrɛ ma ayere mapia i Israel kaɖe ara ame, fiɛ maibabo i Israel karɔ̃ ame. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso.<verse eid="EZK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10" />" 'Ala masɛ makã wũ maturi mayura, mato maɣɛ sɔ, "Isobuɛ," ku ɔwi wɔ i isobuɛ na. Ana ne, ala si matsue ibere nɛ nna ɔle ne, masɛ makua ne ku kukua fudza. <verse eid="EZK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11" />Ne ɔso ɣere mma nsɛ makua ne ku kukua fudza sɔ ito iarɔ̃. Kado to ɔ̃aba teteree fiɛ loasese atumagirĩ fiɛ awɛ nyanyariã to aabɔrɛ aba. <verse eid="EZK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12" />Si ibere sɛ irɔ̃ ne, maturi iito maakarɛ-ɔ sɔ, "Lɛ i kukua fudza gɔ akua ne pia ɣɛɛ?"<verse eid="EZK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13" />" 'Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: I wũ sikpã teterea ame ne, nto loasese ɔwiri nyanyariã ne i wũ sikpã ame ne, loasese atumagirĩ ku kado wɔ loapɛ ku iwɔra sikpã. <verse eid="EZK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14" />Loto loabibiɛ ibere ne mikua ifudza fiɛ loabara ne parata ku karɔ̃ sɔ ibere ɔkaĩ aase wawe. Si isɛ irɔ̃ ne, mito miawɔ i ne ame, iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="EZK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15" />Ne ɔso nto loaɖi wũ sikpã losia i ibere iso gu i mma lokua ne ifudza iso. Loto loaɣere mi sɔ, "Ibere ka ikpa fiɛ ngbɔ ame i mma lokua ne ana ne. <verse eid="EZK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16" />Mma nɖe Israel kanyamaɖidze maladze, mma loɖikanya matã Yerusalem fiɛ manya isobuɛ kuɖikute matã wũ ku ɔwi wɔ i isobuɛ na ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ." '<verse eid="EZK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Kanyamaɖidzerɔ̃go Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17" />"Kiniɔ, ɔturi awune ɔbi, su fɔ anɔ si anyɔ marɔ̃go ma i fɔ maturi ame, mma nsɛ maɖikanya i ma mɔmɔ adzuni iso. Ɖikanya ta ya i ma iso <verse eid="EZK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18" />si aɣɛ sɔ, '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ndzo mitã marɔ̃go ma lobara awa sisɔbɛ mapia i nrɔɔtɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu. Ne mabara kudza kukarãme agbã matã ma ati si magbere maturi. Mito miapia wũ maturi ngbã i iyebi ame ɣɛɛ miledza mi mire? <verse eid="EZK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19" />Miɔpukutura me i wũ maturi ndɛ̃ ala kakpã arɔ̃kɔkɔ kɛkɛĩ gu boɖoboɖo kusɛi iti. Iki i kumɛgɔ misɛ mila mila mitã wũ maturi, mma nsɛ makã mila atɔ̃me atsue. Miɔɖue mma tee maibakpi ne miɔfɔ mma ikote sɔ maakpi mipia i ngbã ame ne.<verse eid="EZK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20" />" 'Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Lota loɣɛ i mi awa sisɔbɛ wa misu mito migbere maturi lɛ kurodzai, ne nto loakɛkɛ wã loɖi i mi nrɔɔ̃ iso. Nto loatã maturi ma migbere lɛ kurodzai ɔna iwarã. <verse eid="EZK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21" />Loto loakɛkɛ mi kudza loɖi fiɛ loaɖi wũ maturi i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame. Iyɔ wũ maturi iisibarɔ̃ mi awara ɔle ayebi. Kere ne mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="EZK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22" />Ala mibiɛ maturi bɔlɔlɔa situ ku mi mila, gɔ loibɔ ma isoma kuiwɛ̃ ɔso. Ala mipia matilese katetere si madaanyua ma siri nyanyariã si maaɖi ma ngbã ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23" />Ne ɔso miisibanya kasɔla kuɖikute ɣee miisibabara sibɔipɛ ara. Loto loaɖi wũ maturi lobɔrɛgu i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame. Iyɔ ne, mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' "<verse eid="EZK 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Ɔtã Maɣɔsɔrɛdze Ipɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1" />Israel makpakpa mawɛ̃ ɔba i wũ kɔrɛ ne makpase masɛ i wũ katɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, marɛrɛ̃ magbe ɔɔsu ma situ matã arapɔa ne masu ɔtile ira nɛ iso masɛ matura masɛ so i katɔ̃. Ilɛ sɔ loatã makarɛ me ira kɔraa ɣɛɛ? <verse eid="EZK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4" />Ne ɔso ɖe ma ika si aɣere ma sɔ, '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Si Israelse ɔrere ɔsu ɔ̃ ɔtu ɔtã arapɔa ne ɔsu ɔtile ira nɛ iso masɛ matura ɔsɛ so i katɔ̃ fiɛ ɔsɛ Ɣaa kanyaɖidze kɔrɛ ne, Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wũ mɔmɔ loatã wũ mmuai mɛ i ɔ̃ arapɔa isiai siare ɔkote atã. <verse eid="EZK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5" />Loto loabara nnɛgbe si loledza Israel maturi ma ɔɖuɖu loɔsɛ̃ me, ala ma arapɔa ɔso, situ ifɔ.'<verse eid="EZK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6" />"Ne ɔso ɣere Israel kaɖe sɔ, '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Mifiriki! Mibɔrɛ i mi arapɔa isɔrɛ ame si misɛ̃ mi kubarara nyanyariã ɔɖuɖu!<verse eid="EZK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7" />" 'Si Israel mabi ɣee ɔfɔ ɔrere wɔ nsi i Israel ɔɖi so ise i wũ kɔrɛ ne ɔsu ɔ̃ ɔtu ɔtã arapɔa fiɛ ɔsu ɔtile ira nɛ iso masɛ matura ɔsɛ so i anɔ, ne ɔsɛ Ɣaa kanyaɖidze kɔrɛ si ɔkarɛ me ira ne, Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wũ mɔmɔ loatã wũ mmuai. <verse eid="EZK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8" />Loto loaɖi wũ anɔ lokarã ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ iso fiɛ nto loasu wũ lobara itera ɣee sima itɔ̃me. Nto loaɖi wũ i wũ maturi ame. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9" />" 'Si masɔsɔla kanyaɖidze sɔ ɔɖikanya ne, Mme, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔtã kanyaɖidze wɔmɔ sɔ ɔlasila. Ɣɛɛ nto loaɖi wũ kɔrɔ̃ lota loya ɔ̃ iso lowɔra wũ loɖi i wũ maturi Israel ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10" />Mato maasore ma akpi - kanyaɖidze gu ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ losɛ ɔ̃ kɔrɛ pelepele ɔɣɛrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11" />Iyɔ Israel maturi iisibasɛnɛkɛ̃ i wũ ɔri iso ɣee maisibapukutura so ku ma akpi ɔɖuɖu mabua. Mato maaɖe wũ maturi fiɛ Mme wũ loaɖe ma Ɣaa. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ.' "<verse eid="EZK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutsueikpadzɛ̃ Gɔ Kanya Itere Na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, si kaɖe ɔbara me ikpi iki i ɔnukuare idaaɖe ame ne, loaɖi kɔrɔ̃ losia i kã iso fiɛ loatɛ̃ araɖea ina ɔri fiɛ loasese kukãsiare i kã iso si loɖue maturi gu ma mabɔi. <verse eid="EZK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14" />Atoa si marɛrɛ̃ itɛ magbe - Noa, Daniel gu Yob - pia i kame kɔraa ne, ma mɔmɔ kere loaɖi so ala ma sibɔlɔlɔ iti, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15" />"Ɣee si losese kuputubɔi i karɔ̃ gamɔ ame fiɛ mawɔra maturi maɖi i karɔ̃ gamɔ ame fiɛ kakpese ikpakpi sɔ kuwɛ̃ iisɛ ɔwo i mmɔ ɔki ala mabɔi nyanyariã ɔso ne, <verse eid="EZK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso ɔkã sɔ, ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, si marɛrɛ̃ itɛ magbe pia i kame kɔraa ne maibawo ma mɔmɔ mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔɖi. Ma itɛ mɔmɔ kere loana iɖi, ɣɛɛ karɔ̃ aakpese ikpakpi.<verse eid="EZK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17" />"Ɣee si lokpadzɛ̃ ipɛmi lobɔ i karɔ̃ gamɔ iso fiɛ loɣɛ sɔ, 'Ipɛmi si iki i karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ame,' ne loɖue kã maturi gu mabɔi, <verse eid="EZK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, atoa si marɛrɛ̃ itɛ magbe pia i kame kɔraa ne, maibawo ma mɔmɔ mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔɖi. Ma ɔnɔwɛ̃ kere loana iɖi.<verse eid="EZK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19" />"Ɣee si losese kukpakpi i karɔ̃ iso ne loɖi wũ sikpã teterea iki imaiferekarɔ̃, ne loɖue kã maturi gu mabɔi ne, <verse eid="EZK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, atoa si Noa, Daniel gu Yob mɛrɛ̃ pia i kame kɔraa ne, maibawo ɔɖi ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɣee ɔbibirɔ̃gomi ngbã. Ma mɔmɔ kere maawo ɔɖi iki i ma sibɔlɔlɔ iti.<verse eid="EZK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21" />"Ala nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Ito ianyanyarĩ si losese wũ kutsueikpadzɛ̃ nyanyariã wã ana sɔ aɖue Yerusalem maturi gu ma mabɔi - wa nɖe kakpã, kukãsiare gu mabɔi nyanyariã gu inyɛpɛ̃! <verse eid="EZK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22" />Ɣɛɛ ne mawɛ̃ to maana ngbã - mabirɛrɛĩ gu mabirɔ̃gomi ma maakɔ maɖi i mmɔ. Mato maaba i fɔ kɔrɛ, ne si anya ma nsɛgbai gu arabarara ne, so to siaɣɔ i nnɛ ɔso lotã kukpakpi ɔba i Yerusalem iso - kukpakpi biara gɔ lobɔ i ɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23" />So to siaɣɔ-ɔ sɔ loibara kuira siefe si anya ma nsɛgbai gu ma abarara, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ."<verse eid="EZK 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Igbã i Wain Iwɛĩ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ: <verse eid="EZK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, nda i wain iwɛĩ korea aalɛ iɖo kudziri kurere ikpai i ipo ame? <verse eid="EZK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3" />Masɛ mana katɔrɛ̃ mabɔrɛgu i wain iwɛĩ ame masu mabara ala ira nyaa iwɛ̃? Masɛ masu ne mabara ala ayoi wa masɛ masu masa ara? <verse eid="EZK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4" />Si maɔfuĩdza ne mapia i ɔtɔ ame lɛ katɔrɛ̃ fiɛ ɔtɔ ɔɔtsuedza kuwirikɔ̃ kunyɔ ɔɖuɖu fiɛ ndɛndɛ̃ ana ɔɔpɛ ɔtɔ ne, ikpese ilɛ itã ira iwɛ̃ ibaragu? <verse eid="EZK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5" />Si ɔwi wɔ iɖe iwɔlɔlɔ fiɛ iiwe kusia kukuwɛ̃, iyɔ nda maawo ne ɔsu ɔbara ala ira nyaa si ɔtɔ ɔɔtsuedza ne, iɔpɛ ɔtɔ iisina i kuira ame?<verse eid="EZK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6" />"Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Lɛ kumɛgɔ loɔtã wain iwɛ̃ korea i ipo adziri ndɛ̃ lɛ katɔrɛ̃ itã ɔtɔ ne, ngbɔ nto loabara maturi ma nsi i Yerusalem ne. <verse eid="EZK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7" />Loto loatara wũ anɔ lota loya i ma iso. Atoasɔ maɔbɔrɛ i ɔtɔ ame ne, ɣɛɛ ɔtɔ nto ɔ̃awɔra ma. Ne si lotara wũ anɔ lota loya i ma iso ne, mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="EZK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Loto loabara karɔ̃ ɔkpese ikpakpi alasɔ maiɖe ɔnukuare matã me."<verse eid="EZK 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Maturi Ɔnukuare Idaaɖe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, nyagalagu Yerusalem maturi ku ma anyanya kubarara <verse eid="EZK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3" />si aɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣere Yerusalem maturi sɔ: Mi mawa mɛrɛ̃ gu mi kagodɛkɔ̃ ɔwe i ma Kanaanse karɔ̃ iso. Mi ɔse ɔɖe Amorise fiɛ mi ɔnyi ɔɖe Xitise. <verse eid="EZK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4" />Iyi nɛ maɣe-ɔ ne maitu-ɔ ikɔ̃, fiɛ maipie-ɔ ndu si asekele ana, fiɛ maisɔla-ɔ mma ɣee maimini-ɔ sikati. <verse eid="EZK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5" />Kuwɛ̃ iinyɔ-ɔ nnya ɣee kuwɛ̃ iiwe nnyainyɔ sɔ ɔ̃abara ara wagbe kuiwɛ̃ ɔtã-ɔ. Ɣɛɛ ne, mafuĩdza-ɔ masese karɔ̃ ndɛ̃, alasɔ manyɔ-ɔ pupurii ku iyi nɛ maɣe-ɔ.<verse eid="EZK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6" />" 'Kere ne lopasa lofe ne lonyɔ-ɔ ato atatara nrɔɔ̃ gu ngba i ima ame. Ne gɔ arɛ i fɔ ima ame i mmɔ ne loɣere-ɔ sɔ, "We ngbã!" <verse eid="EZK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7" />Lobara-ɔ amɔ lɛ ɔraɖui i kakpɛkɔ̃ ame. Amɔ fiɛ ana so ne aba aakpese ikɛrɛra nɛ nto ilɛnyɔ iɖo. Fɔ wɔ losɛ isɔ̃ gu wawe, aba aato anyɛ i igbegbe fiɛ fɔ siwɛrɛ̃ ɔmɔ.<verse eid="EZK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8" />" 'Kama ne lokila lofe, ne gɔ lonyɔ-ɔ fiɛ lonya sɔ ɔɔmɔ akote atã kuɖuɛ ne, lowarɛ wũ arapia ɔyokã isɛ lofu-ɔ iso ne lofu-ɔ isɔ̃ ara. Lokã wũ ndamu lotã-ɔ ne lobaragu-ɔ ndamu ne akpese wũ ira, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9" />" 'Lopie-ɔ ndu ne lofore ima loɖi-ɔ iso ne losɔla-ɔ nnɔĩ iso. <verse eid="EZK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10" />Lopia-ɔ arapia wa matsue ne lopia-ɔ kakomi ndokota. Lopia-ɔ ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa sɛɛ ne ka losu arapia wa lofɔkuɣa lopia-ɔ iso. <verse eid="EZK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11" />Lokɛrɛ-ɔ ku akɛrɛra, lopia-ɔ akpokpo i kɔrɔ̃ ne lopia-ɔ anyi i ɔme, <verse eid="EZK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12" />ne lopia-ɔ kagɔrɔĩ i ɔɣɔ̃, lopia-ɔ atsuebi i atsue ne lotɔmedza-ɔ igarakoto nɛ nto ilɛnyɔ i iti. <verse eid="EZK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13" />Ne ɔso makɛrɛ-ɔ ku sikãrɛtɛa gu sikãfudza. Fɔ arapia ɔɖe ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa sɛɛ gu ɔkati wɔ lofɔkuɣa gu ɔkati wɔ matsue. Fɔ aɖera ɔɖe ɔraũ sɛɛ, maɣendu gu nnɔĩ. Aba aalɛnyɔ ne akpese igararɔ̃go. <verse eid="EZK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14" />Ne fɔ iyere ɔre kayi i nɖebi ndɛ̃ ala fɔ kulɛ iti, alasɔ sikɛrɛɖu dzɛ lotã-ɔ ɔbara sɔ fɔ kulɛ ɔyi, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15" />" 'Ɣɛɛ asiaiti i fɔ kulɛ iso ne asu fɔ iyereifɔ akpesera so sɔrɔ̃ɖedze. Asu so atã ɔrere wɔ loba ɔto ɔfe, ne fɔ kulɛ ɔkpese ɔ̃ kure. <verse eid="EZK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16" />Asu fɔ arapia awɛ̃ abara kusɔrɛkɔ̃ i ngbegɔ abara fɔ asɔrɔ̃ra. Ara wamɔ igbã iibaba, ɣee iikote sɔ aaba ɖuɖuuɖu fiɛ. <verse eid="EZK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17" />Ana ne asu akɛrɛra sɛɛ wa lotã-ɔ, akɛrɛra wa masu wũ sikãrɛtɛa gu sikãfudza mabara, ne abara marɛrɛ̃ kumiamia arapɔa ne abara asɔrɔ̃ra ku wã ne. <verse eid="EZK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18" />Ne asu fɔ arapia wa matsue mapia apia i arapɔa iso, ne asɔrɛ wũ nnɔĩ gu kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã atã wã. <verse eid="EZK 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19" />Ana ne asu araɖea wa lotã-ɔ - ɔraũ sɛɛ, nnɔĩ gu maɣendu wa lotã-ɔ sɔ ɖe - asɔrɛ lɛ kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã atã wã. Nnɛgbe loba ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20" />" 'Ne asu fɔ mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi ma aɣe atã me asɔrɛ lɛ aɖera atã arapɔa. Fɔ asɔrɔ̃iɖe iisi-ɔ ɣɛɛ? <verse eid="EZK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21" />Aɖue wũ mabi ne asɔrɛ ma atã arapɔa. <verse eid="EZK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22" />I fɔ anyanya kubarara ɔɖuɖu ame gu fɔ asɔrɔ̃iɖe ame ne, ainyigi ɔwi wɔ aɖe ɔkoso, ɔwi wɔ asɛ isɔ̃ gu wawe, akpɛkpɛ̃ i fɔ ima ame.<verse eid="EZK 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Ɔsɛ Ngbã Lɛ Sɔrɔ̃ɖedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23" />" ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ sɔ: Ndzo! Ndzo mitã-ɔ! Isu ibua i fɔ ɔtile ɔɖuɖu ame ne, <verse eid="EZK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:24" />atsue kuɣɔka atã so ne abara kusɔrɛkɔ̃ i itiri biara. <verse eid="EZK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25" />Atsue kusɔrɛkɔ̃ i ɔvurã biara iso, ne asopara so ku fɔ kulɛ, asu so atã ɔbiara wɔ loki ɔfe gɔ fɔ asɔrɔĩɖe ɔsɛkatɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26" />Aɖe asɔrɔ̃ ku ma Egiptese, fɔ magbamikui ma mpia iledzaso ame gɔ maarɛgu-ɔ, ne apia me sikpã ku fɔ sidzetɔiɖe gbodzoo. <verse eid="EZK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27" />Ne ɔso loɖi wũ kɔrɔ̃ losia i fɔ iso ne lotã fɔ karɔ̃ kusime ɔbakarɔ̃. Losu-ɔ lotã fɔ matsirise ɖeɖei, ma Filistise simagɛ̃ ne sitsue ɔbɔrɛ ma ala fɔ ininaso nsɛgbai ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28" />Aɖe asɔrɔ̃ ku ma Asiriase ana, alasɔ aimi, ne kama kɔraa ne aikpese ami. <verse eid="EZK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29" />Ne ka abua i fɔ asɔrɔ̃iɖe iso ku ma Babiloniase, kuɣamaɖese karɔ̃, ɣɛɛ ku ne kɔraa ne aimi.<verse eid="EZK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, " 'Nyɔ kumɛgɔ ɔɔsopara so gɔ abara ara ɔɖuɖu wagbe lɛ sɔrɔ̃ɖedze wɔ nna kunuarɛ! <verse eid="EZK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31" />Atsue nsɛkɔ̃ atã so i ɔvurã biara iso ne abara kusɔrɛkɔ̃ i itiri biara ne. Si maɣɛ ne ɔɔbara so aɖo ɔrɔ̃gosɔrɔ̃ɖedze, alasɔ asɛ̃ sikã ifɔ.<verse eid="EZK 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32" />" 'Ɔre sɔrɔ̃ɖedze aɖe fɔ! Asɛ afɔ mafɔ apia aɖo fɔ mɔmɔ kurã! <verse eid="EZK 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33" />Sɔrɔ̃ɖedzerɔ̃go biara sɛ ɔfɔ sikã, ɣɛɛ fɔ asɛ atã fɔ ma ɖuɛdze ɔɖuɖu karatã. Asɛ atã ma kawɛrɛra sɔ mabɔrɛ i kakɔi biara maba i fɔ kɔrɛ si maba maaɖegu-ɔ sidzetɔ. <verse eid="EZK 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34" />Ne ɔso ne i fɔ asɔrɔĩɖe ame ne aise lɛ marɔ̃gosɔrɔ̃ɖedze mama, kuwɛ̃ iisɛ ɔtere ɔsiai-ɔ ala fɔ sidzetɔiɖe. Fɔ ne abua akpaki, ala asɛ atã kuso ɣɛɛ maisɛ matã-ɔ kukuwɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Kutsueikpadzɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35" />" 'Ne ɔso, sɔrɔ̃ɖedze, nɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me! <verse eid="EZK 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ala asa fɔ karana afere fiɛ aɖi so isɔ̃ ku asɔrɔĩɖe ku fɔ maɖuɛdze, ne gu ala fɔ anyanya arapɔa fiɛ asu fɔ mabi ima atã wã ɔso ne, <verse eid="EZK 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37" />nto loasa fɔ maɖuɛdze ɔɖuɖu kanya, mma anagu isoɣɔ, mma aɖuɛ gu mma atsiri pelepele. Loasa ma ɔɖuɖu kanya loki lolɔ-ɔ mata maya-ɔ iso. Ne loabɛ ara loɖi-ɔ iso i ma katɔ̃, ne mato maanya fɔ isɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38" />Loto loatã-ɔ ipɔ itã kutsueikpadzɛ̃ lɛ ɔrɔ̃go wɔ lofe kurã kama gu nwɔ loɖue maturi. Ne nto loakpadzɛ̃ wũ sirerɛ sikpã gu ima iti ikarɛ sikpã teterea losia i fɔ iso. <verse eid="EZK 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39" />Iyɔ nto loasu-ɔ lopia i fɔ maɖuɛdze nrɔɔ̃ ame, ne mato maabibiɛ fɔ nsɛkɔ̃ mawɔra fɔ kusɔrɛkɔ̃. Mato maabɛ-ɔ arapia iso ne mato maasu fɔ akɛrɛra sɛɛ, ne maanyua-ɔ masɛ wawe gu isɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40" />Mato maakɔ maturi gbodzoo mata maya-ɔ iso. Mato maapɛ-ɔ ata fiɛ maakɛkɛ-ɔ mapia i kusɛi ame ku ma apɛmi. <verse eid="EZK 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41" />Mato maatsuedza fɔ ayo ne maakpadzɛ̃-ɔ kutsue i marɔ̃go gbodzoo anɔmi ame. Loto loatuĩdza fɔ asɔrɔĩɖe ne aisibatã fɔ maɖuɛdze kuso. <verse eid="EZK 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42" />Iyɔ wũ sikpã teterea to siabakarɔ̃ i fɔ iso fiɛ wũ sirerɛ sikpã aarui i fɔ iso. Loto loaɣɔ fiɛ loisibana sikpã.<verse eid="EZK 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43" />" 'Ala ainyigi ɔwi wɔ aɖe ɔkoso ɣɛɛ apia me sikpã ku ara ɔɖuɖu wagbe. Nto loakpadzɛ̃ nnɛ abara losia-ɔ i iti iso, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. Ala ne abua ininaso nsɛgbai i fɔ anyanya kubarara mama ɔɖuɖu kama.<verse eid="EZK 16:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44" />" 'Ɔbiara wɔ nsɛ ɔpɛ agbã to ɔ̃apɛ igbã nɛgbe i fɔ iso sɔ, "Lɛ ɔnyi, lɛ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi." <verse eid="EZK 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45" />Ɔnukuare fɔ ɔnyi ɔbibirɔ̃gomi aɖe, nwɔ lonyɔ ɔ̃ ɔrã gu ɔ̃ mabi pupurii. Ɔnukuare aɖe fɔ manyiiko ame ɔnyiiko, mma lonyɔ ma marã gu ma mabi pupurii. Fɔ ɔnyi ɔɖe Xitise ne fɔ ɔse ɔɖe Amorise. <verse eid="EZK 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46" />Fɔ ɔnyiiko kpakpare ɔɖe Samaria, nwɔ losɛ i fɔ katikpe ku ɔ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi. Ne fɔ ɔnyiiko kosore, nwɔ losɛ i fɔ kagbalɔ ku ɔ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔɖe Sodom. <verse eid="EZK 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47" />Aisɛ i ma siri iso kere fiɛ aisore ma anyanya kubarara, ɣɛɛ i fɔ siri ɔɖuɖu ame ne, aba aanyanyarĩ aɖo ma kɔraa. <verse eid="EZK 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔkã ɔɣɛ sɔ, ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, fɔ ɔnyiiko Sodom gu ɔ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi iibara nnɛ mi gu fɔ mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔbara ɖuɖuuɖu.<verse eid="EZK 16:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49" />" 'Kiniɔ ne fɔ ɔnyiiko Sodom ikpi i ngbe ne: Ma gu ɔ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔte so, mafe imi ne maisu kuira gɔ mawe i isobuɛ gu kaɣɔ ame. Ɣɛɛ maibuai mawɛrɛba gu maɣiãni iso. <verse eid="EZK 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50" />Manyɔ so ne mabara anyanyara i wũ anɔ. Ne ɔso loɖi ma lofegu lɛ ɔɔnya. <verse eid="EZK 16:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51" />Samaria maturi iibara akpi wa i mi Yerusalem maturi ɔbara kasɛ kawɛ̃. Miɔbara anyanyara miɖo ma, ne miɔtã sɔ mi manyiiko ɔkpɛ ɔnyɔ bɔlɔlɔ iki i ara ɔɖuɖu wa miɔbara i ngbe ame. <verse eid="EZK 16:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52" />Misore mi kunuarɛ, alasɔ miɔtã mi manyiiko ɔnyɔ bɔlɔlɔ. Ala mi akpi ɔsi aɖo ma are, ne miɔtã sɔ ma ɔkpɛ ɔnyɔ bɔlɔlɔ ɔɖo mi ɔre. Ne ɔso iyɔ kunuarɛ si kukpɛ̃ mi, si misore mi isopa ala mitã mi manyiiko ɔkpɛ ɔnyɔ bɔlɔlɔ.<verse eid="EZK 16:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mato Maaledza Sodom Gu Samaria Isɛra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53" />" 'Ɣɛɛ, nto loasɛra Sodom gu ɔ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi gu Samaria gu ɔ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi isaruɛ, gu fɔ Yerusalem isaruɛ ku ma, <verse eid="EZK 16:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54" />si aasore fɔ isopa fiɛ kunuarɛ aamɔɛ̃ mi ala ara ɔɖuɖu wa miɔbara itã ma kaɣɔ iti. <verse eid="EZK 16:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55" />Ne fɔ manyiiko, Sodom ku ɔ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi gu Samaria ku ɔ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi, aakpese mase lɛ saa. Ne mi gu fɔ mabibirɔ̃gomi aase lɛ mise saa. <verse eid="EZK 16:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56" />Aito aakpere fɔ ɔnyiiko Sodom iyere kɔraa i fɔ iteso ɔwi ame, <verse eid="EZK 16:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:57" />fiɛ maanya fɔ ɔtile ɔbɔrɛ kayi. Edom mabibirɔ̃gomi kɔraa ka mato manyɔ-ɔ pupurii gu ɔ̃ magbamikui ɔɖuɖu gu ma Filistise mabibirɔ̃gomi - mma ɔɖuɖu loki malɔ-ɔ mato manyɔ-ɔ pupurii. <verse eid="EZK 16:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ, ato aatã fɔ ininaso gu anyanya kubarara kuso.<verse eid="EZK 16:58" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndamu Mɛ Nna Katuĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Loto loabara-ɔ lotikuso lɛ akote atã, ala ɔɔsɛ wũ ndamu i karɔ̃ iki gɔ atu ndamu ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 16:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60" />Ɣɛɛ nto loanyigi ndamu mɛ lobaragu-ɔ ku ɔwi wɔ aɖe ɔkoso. Ne nto loasɛragu-ɔ ndamu mɛ nna katuĩ . <verse eid="EZK 16:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61" />Iyɔ ato aanyigi nnɛ ɔɔbara fiɛ kunuarɛ aakpɛ-ɔ si afɔ fɔ manyiiko, mma loɔmɔ maɖo-ɔ gu mma ɔɔmɔ aɖo. Loto loasu ma lotã-ɔ lɛ fɔ mabibirɔ̃gomi ɣɛɛ mana i nnɛ lokã i ndamu mɛ lobaragu-ɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 16:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62" />Ne ɔso loto loasɛragu-ɔ wũ ndamu, ne ato aatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="EZK 16:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63" />Iyɔ, si lobara ikpikusoisɔrɛ lotã-ɔ i ara ɔɖuɖu wa ɔɔbara iti ne, ato aanyigi fiɛ kunuarɛ aamɔɛ̃-ɔ. Ne aisibabusi kanya aɖeika ala fɔ kunuarɛ iti kuiyikuiyi ana, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.' "<verse eid="EZK 16:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Igbã i Ma Finikpo Inyɔ Gu Wain Iwɛĩ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, tu adzolo si aɖe Israel kaɖe inatika. <verse eid="EZK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3" />Ɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Finikpo siare ku abue ɔle, sirã tagbaraa ku kukua agbãagbã ɔba i Lebanon. Ɔsɛ ɔ̃ɔsɛ fiɛ ɔfɔ sedar kudziri kuwɛ̃ kato. <verse eid="EZK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:4" />Ne ɔfɛ̃ kɔ̃ kato pelepele ɔlɔmia ne ɔsore wũ ɔkɛlɛgu kuɣamaɖese karɔ̃ iso. Ɔpia ɔlɔmia i kuɣamaɖese ɔmagɛ̃siare ame i mmɔ.<verse eid="EZK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5" />" 'Ana ne ɔsu fɔ karɔ̃ ɔɖui ɔwɛ̃ ne ɔpia wũ i karɔ̃ ga mba iɖa ame. Ne ɔpɛ wũ lɛ kudziri gɔ nsɛ kuya i ɔwore kɔrɛ i ngbegɔ i ndu gbodzoo pia. <verse eid="EZK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6" />Ne ɔɖui ɔre ne ɔkpese iwɛĩ nɛ loɣa ifere i karɔ̃. Ne ɔ̃ silɔmia ɔfiriki siba i finikpo kɔrɛ, ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ siɖu ɔwe i ɔ̃ kayirinɔ. Ne ɔso ikpese iwɛĩ ne iɖi akpai ku ayata gbodzoo.<verse eid="EZK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7" />" 'Ɣɛɛ finikpo siare mama ku abue ku ɔle gu sirã tikpirii ɔwɛ̃ ɔwe. Kiniɔ ne iwɛĩ ɔɖi siɖu isese i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ isɛ ibɔrɛgu i ngbegɔ mapia ne. Iɖi akpai ikɛlɛgu ne kɔrɛ si ina ndu. <verse eid="EZK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8" />Maɔpia ne i karɔ̃ sɛɛ ame i ndu gbodzoo kɔrɛ si iawo akpai ɔɖi, iɣɔ̃ abi, ikpese iwɛĩ nɛ nto ilɛnyɔ.'<verse eid="EZK 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9" />"Ɣere ma sɔ, nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: 'Ito iana ngbã? Maito maarui ne mabɛ ne abi maɖi si iaɣɔ ɣɛɛ? Ne silɔmia gu ayata ɣɛtɛ ɔɖuɖu to aaɣɔ. Iibaɖe sɔ kɔrɔ̃ gɔ mba ɔle ɣee maturi gbodzoo loarui ne ku siɖu maɖi. <verse eid="EZK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10" />Ana ne si maledza ne irui ito kɔraa ne, ito iaya? Si kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ɔwiri ɔwuĩ ne ne - iito iaɣɔ pelepele ibɔrɛ i ngbegɔ iya ɣɛɛ?' "<verse eid="EZK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɖi Igbã Karɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12" />"Ɣere atsuele kaɖe gagbe sɔ, 'Miiɣe ara wagbe karɔ̃ ɣɛɛ?' Ɣere ma sɔ, 'Babilon igara ɔsɛ Yerusalem ne ɔmɔɛ̃ igara gu ɔ̃ makpakpaturi, ne ɔkɔ ma ɔkpesegu ɔbɔ i Babilon. <verse eid="EZK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13" />Kere ne ɔɖi sigara iyoturi ɔwɛ̃ ne ɔbaragu wũ kanyakawɛ̃, ne ɔtã wũ ɔkã ndamu ɔpia wũ i ɔ̃ kayirinɔ. Ana ne Babilon igara ɔkɔ karɔ̃ maturi nyaa mama lɛ mafɔrɔĩ ɔruigu. <verse eid="EZK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:14" />Ɔbara kumɛɔ si ɔbɔ Israel sigarakaɖekɔ̃ karɔ̃, si siisibawo ɔta ana. Gɔ iatã sɔ siawe iki i kanyakawɛ̃ ndamu imɔɛ̃ ila ame kere. <verse eid="EZK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15" />Ɣɛɛ igara ɔta ɔya i Babilonia igara iso. Ne iki ne iso ne ɔsese makpakpaturi mawɛ̃ Egipte karɔ̃ iso, sɔ mana apɔngɔ gu makpakpɛ̃dze gbodzoo mabɔ. Ɔto ɔ̃ana isaruɛ? Nwɔ nsɛ ɔbara ara wagbe igbã sɛ ɔwo ɔtere? Ɔto ɔ̃atu kanyakawɛ̃ ndamu fiɛ ɔ̃awo ɔtere?<verse eid="EZK 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16" />" ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso ɔkã sɔ, ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, ɔto ɔ̃akpi i Babilon karɔ̃ iso. Ɔ̃akpi i igara wɔ losɛra wũ i sigaraiyara iso, nwɔ ndamu ɔtu gu nwɔ kanyakawɛ̃ ɔtu nrɔɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17" />Si mali akpo i ibere iso fiɛ matɛ̃ maturi mapia, si maawɔra magbodzoo ngbã ne, Egipte Igarakpakpa ku ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ku ɔle gu apɔngɔ gbodzoo, iibawo wũ ɔbuai i kakpã ame. <verse eid="EZK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18" />Ɔsɛ ndamu i karɔ̃ iki me itu ame. Ala ɔ̃ɔsu ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ ɔkã ɣɛɛ ɔbara ara ɔɖuɖu wagbe ɔso, ɔ̃ibawo ɔtere.<verse eid="EZK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19" />" 'Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Lokã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, nto loakpadzɛ̃ ndamu mɛ ɔsɛ i karɔ̃ gu wũ ndamu mɛ ɔtu losia i ɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20" />Nto loawarɛ wũ asabu losɛ wũ, ne loamɔɛ̃ wũ i wũ iyebi ame. Loakɔ wũ lobɔ i Babilon ne loakpadzɛ̃ wũ kutsue i mmɔ alasɔ ɔ̃iɖe ɔnukuare ɔtã me. <verse eid="EZK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21" />Ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu ma nto matere to maarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya, ne mma loakuti mana ngbã to maasame maki i kakɔi biara isɛ. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔɖeika.<verse eid="EZK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Kaɣɛkasɛ i Ɔriinyɔ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22" />" ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Mme wũ mɔmɔ nto loasu ɔlɔmia lobɔrɛgu i sedar kudziri kato ne loato wũ ne. Loto loakpɛti ne ɔlɔmia ɖɔbɔrɔa loɖi ɔlɔmia wɔ i ngbegɔ lokɔlɛ iɖo, ne loapia wũ i kube kɔlɛa dzoroo iso. <verse eid="EZK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23" />Nto loapia ne i Israel kube kɔlɛa iso. Ito iaɖi akpai ne iaɣɔ̃ abi fiɛ iakpese sedar siare wɔ nto ɔlɛnyɔ. Kurodzai igbã biara aabara arodzayo i ɔ̃ ame. Kuto kuana kawekɔ̃ i akpai kusɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24" />Karɔ̃ iso adziri ɔɖuɖu to aatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nsɛ lobɔ kudziri kɔlɛa karɔ̃, ne nsɛ lotã ngɔ loba karɔ̃ ɔmɔ kukɔlɛ. Nsɛ lotã adziri ku ayata yuɛ ɔkore fiɛ nsɛ lotã kudziri korea ɔɖi ayata kumɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 17:24">" 'Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika, fiɛ nto loabara ne.' "<verse eid="EZK 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mma Lobara Ikpi To Maakpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2" />"Igbã nɛ maturi sɛ mapɛ ise i Israel karɔ̃ iso karɔ̃ ɣɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:2">" 'Mase sɛ maɖe akutu nyagbala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:2">ne mabi anyɛ nsɛ abara kpaã.'<verse eid="EZK 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3" />"<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso ɔkã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, miisibapɛ igbã nɛgbe i Israel. <verse eid="EZK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4" />Alasɔ ɔturi biara ngbã ɖe wũ mire, ɔse gu ɔbi mɛrɛ̃ - aka anyɔ ɔɖuɖu ɖe wũ ɔkpɛ. Ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔbara ikpi nɖe nwɔ loakpi.<verse eid="EZK 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5" />"Su sɔ ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa ɔwɛ̃ pia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:5">nwɔ nsɛ ɔbara isɛɛ gu nnɛ loya.<verse eid="EZK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6" />Ɔ̃isɛ ɔɖe ara i abe iso kuɣɔka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:6">ɣee ɔ̃isɛ ɔsia anɔ i Israel kaɖe arapɔa iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:6">Ɔ̃isɛ ɔrɛgu ɔ̃ ɔnyii ɔre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:6">ɣee ɔ̃isɛ ɔrɛgu ɔrɔ̃go wɔ lopɛ kukpa i karɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7" />Ɔ̃isɛ ɔyika kuwɛ̃ ɔbɔkarɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">ɣɛɛ si ɔnyɛ kuso ɔtã ɔturi ne, ɔsɛ ɔkpesera ayaikama ira ɔtã.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:7">Ɔ̃isɛ ɔyukayu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">ɣɛɛ ɔsɛ ɔsu ɔ̃ aɖera ɔtã mma kukã to</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔtã mma nsɛ isɔ̃ arapia.<verse eid="EZK 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8" />Ɔ̃isɛ ɔnyɛ kuso ɔtã ɔturi ku kusia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:8">ɣee ɔ̃isɛ ɔfɔ kusia gbodzoo i kuso iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:8">Ɔ̃isɛ ɔpia arɔĩ i ira lalaa ibara ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:8">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔɣɛ itɔ̃me ku ɔnukuare i maturi inyɔ ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9" />Ɔsɛ ɔbara i wũ asɛ̃ra iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:9">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔbara i wũ mmara iso ku ɔnukuare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:9">Ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ nse bɔlɔlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:9">Gbaã ne ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="EZK 18:9">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10" />"Su sɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ ba ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ku amumuɣɔ, nwɔ nsɛ ɔɖue maturi ɣee ɔsɛ ɔbara aranyanyariã wagbe amama irere <verse eid="EZK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:11" />(atoasɔ ɔ̃ ɔse iibara wã kuiwɛ̃):</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:11">"Ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ne, ɔsɛ ɔɖe ara i abe kuɣɔka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:11">Ɔsɛ ɔrɛgu ɔ̃ ɔnyii ɔre.<verse eid="EZK 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12" />Ɔsɛ ɔyika mawɛrɛba gu maɣiãni ɔbɔkarɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">Ɔsɛ ɔyukayu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">Ɔ̃isɛ ɔkpesera ayaikama wa ɔfɔ i kuso iti ɔtã.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">Ɔsɛ ɔsia anɔ i arapɔa iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">Ɔsɛ ɔbara anyanya kubarara.<verse eid="EZK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13" />Ɔsɛ ɔnyɛ kuso ɔtã ku kusia fiɛ kusia sɛ kufe isi.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:13">Ɔturi wɔgbe igbã aasɛ ngbã? Ɔ̃ibasɛ ngbã! Ala ɔ̃ɔbara aranyanyariã wagbe ɔso ne, mato maaɖue wũ fiɛ ɔ̃ ima aasia i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ iti iso.<verse eid="EZK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14" />"Ɣɛɛ su sɔ ɔbi wɔgbe ba ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔ nsɛ ɔnya ara nyanyariã ɔɖuɖu wa i ɔ̃ ɔse sɛ ɔbara, atoasɔ ɔsɛ ɔnya wã ne, ɔ̃isɛ ɔbara wã igbã ne:<verse eid="EZK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15" />"Ɔ̃isɛ ɔɖe ara i abe iso kuɣɔka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:15">ɣee ɔ̃isɛ ɔsia anɔ i Israel kaɖe arapɔa iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:15">Ɔ̃isɛ ɔrɛgu ɔ̃ ɔnyii ɔre.<verse eid="EZK 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16" />Ɔ̃isɛ ɔyika kuwɛ̃ ɔbɔkarɔ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">ɣee ɔ̃isɛ ɔfɔ kuira ɔsɛ i kuso gɔ ɔnyɛ ɔtã iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:16">Ɔ̃isɛ ɔyukayu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">ɣɛɛ ɔsɛ ɔsu ɔ̃ aɖera ɔtã mma kukã to</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔtã mma nsɛ isɔ̃ arapia.<verse eid="EZK 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17" />Ɔ̃isɛ ɔpia kɔrɔ̃ i ikpi ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:17">fiɛ ɔ̃isɛ ɔfɔ kusia kukuwɛ̃ ɣee ɔ̃isɛ ɔfɔ kusia ɔfe isi kukuwɛ̃ si ɔnyɛ kuso ɔtã.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:17">Ɔsɛ ɔbara i wũ mmara iso fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔsiai wũ asɛ̃ra.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:17">Gbaã ne ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã, ɔ̃ibakpi i ɔ̃ ɔse akpi iti. <verse eid="EZK 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18" />Ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ ɔse to ɔ̃akpi i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ akpi iti, alasɔ ɔɖe maturi amumu, ɔyu ɔ̃ ɔnyii ne ɔbara aranyanyariã i ɔ̃ maturi ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19" />"Ɣɛɛ mito mikarɛ sɔ, 'Be ɔso i ɔbibirɛrɛĩ iisɛ ɔfɔ kuso ala ɔ̃ ɔse iɣɛrɛ iti?' Gɔ i ɔbi ɔɔbara nnɛ loya gu isɛɛ fiɛ ɔpia kubɛ ɔmɔɛ̃ wũ asɛ̃ra ɔɖuɖu ɔla ne, gbaã ne ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã. <verse eid="EZK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20" />Ɔturi wɔ lobara ikpi ne, ɔ̃ loakpi ne. Ɔbibirɛrɛĩ iibafɔ ɔ̃ ɔse iɣɛrɛ kuso, ɣee ɔse iibafɔ ɔ̃ ɔbi iɣɛrɛ kuso. Ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa sibɔlɔlɔ ɖe ɔ̃ ɔkpɛ, fiɛ ɔtilese ne ɔ̃ ɔtile loaɖe nnɛ iso mabara wũ itɔ̃me.<verse eid="EZK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21" />"Ɣɛɛ si ɔtilese ɔfirki i ɔ̃ akpi ɔɖuɖu wa ɔ̃ɔbara ame, ne ɔmɔɛ̃ wũ asɛ̃ra ɔɖuɖu ɔla, ne ɔbara nnɛ loya gu isɛɛ ne, gbaã ne ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã, ɔ̃ibakpi. <verse eid="EZK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22" />Maibanyigi ɔ̃ akpi ɔɖuɖu kuiwɛ̃ i nwa ɔ̃ɔbara ɔfegu ame. Ala ara bɔlɔlɔa wa ɔ̃ɔbara ɔso ne, ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã. <verse eid="EZK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Loisɛ loɖuɛ sɔ ɔtilese si ɔkpi. Bowũ ne nsɛ lona isoɣɔ si mafiriki i ma siri iso si mawe ngbã.<verse eid="EZK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24" />"Ɣɛɛ si ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa ɔfirki i ɔ̃ sibɔlɔlɔ ame ne ɔbara aranyanyariã wa ame i ɔtilese sɛ ɔbara ne, ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã? Maisibanyigi ɔ̃ ara bɔlɔlɔa wa ɔ̃ɔbara kuiwɛ̃. Ɔto ɔ̃akpi ala ɔnukuare idaaɖe gu akpi wa ɔ̃ɔbara fiɛ ɔɣɛrɛ ɔso.<verse eid="EZK 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25" />"Ɣɛɛ misɛ miɣɛ sɔ, ' Sate ɔri iisɛ ɔya.' Mi, Israel kaɖe minɔ lo: Wũ ɔri loisɛ ɔya ɣɛɛ? Iiɖe mi siri bowũ loisɛ siya ɣɛɛ? <verse eid="EZK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26" />Si ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa ɔfiriki i ɔ̃ sibɔlɔlɔ ame ne ɔbara ikpi, ɔto ɔ̃akpi i ne iti. Ɔ̃to ɔ̃akpi ala ikpi nɛ ɔbara ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27" />Ɣɛɛ si ɔtilese ɔfiriki i ɔ̃ ɔtile ame ne ɔsɛ ɔbara nnɛ loya gu isɛɛ ne, ɔto ɔ̃aɖi ɔ̃ ngbã. <verse eid="EZK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28" />Ala ɔtilese sɛ ɔdzuĩ aɣɛrɛ ɔɖuɖu wa ɔ̃ɔbara fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔfiriki ɔbɔrɛ i wã ame ɔso, gbaã ne ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã, ɔ̃ibakpi. <verse eid="EZK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29" />Ɣɛɛ Israel kaɖe sɛ maɣɛ sɔ, ' Sate ɔri iisɛ ɔya.' O Israel kaɖe, wũ siri loisɛ siya ɣɛɛ? Iiɖe mi siri bowũ loisɛ siya ɣɛɛ?<verse eid="EZK 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ne ɔso, Israel kaɖe, nto loaɣɛgu mi ɔbiara atɔ̃me i nnɛ ɔbara kanya lo. Mifiriki! Mifiriki mibɔrɛ i mi aɣɛrɛ ɔɖuɖu ame, iyɔ ikpi iibatã mirɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31" />Minyua akpi ɔɖuɖu wa mito mibara ɔbara, si mifirikira mi adzuni gu situ mibara siɣɛtɛ. O Israel kaɖe, be ɔso miakpi? <verse eid="EZK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, Ala kuwɛ̃ kukpi iisɛ kupia me isoɣɔ ɔso, mifiriki si misɛ ngbã!<verse eid="EZK 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Isoma Ɔnɔ Itã Israel Matɔ̃ɖedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1" />"Ezekiel, ka ɔkpibiɛnɔ tã Israel matɔ̃ɖedze. <verse eid="EZK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2" />Ɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">" 'Mme dzatarɔ̃go i fɔ ɔnyi ɔɖe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:2">i madzata ndɛ̃!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Ɔfu i karɔ̃ i dzata abi ndɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:2">ne ɔnyɔ ɔ̃ abi iso ne.<verse eid="EZK 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3" />Ɔkpadzɛ̃ ɔ̃ ibi iwɛ̃ i abi ndɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:3">ne ɔkpese dzata wɔ mba ɔle.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">Ɔsuã kumɛgɔ ɔ̃akɛkɛ bɔi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:3">ne ɔkɛkɛ maturi ne.<verse eid="EZK 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4" />Nɖebi ɔnɔ ɔ̃ iyere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:4">ne mamɔɛ̃ wũ i ma iwo ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">Makɔra wũ ku kugodai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:4">ne makɔ wũ makɛlɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="EZK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5" />" 'Ɔwi wɔ i dzatarɔ̃go ɔnya sɔ ɔ̃ ɔriinyɔ iiba i kame ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:5">ɔ̃ nnɛ ɔnyɔ ɔri ka ikpa ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">ɔɖi ɔ̃ ibi mama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:5">ne ɔbara dzata wɔ mba ɔle.<verse eid="EZK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6" />Ɔgbere ku madzata mama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:6">ala ka ɔɖe dzata wɔ mba ɔle ɔso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Ɔsuã kumɛgɔ ɔ̃akɛkɛ nnɛ ɔmɔɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:6">ne ɔkɛkɛ maturi ne.<verse eid="EZK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7" />Ɔbibiɛ ma ɔlekusɛkɔ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:7">ne ɔwɔra ma simagɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">Karɔ̃ gu mma ɔɖuɖu lowe i kã iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:7">ɔti makpakpa ala ɔ̃ sifafã iti.<verse eid="EZK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8" />Kere ne nɖebi ɔta maya ɔ̃ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:8">maturi ma lobɔrɛ i abuiti wa loki alɔ ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Magbere ma asabu masɛ wũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:8">ne mamɔɛ̃ wũ i ma iwo ame.<verse eid="EZK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9" />Makpadzɛ̃ wũ ku kugodai mapia i kugbagɔrɔĩ i ɔme ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">ne makɔ wũ makɛlɛgu Babilon igara kɔrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Masu wũ marara i iyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">ne ɔso maisinɔ ɔ̃ sifafã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">i Israel abe iso.<verse eid="EZK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10" />" 'Fɔ ɔnyi ɔse lɛ iwɛĩ i fɔ wainkakpɛkɔ̃ ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:10">ne mapia ne i ndu kɔrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">Akpai ɔsi fiɛ iɣɔ̃ abi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:10">ala ndu gbodzoo ɔso.<verse eid="EZK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11" />Ne akpai ɔwe ɔle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">ikote itã ɔɖeisoi kugarapɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Ikɔlɛ kato iɖo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">adziri ɔɖuɖu ku wã ayata kpirikpiria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">ne ɔbiara ɔnya ne ala ne kukɔlɛme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">gu ne akpai gbodzoo iti.<verse eid="EZK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12" />Ɣɛɛ marui ne maɖi i sikpã ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">ne masu ne mapɛyu i karɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">Kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ɔwiri ɔtã iɣɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">ne ne abi ɔkore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">ne akpai wa mba ɔle ɔɣɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">ne ɔtɔ ɔtsuedza wã.<verse eid="EZK 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13" />Kiniɔ ne mapia ne i fafuĩ ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:13">i karɔ̃ korea ga nna ndu iso.<verse eid="EZK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14" />Ɔtɔ ɔwara ɔɣa ɔbɔrɛ i ne adzirikpai siare iwɛ̃ ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:14">ne ɔtsuedza ne adziribi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">Ikpai nɛ mba ɔle kuiwɛ̃ iikuti i ne iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:14">ialɛ itã ɔɖeisoi kugarapɛ.'</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 19:14">Kukpibiɛnɔ ɔɖe i ngbe fiɛ maaka kɔ̃ lɛ isoma ɔnɔ."<verse eid="EZK 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Atsuele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1" />I ikɔ kɔdzɛva ame i ma Yudase kuwa ruva iyi iweova iso ne, Israel matɔ̃ɖedze mawɛ̃ ɔba i wũ kɔrɛ si makarɛ ira manɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ. Ne makpase masɛ i wũ katɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖe Israel makpakpa ika si aɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ɔba miɔba sɔ miakarɛ ira minɔ i wũ kɔrɛ? Lokã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, loibatã ɔri sɔ mikarɛ me ira minɔ, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.'<verse eid="EZK 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4" />"Ato aaɣɛgu ma itɔ̃me? Ato aaɣɛgu ma itɔ̃me ɔturi awune ɔbi? Iyɔ nyigira ma i anyanya kubarara gɔ i ma mawa ɔbara <verse eid="EZK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5" />si aɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Iyi nɛ loɖi Israel ne, lokã ku wũ kɔrɔ̃ i kato lotã Yakob iyo ɔkparɛ ne loɖi so lote ma i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. Ku kɔrɔ̃ i kato ne lokã loɣere ma sɔ, "Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne." <verse eid="EZK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6" />Iyi nɛmɔ ne lokã lotã ma sɔ nto loaɖi ma lobɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso, lobɔ i karɔ̃ ga loɔɖi losɛ ma, karɔ̃ sɛɛ ku iɖa iso, nga nto kalɛnyɔ kaɖo i nrɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="EZK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7" />Ne loɣere ma sɔ, "Mi ɔbiara si ɔnyua aranyanyariã kumiamia wa misu anɔ minya. Midaapukutura so ku Egipte arapɔa. Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa."<verse eid="EZK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8" />" 'Ɣɛɛ mata maya me iso ne maikã me atsue. Mainyua aranyanyariã kumiamia wa maɔnya fiɛ maisɛ̃ Egipte arapɔa isumu ana. Ne ɔso loɣɛ sɔ nto loakpadzɛ̃ wũ sikpã teterea lofere i ma iso, ne loanagu ma sikpã i Egipte. <verse eid="EZK 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9" />Ɣɛɛ ala wũ iyere iti ne, lobara nnɛ loatã sɔ iibakpese kunuarɛ i nɖebi mɛ ndɛ̃ masɛ anɔmi ame. Mmagbe anɔmi ame loɔɖi so lote Israel kaɖe, iki i kumɛgɔ loɖi ma lobɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ne. <verse eid="EZK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10" />Ne ɔso lokɔ ma lobɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ne lobɔ ma i fafuĩ ame. <verse eid="EZK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11" />Lotã ma wũ asɛ̃ra ne lotã matsue wũ mmara, alasɔ ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔwarɛ mmara to ɔ̃asɛ ngbã iki i me iso. <verse eid="EZK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12" />Ana ne lotã ma wũ Awarãyi lɛ ikparĩ i bo gu ma ndɛ̃, si maatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> lobara ma sekelee.<verse eid="EZK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13" />" 'Ɣɛɛ Israel mabi ɔta maya me iso i fafuĩ ame. Maisiai wũ asɛ̃ra ɣɛɛ masɛ̃ wũ mmara - atoasɔ ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔwarɛ mmara sɛ ɔsɛ ngbã iki i me iso - ne mapukutura wũ Awarãyi. Ne ɔso loɣɛ sɔ loakpadzɛ̃ wũ sikpã teterea lofere i ma iso, lowɔra ma i fafuĩ ame. <verse eid="EZK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14" />Ɣɛɛ ala wũ iyere iti ne, lobara nnɛ loatã iibakpese kunuarɛ, i nɖebi mɛ anɔmi ame loɔkɔ Israel mabi lobɔrɛgu. <verse eid="EZK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15" />Ana ne ku kɔrɔ̃ i kato, lokã lotã ma i fafuĩ ame sɔ loibakɔ ma lobɔ i karɔ̃ ga loɔtã ma iso - karɔ̃ sɛɛ ku iɖa, nga nto kalɛnyɔ kaɖo i nrɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="EZK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16" />Loɣɛ nnɛgbe alasɔ masɛ̃ wũ mmara fiɛ maisiai wũ asɛ̃ra, ne mapia wũ Awarãyi ɔgu. Ala ma situ ɔsia i ma arapɔa iso. <verse eid="EZK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17" />Ɣɛɛ lonyɔ ma ku nnya ne loiwɔra ma ɣee loinidza ma i fafuĩ ame. <verse eid="EZK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18" />Loɣere ma mabi i fafuĩ ame sɔ, "Midaasiai mi mase nsɛgbai ɣee midaabara i ma mmara iso ɣee midaapukutura so ku ma arapɔa. <verse eid="EZK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19" />Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, misiai wũ asɛ̃ra si mibara i wũ mmara iso kukaakɔ. <verse eid="EZK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20" />Mibara wũ Awarãyi sekelee, si aaɖe ikparĩ i bo gu mi ndɛ̃. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne."<verse eid="EZK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21" />" 'Ɣɛɛ mabi ɔta maya me iso: Maisiai wũ asɛ̃ra, maimɔɛ̃ wũ mmara mala kukaakɔ - atoasɔ ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔmɔɛ̃ mmara ɔla sɛ ɔsɛ ngbã i me iso. - Ne mapia wũ Awarãyi ɔgu. Ne ɔso loɣɛ sɔ loakpadzɛ̃ wũ sikpã teterea lofere i ma iso. Ne losiaita sɔ loakpadzɛ̃ ma kutsue i fafuĩ ame. <verse eid="EZK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22" />Ɣɛɛ losɛgu wũ kɔrɔ̃ kama, ne ala wũ iyere iti ne, lobara nnɛ loatã sɔ iibaɖe kunuarɛ, i nɖebi mɛ anɔmi ame loɔkɔ ma lobɔrɛgu.<verse eid="EZK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23" />Ana ne ku wũ kɔrɔ̃ i kato, lokã lotã ma i fafuĩ ame sɔ, loasamera ma lopia i nɖebi ndɛ̃ fiɛ loasa ma lopia i nrɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="EZK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24" />Ala maiwarɛ wũ mmara ɣɛɛ maɔsɛ̃ wũ asɛ̃ra fiɛ mapia wũ Awarãyi ɔgu, ne ma anɔmi ɔsia i ma mawa arapɔa iso ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25" />Ana ne, lonyua ma lotã mmara mɛ loilɛ gu mmɛ loisɛ mikɔ ɔturi ɔna ngbã. <verse eid="EZK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26" />Lotã mapukutura so iki i ma karatã - ɔbiɖeakatɔ̃ biara isɔrɛ - si loasu itiikpakpa ku ifɔ̃ lopia i ma ame, si maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.'<verse eid="EZK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27" />"Ne ɔso, ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɣere Israel maturi sɔ, '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: I nnɛgbe ame ana ne mi mawa ɔsɛ̃ me fiɛ matia me. <verse eid="EZK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28" />Ɔwi wɔ lokɔ ma lobɔ i karɔ̃ ga loɔkã sɔ loatã ma iso ne, si manya kabemi karere ɣee kudziri ku ayata kurere ne, mmɔ masɔrɛ ma ara ne. Ne masɔrɛ ara masu mapia me sikpã, masɔrɛ kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã fiɛ mafere ma aranɛa asɔrɛ i karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29" />Kere ne loɣere ma sɔ: Be nɖe kasɔrɛkɔ̃ ga mito misɛ?' " (Masɛ marɔ̃ kã sɔ Bama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bama: Ne karɔ̃ nɖe kasɔrɛkɔ̃</char></note> ipɛ nɔme.)<verse eid="EZK 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutsueikpadzɛ̃ Gu Isɛra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30" />"Ne ɔso ɣere Israel kaɖe sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔkarɛ sɔ: Mito miapukutura so i ɔri wɔ iso i mi mawa ɔbara fiɛ miasiai i ma kumiamia nyanyariã kama? <verse eid="EZK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31" />Gɔ mito mitã mi karatã - ne mito misɔrɛ mi mabi i ɔtɔ ame - ne mitogu so ipukutura ku mi arapɔa ɔɖuɖu ipɛ nɔme ne. O Israel kaɖe, nto loatã sɔ miakarɛ ira minɔ i wũ kɔrɛ? <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso ɔkã sɔ ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, loibatã mikarɛ me ira minɔ.<verse eid="EZK 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32" />" 'Misɛ miɣɛ sɔ, "Boto bobie sɔ boase lɛ nɖebi, lɛ kayiiso maturi ma nsɛ masɔrɛ ata gu adziri." Ɣɛɛ nnɛ miba i adzuni ame iibaba i kame.<verse eid="EZK 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Ɔɣɛ Ɔsɛ Sɔ Ɔ̃aledza Israel Isɛra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso ɔkã sɔ, ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, nto loaɖe mi iso ku kɔrɔ̃ ɔle siare. Loto lokɔlɛ kɔrɔ̃ siare kato gu sikpã teterea losia i mi iso. <verse eid="EZK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34" />Loto loasa mi kanya - ku kɔrɔ̃ ɔle gu kɔrɔ̃ siare ikɔlɛ kato ku sikpã teterea, lobɔrɛgu i nɖebi gu nrɔ̃ mɛ ame miɔsame mipia. <verse eid="EZK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35" />Nto loakɔ mi lobɔ i nɖebi mɛ i fafuĩ ame, ne loatã mi ipɔ anɔ ku anɔ i mmɔ. <verse eid="EZK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ sɔ: Loto loakpadzɛ̃ mi kutsue lɛ lobara mi mawa i Egipte fafuĩ karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37" />Loto loanyɔ mi losɛ ikpo kukaakɔ gɔ mito miki i kutseikpadzɛ̃ ame fiɛ loabɔ mi i ndamu mɛ lobara asɛra kayirinɔ. <verse eid="EZK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38" />Loto loaɖi mma lota maya me iso ku ikpi ise i mi matsɔra iso. Atoasɔ nto loakɔ ma lobɔrɛgu i ngbegɔ i karɔ̃ ga ame masi ɣɛɛ ne, maibabo i Israel karɔ̃ iso. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39" />" ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, O Israel kaɖe, mi ne, mi ɔbiara si mikɛlɛ miasumu mi arapɔa! Ɣɛɛ ne kama ne, gbaã mito miakã me atsue fiɛ mianyua kunuarɛ ibɔ i wũ iyere sekelea iwarɛ iso ku mi karatã itã arapɔa. <verse eid="EZK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ala i wũ kube sekelea, Israel kube kɔlɛa iso ne, mmɔ i karɔ̃ ame ne, Israel maturi ɔɖuɖu to maasumu me iyi iwɛ̃, ne loafɔ ma lopia. Mmɔ loabie sɔ mibɔ me mi asɔrɛ gu mi karatã sɛɛ si misɔrɛ ku mi asɔrɛ sekelea ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41" />Loto loafɔ mi lopia lɛ kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã, si losa mi kanya loɖi mi lobɔrɛgu, i nɖebi gu i nrɔ̃ mɛ ame miɔsame mipia. Ne loaɖi so lote sɔ lose sekelee i mi ndɛ̃ i nɖebi anɔmi ame ne. <verse eid="EZK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42" />Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, si lokɔ mi lobɔ i Israel karɔ̃ ame, karɔ̃ ga loɔkɔlɛ kɔrɔ̃ kato lokã sɔ loto loatã mi mawa. <verse eid="EZK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43" />Mmɔ mito mianyigi mi nsɛgbai gu ara wa miɔbara misu mipukutura so. Ne ito iabo mi so ala aranyanyariã ɔɖuɖu wa miɔbara iti. <verse eid="EZK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Israel kaɖe, mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> lo, si lokpadzɛ̃ mi kutsue ala wũ iyere iti. Ne iiɖe mi siri nyanyariã gu mi ɔtile kurabarara gu i mi kubarara gɔ minina so ala iti.' "<verse eid="EZK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Kagbalɔ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 20:45" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 20:46" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, su fɔ anɔ nyɔ kagbalɔ. Ɣɛ itɔ̃me si aɖikanya ata aya i kagbalɔ karɔ̃ ipo iso. <verse eid="EZK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 20:47" />Ɣere kagbalɔ ipo sɔ, 'Nɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me. Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Ka nto loba loapia-ɔ ɔtɔ, ne ɔ̃atsuedza fɔ adziri ɔɖuɖu, ayuɛ gu akorea pelepele. Ɔtɔ wɔ lowara ɔto ɔtsue ne, ɔ̃ibanyi ne irabiara ita i kagbalɔ ikɛlɛ katikpe to iatsue. <verse eid="EZK 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 20:48" />Ɔbiara to ɔ̃anya sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Mme loɔpia ɔtɔ, ɔ̃ibanyi.' "<verse eid="EZK 20:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 20:49" />Kere ne loɣɛ sɔ, "Ao <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso! Mato maɣɛ i wũ iso sɔ, 'Iiɖe agbã kere ɔto ɔpɛ ɣɛɛ?' "<verse eid="EZK 20:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Bosate Kutsueikpadzɛ̃ Ipɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, su anɔ nyɔ Yerusalem si aɣɛ itɔ̃me ita iya i isɔrɛyo iso. Ɖikanya ta ya i Israel karɔ̃ iso <verse eid="EZK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3" />si aɣere Israel karɔ̃ sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Lota loɣɛ-ɔ iso. Nto loakpadzɛ̃ wũ ipɛmi loɖi i ɔyuɛ ame, lowɔra maturi bɔlɔlɔa gu matilese inyɔ ɔɖuɖu loɖi-ɔ iso. <verse eid="EZK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4" />Nto loaɖi wũ ipɛmi i ɔyuɛ ame losia i ɔturi biara iso ita i kagbalɔ ikɛlɛ katikpe, alasɔ nto loba loawɔra maturi bɔlɔlɔa gu matilese inyɔ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5" />Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu to maatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔkpadzɛ̃ ɔ̃ ipɛmi ɔɖi i ɔyuɛ ame fiɛ iisibakpese kama ana.'<verse eid="EZK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6" />"Ne ɔso ɔturi awune ɔbi tɔrɛ̃! Tɔrɛ̃ i ma anɔ ku isoma ɔtu gu imararãso ku ibɛbɛrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7" />Ne si makarɛ-ɔ sɔ, 'Be ɔso ato atɔtɔrɛ̃ ɣɛɛ?' Si aaɣɛ sɔ, 'Ala itɔ̃me nɛ nto iba ɔso. Ɔtu biara to ɔ̃awanɛkɛ̃ fiɛ kɔrɔ̃ biara aakpa fiɛ ɔbiara to ɔ̃afɛ̃, ne igɛgɛ̃ biara to iafɛ̃ lɛ ndu ɔso .' Ito iba! Gbaã, ito iaba, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ."<verse eid="EZK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9" />Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya si aɣɛ sɔ, ' Sate sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:9">" 'Ipɛmi iwɛ̃, ipɛmiɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:9">maruɛ ne fiɛ mabara ne pɔlɔpɔlɔ -<verse eid="EZK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10" />maruɛ ne matã iraiɖue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:10">mabara ne pɔlɔpɔlɔ si ifiɛ lɛ ɔtɔimama!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 21:10">" 'Boto boana isoɣɔ i wũ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Yuda kugarapɛ iso? Ipɛmi sɛ inyɔ ɔdziri biara wɔmɔ igbã pupurii.<verse eid="EZK 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11" />" 'Maɔɖi ipɛmi masɛ sɔ maabara ne pɔlɔpɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:11">si kɔrɔ̃ aamɔɛ̃ ne ila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">Maɔruɛ ne fiɛ maɔbara ne pɔlɔpɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:11">ka ipia i iledza ame itã nwɔ loawɔra ara.<verse eid="EZK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12" />Ɔturi awune ɔbi, biɛ ku isoma si asora nnɔmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">ala ita iɣɛ i wũ maturi iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">Ita iɣɛ i Israel matɔ̃ɖedze iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Mato mafuĩdza ma matã ipɛmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">ku wũ maturi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Ne ɔso pɛ so igbegbe.<verse eid="EZK 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ, " 'Gbaã ne ilainyɔ to iaba. Be loaba si Yuda kugarapɛ, ngɔ i ipɛmi sɛ inyɔ pupurii, iisikɛlɛ i katɔ̃?'<verse eid="EZK 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14" />"Ɔso iyɔ ne, ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">si apɛ arɔ̃kpasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Tã ipɛmi si iwuĩ ara iledza ara iwuĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">iwuĩ kɔraa ikpɛ itɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Iraiɖue ipɛmi iɖe -</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">ipɛmi itã iraiɖue siare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">ibɔrɛ i kasɛ biara isɛ ito iba i ma iso.<verse eid="EZK 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15" />Ne ɔso situ to siabiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">fiɛ mma loarɔ̃ to maasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">Loɔɣedza ipɛmi lotã iraiɖue</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">i ma kuyogodɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">Ao! Mabara ne sɔ ifiɛ lɛ ɔtɔimama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">maɔmɔɛ̃ ne matã iraiɖue.<verse eid="EZK 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16" />Ipɛmi, pia igbɛ kɛlɛgu kuɖearɔ̃ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:16">iyɔ si apia igbɛ i kubena iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:16">si apia igbɛ i kakɔi biara ga i fɔ ipɛmi iki lo.<verse eid="EZK 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17" />Mme wũ nto lopɛ arɔ̃kpasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:17">iyɔ wũ sikpã teterea to siabakarɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:17">Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika."<verse eid="EZK 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babilonia Igara Ipɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ta siri inyɔ tã Babilon igara ipɛmi si iaki. Siri inyɔ ɔɖuɖu aasɛkarɔ̃ sibɔrɛ i karɔ̃ kawɛ̃ ame. Bara ikparĩɣedzaa i irikpasa i ngbegɔ i ɔri ɔsɛnɛkɛ̃ ɔki ɔkpa ɔmagɛ̃siare ame. <verse eid="EZK 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20" />Ta ɔri ɔwɛ̃ wɔ iso i ipɛmi aaki ita iya i ma Amonse ɔmagɛ̃siare Raba iso. Si ata ɔri ɔnyɔare wɔ lota ɔya i Yuda gu Yerusalem wɔ matsue ibere mapia iso. <verse eid="EZK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21" />Ala Babilon igara to ɔ̃atuĩ i irikpasa, ngbegɔ i siri inyɔ ɔsakanya, si ɔnya ikparĩ: Ɔto ɔ̃abara kareremi ku mirɛ̃. Ɔto ɔ̃akarɛ ara i ɔ̃ arapɔa kɔrɛ ɔnɔ, fiɛ ɔto ɔ̃adzuĩ kumɛgɔ i kɔkɔ aarɛ si maɖue wũ. <verse eid="EZK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22" />Si ikparĩ ɔkɛlɛ kuɖearɔ̃ iso ne ite sɔ Yerusalem. Mmɔ ilɛ sɔ ɔ̃asɛ akpakpɛ̃ra wa masɛ masu mabiɛ ibere i kakpã ame fiɛ silɔ aare sitã kakpã gu ituriɖue. Maaɣedza akpo ara i kuyogodɔ̃ iso, mali akpo i ibere iso si maɣedza itɛ̃ipia ara. <verse eid="EZK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23" />Yerusalem maturi to maanyɔ sɔ sila sibɔ siɖe ala kanyakawɛ̃ ga maɔbaragu wũ ɔso. Ɣɛɛ igara to ɔ̃anyigira ma i ma ikpi iso, fiɛ ɔto ɔ̃amɔɛ̃ ma mayorɛdze.<verse eid="EZK 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24" />"Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, 'Ala mito minyigira me mi ikpi ku mi itaiyaiso kpawee, fiɛ mito mibara ikpi i irabiara nɛ mito mibara ame - ala mibara nnɛgbe ɔso ne, mato maamɔɛ̃ mi mayorɛdze.<verse eid="EZK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25" />" 'O Israel ɔɖeisoi ɔtilese gu nwɔ loisekele, nwɔ iyi loɔba, nwɔ kutsueikpadzɛ̃ katsɔrakɔ̃ ɔwi ɔɔɣo, <verse eid="EZK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26" />nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Ɖi fɔ itinyira, si asisi igarakoto. Iisibase lɛ ise saa: Mma mabɔkarɔ̃ ka mato maakɔlɛ kato fiɛ mma makɔlɛ kato ka mato maabɔkarɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27" />Iwɔ! Iwɔ! Loto loabara ne iwɔra! Maisibatara wũ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ nwɔ ɔkpɛ ikote ɔba, ɔ̃ nto loasu ne lotã ne.'<verse eid="EZK 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma Amonse Gu Ipɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, fɔ ne, ɖikanya si aɣɛ sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ i ma Amonse gu ma sitia iso ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">" 'Ipɛmi iwɛ̃, ipɛmiɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:28">maɔkpadzɛ̃ ne maɖi i ɔyuɛ ame itã iraiɖue.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">Mabara ne iso pɔlɔpɔlɔ gɔ iaɖe ara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:28">fiɛ iafiɛ ifere lɛ ɔtɔimama!<verse eid="EZK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29" />Fɔ kanyamaɖidze ɔtã-ɔ kasɔla kuɖikute i fɔ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">fiɛ fɔ sibɔmapɛdze ɔɔɣɛ mila ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">Mato maasu wã mapia i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">matilese ma mato maaɖue sime iso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">mma iyi loɔba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">Mma kutsueikpadzɛ̃ ɔwi katsɔrakɔ̃ loɔɣo.<verse eid="EZK 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30" />Kpesera ipɛmi pia i ne ɔyuɛ ame.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:30">I ngbegɔ mabara-ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:30">i fɔ mawa mɛrɛ̃ karɔ̃ ame.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:30">Nto loaɣɛgu-ɔ atɔ̃me.<verse eid="EZK 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31" />Loto loaɖi wũ sikpã teterea lofere-ɔ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:31">fiɛ loawarã wũ sikpã nyanyariã lɛ ɔtɔ lofere-ɔ iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:31">Loto loasu-ɔ lopia i matilese nrɔɔ̃ ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:31">marɛrɛ̃ ma mba kusɛ̃ i ara iwɔra ame.<verse eid="EZK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32" />Ato aakpese ira nɛ masɛ mapia i ɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:32">Mato maafere fɔ ima i fɔ karɔ̃ iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:32">Maisibanyigi-ɔ ana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:32">alasɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika.' "<verse eid="EZK 21:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Akpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ato aaɣɛgu ɔmagɛ̃siare itɔ̃me? Ato aaɣɛgu ituriɖue ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔgbe atɔ̃me? Iyɔ ne su ɔ̃ anyanya kubarara ɔɖuɖu sɛ i ɔ̃ anɔ <verse eid="EZK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3" />si aɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: O maturiɖuese ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔ nsɛ ɔkpadzɛ̃ kutsueikpadzɛ̃ ɔbɔ so iki i imaiferekarɔ̃ i ɔ̃ ame fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔpukutura so ku arapɔa ibara. <verse eid="EZK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4" />Ɔɔɖe ipɔ ala ima nɛ afere i karɔ̃ fiɛ ɔɔpukutura so ala arapɔa wa abara ɔso. Ɔɔkpadzɛ̃ fɔ ayi abɔ kawirikɔ̃, ne fɔ akɔ kawirikɔ̃ ɔɔba ne. Ne ɔso nto loabara-ɔ aɣiãra ira lotã nɖebi gu simaira lotã nrɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5" />Mma i kakotekɔ̃ gu mma i kadzorokɔ̃ to maabara-ɔ aɣiãra sɔ, O ɔtile ɔmagɛ̃siare, ɔyigu ikpɔkpɔtɔ.<verse eid="EZK 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6" />" 'Nyɔ kumɛgɔ i Israel tɔ̃ɖedze biara wɔ i fɔ ame sɛ ɔsu ɔ̃ ɔle ɔfere ima i karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7" />Maturi sɛ manyɔ ma mase gu ma manyi pupurii i fɔ ame. Maɔyika mafɔ mabɔkarɔ̃ fiɛ maɔbara makpisemare gu masekpibi ɔtile i fɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8" />Miɔnyɔ wũ ara sekelea pupurii ne mipia wũ Awarãyi ɔgu. <verse eid="EZK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9" />Marɛrɛ̃ ma nsɛ manina maturi mama ayere fiɛ masɛ maɖue maturi pia i fɔ ame. Mma nsɛ maɖe ara i aɣɔka fiɛ masɛ mabara situripɛ̃ ara pia i fɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10" />Mma nsɛ marɛgu ma mase mare pia i fɔ ame. Mma nsɛ mapɛgu marɔ̃go ma nɣɛ i kayoma gɔ maisekele i kubarara kanya pia i fɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11" />I fɔ ame ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ sɛ ɔbara iɣɛrɛ nyanyariã ku ɔ̃ ɔnyii ɔre. Ɔmama sɛ ɔrɛgu ɔ̃ ɔbire ku kunuarɛ fiɛ ɔmama sɛ ɔpɛgu ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ɔnyiiko wɔ nɖe ɔ̃ ɔse ɔbibirɔ̃gomi. <verse eid="EZK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12" />I fɔ ame ne maturi sɛ mafɔ kawɛrɛra maɖue maturi. Misɛ mifɔ kusia gu kusia ife isi si minyɛ sikã mitã fiɛ misɛ mina kusia gɔ loikote mibɔrɛgu i mi manyii iyu ame. Ne miɔɣara me ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13" />" 'Gbaã ne nto loapɛ arɔ̃kpasa ala kusia gɔ mina kuikote gu ima nɛ mifere i karɔ̃ i fɔ ame iti. <verse eid="EZK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14" />Mi katetere ɣee mi nrɔɔ̃ to miawe ɔle ku iyi nɛ loaɣɛgu mi itɔ̃me? Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɣɛ ne fiɛ nto loabara ne. <verse eid="EZK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15" />Nto loasamera mi lopia i nɖebi ndɛ̃ fiɛ losa mi lopia i nrɔ̃ ame. Ne loasu mi idaasekele lobɔ kawirikɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16" />Si nɖebi maturi ɔɔpukutura mi ne, mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' "<verse eid="EZK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Isekelera Ɔferewu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, i wũ kɔrɛ ne Israel kaɖe ɔkpese lɛ ibɔratini nɛ nsɛ ikuti si mawanɛkɛ̃ra sikãfudza. Ne ɔɖuɖu ɖe ibɔrarɛtɛa, ibɔrabui, ibɔrakpinaa gu sompi wa lokuti i ɔferewu ame. Aɖe ara wa nsɛ akuti si mawanɛkɛ̃ra sikãfudza. <verse eid="EZK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19" />Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, 'Ala mi ɔɖuɖu ɔɔkpese ibɔratini nɛ lokuti si mawanɛkɛ̃ra sikãfudza ɔso ne, loasa mi kanya lopia i Yerusalem. <verse eid="EZK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20" />Lɛ kumɛgɔ maturi sɛ masa sikãfudza, ibɔrarɛtɛa, ibɔrakpinaa, sompi gu ibɔrabui kanya mapia i ɔferewu ame si mawanɛkɛ̃ra ku ɔtɔ siare ne, kumɛɔ nto loasa mi kanya i wũ sikpã gu sikpã teterea ame, losu mi lopia i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame fiɛ loawanɛkɛ̃ra mi ne. <verse eid="EZK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21" />Nto loasa mi kanya fiɛ loafuĩdza wũ sikpã teterea dzɛ nse lɛ ɔtɔ lofere i mi iso, ne mito miawanɛkɛ̃ i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame ne. <verse eid="EZK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22" />Lɛ kumɛgɔ masɛ mawanɛkɛ̃ra sikãfudza i ɔferewu ame ne, kumɛɔ mato maawanɛkɛ̃ra mi i ɔ̃ ame. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔfedza ɔ̃ sikpã teterea ɔfere i mi iso.' "<verse eid="EZK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Matɔ̃ɖedze Akpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me ana sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɣere maturi ma i Israel karɔ̃ iso sɔ, 'Aɖe karɔ̃ ga loisɛ ka ɔ̃ɔna kado kuwɛ̃ ɣee kado inyɛnyɛrɛ̃ ku wũ sikpã teterea ɔwi.' <verse eid="EZK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25" />Maɖeisoi sɛ mabara adzuni awɛ̃ i ɔ̃ ame lɛ dzata wɔ nto ɔfafã ɔkɛkɛ ira nɛ ɔmɔɛ̃. Masɛ makɛkɛ maturi masu arakɔlaa gu arafɔkuɣa ku ɔɣiɛ fiɛ masɛ matã makpisemare ɔsi i ɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26" />Ɔ̃ masɔrɛdze sɛ matu wũ mmara fiɛ masɛ mapukutura wũ ara sekelea. Maisɛ mapia ikpaki i ira sekelea gu nnɛ loisekele ndɛ̃. Masɛ mate sɔ ikpaki kuiwɛ̃ na i nnɛ losekele gu nnɛ loisekele ndɛ̃. Ne masɛ mama anɔmi masia i wũ Awarãyi imɔɛ̃ ila iso. Ne ɔso masɛ mapia me kunuarɛ i ma ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27" />Ɔ̃ makpakpa ma i ɔ̃ ame se lɛ magidi nto makɛkɛ nnɛ mamɔɛ̃. Masɛ mafere ima i karɔ̃ fiɛ masɛ maɖue maturi si mana sikã i ɔri wɔ loiya iso. <verse eid="EZK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28" />Ne ɔ̃ kanyamaɖidze sɛ makua ara wagbe ku kasɔla kuɖikute gu mila sibɔipɛ. Masɛ maɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ' - ku ɔwi wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iiɖeika. <verse eid="EZK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29" />Maturi ma i karɔ̃ iso sɛ maɖe amumu fiɛ masɛ mayukayu. Masɛ mayika mawɛrɛba gu maɣiãni mabɔkarɔ̃. Ne masɛ mabara mafɔ kako masɛ̃ itɔ̃meɣɛiriso itã ma.<verse eid="EZK 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30" />"Lonyɔ ɔri lotã ɔrere wɔ loaledza ibere itara i ma ndɛ̃ fiɛ ɔ̃aya i wũ anɔ i kabiɛkɔ̃ i karɔ̃ anemu, si loibasɛ loawɔra kã, ɣɛɛ loinya kuwɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ sɔ, ne ɔso nto loafedza wũ sikpã teterea lofere i ma iso fiɛ loawɔra ma ku sikpã dzɛ nsɛ sitsue lɛ ɔtɔ. Loto loasu nwa ɔɖuɖu maɔbara ikpe losia i ma mɔmɔ ati iso."<verse eid="EZK 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Manyibirɔ̃gomi Inyɔ Asɔrɔ̃iɖe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, marɔ̃go inyɔ ma loɖe ɔnyi ɔwɛ̃ mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔwe. <verse eid="EZK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3" />Makpese masɔrɔ̃ɖedze i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. Mato mabara marɛrɛĩsiai nɛgbe ta ma sibitɛ ame. Matã marɛrɛ̃ ɔpɛgu fiɛ mamama ma anyɛ wa i igbegbe ku ma sinyɛnyɛĩ i karɔ̃ gamɔ iso. <verse eid="EZK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4" />Marɔ kpakpare sɔ Oxola, ne makpere ɔ̃ ɔnyibi sɔ Oxoliba. Maɖe wũ ɔkpɛ ne maɣe mabirɛrɛĩ gu mabirɔ̃gomi. Oxola nɖe Samaria ne Oxoliba nɖe Yerusalem.<verse eid="EZK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5" />"Oxola ɔbara asɔrɔĩɖe gɔ ɔkpese ɔɖe wũ ɔkpɛ. Ne ɔsu kuɖuɛ ɔtã ɔ̃ maɖuɛdze, ma Asiriase. <verse eid="EZK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:6" />Ma Asiriase ɔɖuɖu magbe ɔɖe makpãrɛrɛĩ ma lopia arapia bulu, manyɔisose gu silɔmaɖidze, ma ɔɖuɖu ɔɖe maporoporoi ma lore situri, ne masɛ apɔngɔ. <verse eid="EZK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7" />Ne ɔso ɔɖe sidzetɔ ku Asiria marɛrɛ̃ ma losɛkatɔ̃, ne ɔpukutura so ku ɔbiara arapɔa wa ɔsiai ku kuɖuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8" />Ɔ̃inyua asɔrɔĩɖe wa ɔsɛkarɔ̃ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. Ɔwi wɔ i ɔ̃ sibitɛ ame ne marɛrɛ̃ ɔrɛgu wũ, mamama fiɛ mapɔrɛ wũ mapia so gɔ ɔɖe ɔbitɛ fiɛ mabara wũ lɛ sɔrɔ̃ɖedze.<verse eid="EZK 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9" />"Ne ɔso losu wũ lopia i ɔ̃ maɖuɛdze ma Asiriase nrɔɔ̃ ame, alasɔ ma ɔɖuɛ ne. <verse eid="EZK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10" />Mabɛ wũ arapia iso maɖi isɔ̃, masu ɔ̃ mabirɛrɛĩ gu mabirɔ̃gomi maruigu ne maɖue wũ ku ipɛmi. Ɔkpese simaira i marɔ̃go ndɛ̃, ne makpadzɛ̃ wũ kutsue ne.<verse eid="EZK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11" />"Ɔ̃ ɔnyibi Oxoliba ɔnya nnɛgbe, ɣɛɛ i ɔ̃ sidzetɔiɖe gu asɔrɔĩɖe ame ne ɔnina so kɔraa ɔɖo ɔ̃ ɔnyibi. <verse eid="EZK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12" />Ɔ̃ wũ ɔwe kuɖuɛ ɔtã ma Asiriase - maɖe manyɔisose, silɔmaɖidze, makpakpa ma lopia arapia kukaakɔ fiɛ masɛ apɔngɔ ma ɔɖuɖu ɔɖe maporoporoi ma lore situri. <verse eid="EZK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13" />Lonya sɔ ɔ̃ wũ ɔpukutura so, ma inyɔ ɔɖuɖu ɔki i ɔri ɔwɛ̃saã iso.<verse eid="EZK 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14" />"Ɣɛɛ Oxoliba ne ɔkɛlɛgu i ɔ̃ asɔrɔĩɖe katɔ̃ ɔbua. Ɔɖuɛ marɛrɛ̃ kumiamia gɔ makua i abere iso, ma Kaldease<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɣee ma Babiloniase</char></note> makpakpa ma kukua rɛtɛa arapia kumiamia. <verse eid="EZK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:15" />Kufiami gɔ nto kulɛnyɔ ɔwe i ma sisɔ ku atinyira wa lokarã afere i ati iso. Ma ɔɖuɖu ɔnyɔ lɛ kubore makpakpa ma lobɔrɛ i Babilonia karɔ̃ iso, Kaldea maturi godɛã. <verse eid="EZK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16" />Kumɛgɔ ame Oxoliba ɔnya ara wa makua ne, ɔɖuɛ wã ne ɔsese makpabo i ma kɔrɛ i Kaldea karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17" />Kere ne ma Babiloniase ɔba i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ, ne i kuɖuɛ ɔmɛrɛ̃ ame ne, mapukutura wũ i kuɖuɛ karɛkɔ̃ iso. Ɔwi wɔ maɔpukutura wũ kama ne, ɔpɛ ɔfiriki i ma iso ɔsɛ̃ ma. <verse eid="EZK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18" />Ɔwi wɔ ɔ̃ɔkɛlɛgu ɔ̃ asɔrɔĩɖe katɔ̃ kpawee fiɛ ɔ̃ɔɖi so isɔ̃ ɔla ne, lotsiri wũ ne losɛ̃ wũ lɛ kumɛgɔ loɔsɛ̃ ɔ̃ ɔnyibi. <verse eid="EZK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19" />Ɣɛɛ Oxoliba ɔkpese ɔkɛlɛgu asɔrɔĩɖe katɔ̃ ɔbua lɛ ɔnyigi ɔ̃ sibitɛ ɔwi ku ɔwi wɔ ɔɖe sɔrɔ̃ɖedze i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20" />Mmɔ ɔɖuɛ ɔ̃ maɖuɛdze ku kubie ne, mma sirɛrɛ̃ lose lɛ mafiripɔngɔ sire fiɛ ma kukuritu ɔse lɛ apɔngɔ kure awe. <verse eid="EZK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21" />Ne ɔso ɔwi wɔ awe i Egipte mala maɔma-ɔ sibitɛ anyɛ ku sinyɛnyɛĩ gu ngbɔ mala maɔpɔpɔrɛ-ɔ ne, abie fɔ sibitɛ ininaso nɛmɔ ana.<verse eid="EZK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22" />"Ne ɔso, Oxoliba, nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Loto loatara fɔ maɖuɛdze, mma apɛ afiriki asɛ̃ ku itsiri, loakpadzɛ̃ ma mata maya-ɔ iso i ibaba biara iso. <verse eid="EZK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23" />Ala ne ma Babiloniase to maaba ku ma Kaldease ɔɖuɖu, marɛrɛ̃ ma i Pekod gu Soa gu Koa. Ma Asiriase ɔɖuɖu to maaba ku ma - maporoporoi ma lore situri, ma ɔɖuɖu ɔɖe manyɔisose, silɔmaɖidze, kubore makpakpa gu marɛrɛ̃ ku siɖebia kɔlɛa, ma ɔɖuɖu ɔsɛ i apɔngɔ iso. <verse eid="EZK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24" />Mato maaba maata maya-ɔ iso ku akpakpɛ̃ra, kubore gu makeke ku maturi kposu. Mato maya i ngɔi maki malɔ-ɔ i kasɛ biara ku akpirafɔra siare gu akosoi ku abɔrakoto i ati iso. Loto loasu-ɔ lopia i ma nrɔɔ̃ ame itã kutsueikpadzɛ̃ fiɛ mato maakpadzɛ̃-ɔ kutsue i ma asɛra kanya. <verse eid="EZK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25" />Loto loaɖi wũ sirerɛ sikpã lota loya-ɔ iso fiɛ mato maabara-ɔ ku sikpã. Mato maatu mi siɣɔ̃ gu atsue fiɛ mi ma loakuti to miarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya. Mato maasu mi mabirɛrɛĩ gu mi mabirɔ̃gomi lɛ masande fiɛ mi ma loakuti ne ɔtɔ loatsuedza mi. <verse eid="EZK 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26" />Mato maabɛ arapia i mi iso fiɛ mato maasu mi akɛrɛra sɛɛ. <verse eid="EZK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27" />Ne ɔso loatuĩdza fɔ ininaso gu asɔrɔĩɖe wa asɛkarɔ̃ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. Aisibabie ara wagbe ɣee aisibanyigi Egipte ana.<verse eid="EZK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28" />"Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ka nto loba loasu-ɔ lopia i mma atsiri nrɔɔ̃ ame, mma apɛ afirki asɛ̃ ku itsiri. <verse eid="EZK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29" />Mato maabara-ɔ ku itsiri ne mato maasu irabiara nɛ abara karabara fiɛ ana. Mato manyua-ɔ masɛ isɔ̃ gu kpawee, iyɔ fɔ asɔrɔĩɖe kunuarɛ aabɔrɛ kayi. Fɔ ininaso gu asɔrɔĩɖe <verse eid="EZK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:30" />loɔkpadzɛ̃ nnɛgbe abɔ-ɔ iso. Ala abie nɖebi ne aɖe asɔrɔ̃ ku ma ne apukutura so ku ma arapɔa. <verse eid="EZK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31" />Ɔɔsore fɔ ɔnyibi Oxola, ne ɔso nnɛ lobara wũ loabara-ɔ fɔ wũ.<verse eid="EZK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32" />"Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">"Ato aanɛ abɔrɛgu i fɔ ɔnyibi ikɔi ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">ikɔi nɛ lomɔ fiɛ iwodoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Ito iabɔ sima gu aɣiãra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">alasɔ iyi pɔpɔɔpɔ.<verse eid="EZK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33" />Ato aayigu irɛ̃ gu isoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:33">fɔ ikɔi nɛ loyigu iwɔ gu ikpakpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:33">fɔ ɔnyibi Samaria ikɔi iɖe.<verse eid="EZK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34" />Ato aanɛ ne iro ta karɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:34">ato aawuĩ ne ibibiɛ ibara kusɛi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:34">fiɛ aakɛkɛ fɔ anyɛ wa i igbegbe.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 23:34">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ sɔ, loɔɖeika.<verse eid="EZK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35" />"Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Gɔ ɔɔɣara me fiɛ apɛ kama afirikira atã me ɔso ne, ikote sɔ aafɔ fɔ ininaso gu asɔrɔĩɖe isuɖea."<verse eid="EZK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Ɔkpadzɛ̃ Manyiko Inyɔ Kutsue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ato aaɣɛgu Oxola gu Oxoliba atɔ̃me? Iyɔ su ma anyanya kubarara sɛ i ma anɔ, <verse eid="EZK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37" />ala maɔɖe asɔrɔ̃ fiɛ ma nrɔɔ̃ ɔpɛ ima. Maɖe asɔrɔ̃ ku ma arapɔa, masɔrɛ ta ma mabi, mabi ma maɣe matã me, lɛ aɖera matã arapɔa. <verse eid="EZK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38" />Ana ne maɔbara me nnɛgbe: Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ana ne mapukutura wũ isɔrɛyo ne mapia wũ Awarãyi ɔgu. <verse eid="EZK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39" />Iyi nɛ ame tutuutu masɔrɛ ma mabi matã ma arapɔa ne, mabo i wũ isɔrɛyo ame ne mapia ne ɔgu ne. Nnɛmɔ mabara i wũ iyo ame ne.<verse eid="EZK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40" />"Kɔraa ne masese makpabo masɛ maakpere maturi ma lobɔrɛ i kadzorokɔ̃. Kere ne ɔwi wɔ maba ne, mipie ndu ne miledza so mikua mi anɔmi ara ne mipia mi akɛrɛra ala ma ɔso ne. <verse eid="EZK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41" />Misɛ i kasɛkɔ̃ sɛɛ tagbaraa ga ku ɔpɔrɔ̃ wɔ masɛ i kã katɔ̃. Ne miɔsu wũ kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã gu nnɔĩ wa nɖe wũ are misia iso.<verse eid="EZK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42" />"Maturi ma loisu kuira kulu ɔla kuki kulɔ ɔrɔ̃go. Makɔ ma Sabese mabɔrɛgu i fafuĩ ame ku marɛrɛ̃ ma lobɔrɛ i mma loisu kuira ame. Ne masu akɛrɛra mapia i ɔrɔ̃go gu ɔ̃ ɔnyibi kɔrɔ̃. Ne matɔmedza ma igarakoto wa nto alɛnyɔ i ma ati. <verse eid="EZK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43" />Kere ne loɣɛ i nwɔ i so ɔtu ku sidzetɔ sɔ, 'Kiniɔ tã mazã wũ lɛ sɔrɔ̃ɖedze, ala ne ngbɔ ɔturi kowũ ɔɖe ne.' <verse eid="EZK 23:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44" />Ne marɛgu wũ ne. Ne lɛ kumɛgɔ i marɛrɛ̃ sɛ marɛgu sɔrɔ̃ɖedze ne, kumɛɔ ame marɛgu Oxola gu Oxoliba, marɔ̃go ma lonina so ne. <verse eid="EZK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45" />Ɣɛɛ marɛrɛ̃ bɔlɔlɔa to maaɣɛgu ma itɔ̃me, matã ma kutsueikpadzɛ̃ gɔ masɛ matã marɔ̃go ma lofe ma marã kama. Ala masɛ maɖe sidzetɔ ne ima sɛ ipɛ ma nrɔɔ̃ ɔso.<verse eid="EZK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46" />"<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Mikpere maturi ikuri si mata maya i ma iso, si misu ma mitã itiikpakpa gu kakpãramɔɛã. <verse eid="EZK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47" />Maturi ikuri to maapɛ ma ata fiɛ maakpira ma ku apɛmi. Mato maaɖue ma mabirɛrɛĩ gu mabirɔ̃gomi fiɛ maatsuedza ma ayo.<verse eid="EZK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48" />"Ne ɔso nto loatuĩdza ininaso i karɔ̃ ame, si marɔ̃go ɔɖuɖu aafɔ isɛ̃itã fiɛ maibasore mi. <verse eid="EZK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49" />Mito miaweinyɛ i mi sidzetɔ iti kuso fiɛ miafɔ kuso i mi iɣɔsɔrɛ akpi iti. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso."<verse eid="EZK 23:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ikparĩ i Ibui Nɛ Ame Masɛ Mawa Ara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1" />I ikɔ kaiwɛ̃va i ma Yudase kuwa kuweova iyi iweova iso ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, sɛ iyi nɛgbe ikpo, nɔme iyi tutuutu. Ala Babilon igara ɔɔtɛ̃ Yerusalem ɔpia ku nɔme iyi tutuutu ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3" />Pɛ atsuele kaɖe gagbe igbã si aɣere ma sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">" 'Fere ndu i itubui ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:3">si asu asia i ɔtɔ iso.<verse eid="EZK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4" />Su sina kusɛi pia i ne ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:4">sina sɛɛ kusɛi ɔɖuɖu - kukpa gu imɔiti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">Yira itubui ku mina ku akui sɛɛ wa nlɛ aɖo.<verse eid="EZK 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:5" />Su masɛrɛrerɔ̃ mina sɛɛ kere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">Pia ndɔrɛ̃ i itubui ku mina kayirinɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:5">Tã si ifu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">iwa sina ku akui wa i ne ame.<verse eid="EZK 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6" />" 'Ala nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">" ' Ndzo mitã maturiɖuedze ɔmagɛ̃siare.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">Ndzo mitã iwabui nɛ loɔpɛmatɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">nnɛ ɔkpiti maibawo ɔfore ɔɖi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">Ɖi sina kasɛi kawɛ̃ kawɛ̃ i ne ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">gɔ aibabara kareremi i mina iso.<verse eid="EZK 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7" />" 'Ala ima nɛ ɔfere i karɔ̃ pia i ɔ̃ ame ɔso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:7">Ɔ̃isu ne ɔfere i karɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:7">ngbegɔ i sise aafu ne iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:7">Ɔfere ne i atasiare wawe iso.<verse eid="EZK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8" />Si ɔtara sikpã teterea si mabara matikuso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:8">losu ɔ̃ ima lofere i itasiare wawe iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:8">si maibafu ne ara.<verse eid="EZK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9" />" 'Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:9">" ' Ndzo mitã maturiɖuedze ɔmagɛ̃siare!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:9">Mme wũ, nto loasia ndɔrɛ̃ ikpe ikɔlɛ.<verse eid="EZK 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10" />Ne ɔso sia ndɔrɛ̃ ikpe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">si atsue ɔtɔ apia si ɔmɔɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:10">Wa sina kukaakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">si alupu akɔrɔ̃kɔrɔ̃ra ku sina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">Ne si atã akui si atsue.<verse eid="EZK 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11" />Iyɔ si asu iwabui kunu asia i atɔgirĩ iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:11">gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ iafe ɔtɔ ne ibɔrarɛtɛa ɔrɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">Si ne anyini aawanɛkɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:11">iyɔ ne ɔkpiti aatsue ɔbɔrɛ.<verse eid="EZK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12" />Ne kubɛ ɔɖuɖu ɖe siefe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:12">maiɖi ne ɔkpiti ku ɔrɔrã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:12">atoa ɔtɔ kɔraa iiwo ne ɔɖi.<verse eid="EZK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13" />" 'Kiniɔ ne fɔ anyini nɖe ininaso. Alasɔ lopia kubɛ sɔ loasekelera-ɔ ɣɛɛ aisekele abɔrɛ i fɔ anyini ame. Aisito aasekele ana gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ wũ sikpã teterea i fɔ iso ɔɔbakarɔ.<verse eid="EZK 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14" />" 'Mme, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika. Ɔwi ɔɣo me gɔ loabara ira. Loibasɛgu ngba kama, loibanyɔ nnya ɣee loibanyua ne ibara. Mato maaɣɛgu-ɔ itɔ̃me i fɔ nsɛgbai gu fɔ arabarara kanya. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.' "<verse eid="EZK 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezekiel ɔ̃ Ɔre Ɔkpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ka nto loba loawuĩ nnɛ nsɛ ipia fɔ anɔ isoɣɔ ku ikama. Ɣɛɛ daamararã so ɣee daabiɛ kaku ɣee daasora nnɔmɛ kumiwɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17" />Tɔrɛ̃ pɔkɔsɔɔ, daabiɛ kpise. Daaɖi ndokota i fɔ ngba, daakurisi fɔ itinyira i iti. Daafu fɔ anɔ kala kuira fiɛ daaɖe kukuayo kubarara kanya aɖera."<verse eid="EZK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18" />Ne ɔso loɖe maturi ika ku kaya, ne wũ ɔre ɔkpi ku kutsuɛ. Kaɖesɛã kaya ne, lobara lɛ maɔɣere me sɔ lobara.<verse eid="EZK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19" />Kere ne maturi ɔkarɛ me sɔ, "Aito aɣere bo kuira i nnɛ i ara wagbe ɔsu i bo iso ɣɛɛ?<verse eid="EZK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20" />Ne ɔso loɣere ma sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21" />Ɣere Israel kaɖe sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ka nto loba loapia wũ isɔrɛyo ɔgu - ɔlekasɛkɔ̃ ga misɛ mite so iso, nnɛ nsɛ ipia mi anɔ isoɣɔ, ira nɛ misɛ miɖuɛ. Mabirɛrɛĩ gu mabirɔ̃gomi ma minyua misɛ i kama to maarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya. <verse eid="EZK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22" />Ne mito miabara lɛ loɔbara awe. Miito miafu mi anɔ kala ara ɣee miibaɖe kukuayo kubarara kanya aɖera. <verse eid="EZK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23" />Mi atinyira to aasia i mi ati fiɛ mi ndokota to miawe i mi ngba. Miito miamararã so ɣee miito miabiɛ kaku ɣɛɛ mito mianyɛ miro ala mi akpi gu itɔrɛ̃ i mi ndɛ̃ ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24" />Ezekiel to ɔ̃aɖe ikparĩ ɔtã mi. Mito miabara lɛ ɔ̃ɔbara awe. Si nnɛgbe ɔba ne, mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso.'<verse eid="EZK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, fɔ ne, iyi nɛ losu ma ɔlekasɛkɔ̃, ma isoɣɔ gu kulɛ, nnɛ nsɛ ilɛ ma ɔnyɔ, nnɛ masɛ maɖuɛ ku ɔtu ne, loasu ma mabirɛrɛĩ gu mabirɔ̃gomi ana. <verse eid="EZK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26" />Ne iyi nɛmɔ ne nwɔ lorui ɔtere to ɔ̃aba ɔ̃aɣere-ɔ nnɛ loba itɔ̃me. <verse eid="EZK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ne mato maabusi-ɔ kanya, ato aaɖegu wũ ika fiɛ aisibalokanana. Ne ɔso ato aaɖe ikparĩ atã ma, ne mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>."<verse eid="EZK 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Amon Karɔ̃ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, su fɔ anɔ sɔ̃ ma Amonse iso si aɖikanya ata aya i ma iso. <verse eid="EZK 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3" />Ɣere ma Amonse sɔ, 'Minɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso itɔ̃me. Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Ala miɣɛ sɔ "Ɛɣɛɛ̃!" i wũ isɔrɛyo iso ku ɔwi wɔ mapia ne ɔgu gu i Israel iso ku ɔwi wɔ manina ma karɔ̃ gu i Yuda maturi iso ku ɔwi wɔ makɛlɛ kafɔrɔ̃ iso, <verse eid="EZK 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4" />ɔso ne nto loasu mi lotã kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ maturi lɛ ma ira. Mato maabara ma nsɛkɔ̃ fiɛ maabara ma akpayo i mi ndɛ̃. Mato maaɖe mi araɖea fiɛ maanɛ mi mabɔi inyɛndu. <verse eid="EZK 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5" />Nto loakpesera Raba ɔmagɛ̃siare kupuapɔngɔ sikuakaɖekɔ̃ fiɛ Amon karɔ̃ aakpese ngbegɔ i masɛrɛ aawarã. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne. <verse eid="EZK 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6" />Ala nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Mipɛ arɔ̃kpasa fiɛ mitutuĩ mi ngba i karɔ̃ fiɛ milɛlɛ ku aranyanyariã ɔɖuɖu wa miba i mi ɔtu ame, mita miɣɛ i Israel karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7" />Ne ɔso ne nto loanabarã wũ kɔrɔ̃ lota loya i mi iso fiɛ loasu mi lotã nɖebi lɛ kakpãramɔɛã. Loto loaɖi mi i nɖebi ndɛ̃ fiɛ loawɔra mi loɖi i nrɔ̃ ame. Nto loawɔra mi, ne mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' "<verse eid="EZK 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Moab Karɔ̃ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8" />"Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Ala ma Moabse gu Seirise ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nyɔ, Yuda kaɖe ɔɔkpese lɛ nɖebi mama ɔɖuɖu." <verse eid="EZK 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9" />Ne ɔso nto loaɖi ma Moabse kume losɛ kpawee, ita i simagɛ̃ dzɛ mpia i kume kɔrɛ - Bet Yesimot, Baal Meon gu Kiriataim - karɔ̃ gamɔ iso kulɛ simagɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10" />Loto loasu Moab ku ma Amonse lotã kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ maturi lɛ ma ira, si maisibanyigi ma Amonse i nɖebi ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:11" />Ne loakpadzɛ̃ ma Moabse kutsue. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' "<verse eid="EZK 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Edom Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12" />"Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ, ' Edom maturi ɔbara Yuda iyo matikuso ɔso ne maɣɛrɛ gbaã gɔ mabara ne. <verse eid="EZK 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13" />Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Loto loanabarã wũ kɔrɔ̃ lota loya i Edom iso, loɖue ɔ̃ marɛrɛ̃ gu ma mabɔi. Loto loanina karɔ̃ fiɛ ita i Teman ikɛlɛ Dedan ne, mato maarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya. <verse eid="EZK 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14" />Loto loabara Edom lotikuso iki i wũ maturi Israel iso fiɛ mato maabara Edom i wũ sikpã gu sikpã teterea kanya. Mato maatsue wũ ibaraitikuso, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.' "<verse eid="EZK 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Filistia Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15" />"Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Ma Filistise ɔɔbara matikuso fiɛ mabara ne ku aranyanyariã i ɔtu ame fiɛ ala katsiri siare ɔso mabie sɔ maawɔra Yuda. <verse eid="EZK 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16" />Ne ɔso ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ka nto loba loanabarã wũ kɔrɔ̃ lota loya i ma Filistise iso. Ne loawɔra ma Keretse fiɛ loawɔra mma lokuti i ɔpokpokpo kuruɛ. <verse eid="EZK 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17" />Nto loabara ibaraitikuso siare i ma iso fiɛ loakpadzɛ̃ ma kutsue i wũ sikpã teterea ame. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si lobara ma lotikuso.' "<verse eid="EZK 25:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Tiro Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1" />I kuwa iyi ɖeakatɔ̃ i ikɔ iweoɖeakatɔ̃ ame ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, alasɔ Tiro ɔmagɛ̃siare maturi ɔɔɣɛ i Yerusalem iso sɔ, 'Ɛɣɛɛ̃! Maɔbiɛ kayogodɔ̃ ikɛlɛ nɖebi, ne kã akui ɔɔbusi ase atã me kiniɔ gɔ Yerusalem ɔ̃ɔbiɛ ne, nto loana isaruɛ,' <verse eid="EZK 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3" />ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Lota loɣɛ-ɔ iso lo, Tiro, fiɛ nto loatara nɖebi gbodzoo mata maya-ɔ iso lɛ ɔpo nto ɔfuĩdza ɔ̃ sipotutaa kato. <verse eid="EZK 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4" />Mato maawɔra Tiro abere fiɛ maabibiɛ ɔ̃ adzarara. Nto loakparɛ̃ ɔ̃ aku loɖi i ɔ̃ iso ɔkpese itasiare nɛ nse kpawee. <verse eid="EZK 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5" />Ito iase lɛ ita i ɔpo ame, kakɔi ga i makpɛɖidze sɛ mala ma asabu, alasɔ loɔɖeika, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. Tiro to ɔ̃akpese kakpãramɔɛã ɔta nɖebi. <verse eid="EZK 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6" />Ne ɔ̃ nsɛkɔ̃ i karɔ̃ mɔmɔ iso to miawɔ i ipɛmi kanya. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7" />"Ala nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Nto loakpadzɛ̃ Babilon igara Nebukadnezar, magara ame igara, lobɔrɛgu i katikpe isɛ lobɔ i Tiro iso. Ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ɔbagu apɔngɔ gu kubore, pɔngɔmasɛdze gu makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri siare. <verse eid="EZK 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8" />Nebukadnezar to ɔ̃awɔra fɔ nsɛkɔ̃ i karɔ̃ mɔmɔ iso ku ipɛmi. Ɔto ɔ̃atsue itɛ̃ipia ara isɛ iabo i fɔ ibere iso fiɛ ɔ̃atara ɔ̃ akpirafɔra ɔsia-ɔ iso. <verse eid="EZK 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9" />Ɔto ɔ̃asu ara wa masɛ mabiɛ ata ɔbiɛ fɔ abere fiɛ ɔ̃abiɛ fɔ adzarara ku ɔ̃ akpakpɛ̃ra. <verse eid="EZK 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10" />Ɔ̃ apɔngɔ to aasi gɔ iatã sɔ ɔsebu aafu-ɔ iso. Fɔ abere to aatɔrɛ̃ ala kakpã apɔngɔ inene, makeke gu kubore kulu iti, si ɔbo i fɔ kuyogodɔ̃ ame lɛ kumɛgɔ i marɛrɛ̃ sɛ mabo i ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔ abere maɔbibiɛ pelepele ame. <verse eid="EZK 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11" />Ɔ̃ apɔngɔ to aanene fɔ sivurã ɔɖuɖu ku apuɛ. Ɔto ɔ̃aɖue fɔ maturi ku ipɛmi fiɛ fɔ akpa wa mba ɔle to aarɔ̃ afere i karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12" />Mato mamɔɛ̃ fɔ karana fiɛ maabɔdza fɔ kuɣaiɖe ara lɛ kakpãramɔɛã. Mato maabibiɛ fɔ abere fiɛ maawɔra fɔ ayo sɛɛ. Ne mato maafuĩdza fɔ ata, sidziri gu sise mafere i ɔpo ame. <verse eid="EZK 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13" />Loto loatuĩdza fɔ aka ku kulu wamɔ fiɛ maisibanɔ fɔ siwɛ̃masango silɔ mɛrɛ̃mɛrɛã. <verse eid="EZK 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14" />Nto lokpesera-ɔ itasiare wawe fiɛ aakpese kakɔi ga masɛ mawarɛ asabu mala. Maisibaledza-ɔ itsue kuiyikuiyi ala Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15" />"Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣere Tiro maturi ne: Ɔpokpokpo maturi ɔɖuɖu to maati makpakpa ala fɔ irɔ̃ kulu iti, si mma makpira ɔtɔrɛ̃ fiɛ ituriɖue ɔba i fɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16" />Iyɔ maɖeisoi i ɔpokpokpo ɔɖuɖu iso to maanyua ma sigaraayara masɛ, masu ma arapia tagbaraa masɛ i kuruɛ fiɛ maaɖi ma arapia wa matsue ara mapia masɛ. Itiikpakpa afɔ ma lɛ arapia, ne mato maakpase masɛ i karɔ̃, mati makpakpa ku ɔwi biara fiɛ sitsue aabɔrɛ ma gɔ manya-ɔ. <verse eid="EZK 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17" />Iyɔ mato maapia isomanɔ karɔ̃ i fɔ iso ne mato maaɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">" 'O ɔmagɛ̃siare, fɔ lofɔ iyere, nyɔ ngbɔ maɔwɔra-ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">fɔ wɔ ame i marɛrɛ̃ ma nsɛ masɛ ɔpo iso ɔsi i kame!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Fɔ lowe ɔle i sipo iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">mi gu fɔ kaɖemabi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Mitã ifɔ̃ ɔwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">i mma ɔɖuɖu losɛ i mmɔ ame.<verse eid="EZK 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18" />Kiniɔ ne ɔpokpokpo nrɔ̃ to miti mikpakpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:18">ku iyi nɛ akpase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">Ndukilɔnrɔ̃ mɛ i ɔpo ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:18">to miti mikpakpa gɔ manya fɔ irɔ̃.'<verse eid="EZK 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19" />"Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Si lobara-ɔ ikpakpi ɔmagɛ̃siare ne, lɛ simagɛ̃siare dzɛ ame i maturi iisito masɛ ame ne fiɛ si lokpadzɛ̃ ɔpo ndu lofere-ɔ iso fiɛ ɔ̃ ndu gbodzoo ɔfu-ɔ iso ne, <verse eid="EZK 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20" />iyɔ nto loasore-ɔ lokɛlɛgu i karɔ̃ ame, ku mma mato masora mapia i ikpibiɔ ame. Ne ato aakɛlɛ maturi ma ta kokowi kɔrɛ. Loto loatã awe i karɔ̃ ame i kayirinɔ, lɛ kokowi aku, ku mma nsɛ makɛlɛ iwo ame. Iyɔ aisibakpese aba ɣee aba aafɔ fɔ kasɛkɔ̃ i mma mpia ngbã karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21" />Nto loakpadzɛ̃-ɔ lobɔ kawirikɔ̃ nyanyariã iyɔ aisibawe. Mato maabie-ɔ, ɣɛɛ maisibanya-ɔ kuiyikuiyi ana, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ."<verse eid="EZK 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔkpibiɛnɔ Itã Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, kpɛ ɔkpibiɛnɔ ise i Tiro iso. <verse eid="EZK 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3" />Ɣere Tiro, nwɔ mpia i ɔpo ɔri iso, mma nto maɖegu mma nsi i sipokpokpo gbodzoo kasɛkɔ̃ kuɣa sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">" 'O Tiro, asɛ aɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:3">"Lobua loyigu kulɛ."<verse eid="EZK 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4" />Atã fɔ karɔ̃ kume ɔkɛlɛ ta ɔpo ame.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:4">Fɔ maɖaɛdze ɔbara fɔ kulɛ ɔyi kukaakɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5" />Masu mabesibe ma mabɔrɛgu i Senir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Senir: Xemon kube</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:5">mabaragu fɔ sidziri ɔɖuɖu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">Masu sedar mabɔrɛgu i Lebanon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:5">si mabara nduisoibuɛ ɔdzirilakati matã-ɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6" />Siɖum dzɛ lobɔrɛ i Basan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:6">masu mabara ku fɔ ɔkoloiwasidziri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">Ne mabara fɔ kame ku sɛsɛi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:6">mabara fɔ karɔ̃ ku adziri ne mafu sisogbɛ iso.<verse eid="EZK 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7" />Mabara fɔ ɔkolo sikati ku ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa wɔ matsue ara mapia ɔbɔrɛ i Egipte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">fiɛ iɖe lɛ fɔ kameleɖukui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">Fɔ sikati dzɛ masu mafu ara ɔɖe sirɛtɛa pɛɛ̃ gu bulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">ne mabɔrɛgu sɛ̃ i Elisa ɔpokpokpo.<verse eid="EZK 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8" />Marɛrɛ̃ ma lobɔrɛ i Sidon gu Arvad loɖe fɔ ɔkoloiwa marɛrɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:8">O Tiro, fɔ kusɛ̃ marɛrɛ̃ ɔwe i ɔkolo ame, lɛ fɔ ɔpoisomasɛdze.<verse eid="EZK 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9" />Gebal makpakpa kusɛ̃ maturi lowe i fɔ ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:9">lɛ marawedze si maledza nduisoibuɛ i ngbegɔ lonina.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">Ɔpo nduisoabuɛ gu wã ɔpoisomasɛdze ɔɖuɖu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:9">ɔba maabua i kuɣaiɖe i fɔ ara iso.<verse eid="EZK 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10" />" 'Persia, Lidia gu Put marɛrɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:10">ɔbara karabara lɛ makpakpɛ̃dze i fɔ ikuri ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:10">Masu ma akpirafɔra gu ibɔraakoto masa i fɔ abere iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:10">mabɔ-ɔ kuwarɛ gbaã.<verse eid="EZK 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11" />Arvad gu Xelek marɛrɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:11">lonyɔ fɔ abere iso i ibaba biara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">Gamad marɛrɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:11">ɔwe i fɔ adzarara ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">Masu ma akpirafɔra masa i fɔ abere iso maki malɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:11">Mabɔ fɔ kulɛ sɔ kuyi kukaakɔ.<verse eid="EZK 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12" />" ' Tarsis ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa ala fɔ ara karana gbodzoo ɔso. Manyuarã sikãfudza, ibɔrakpinaa, ibɔrabui gu sompi ku fɔ kuɣaiɖe ara.<verse eid="EZK 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13" />" 'Greeki, Tubal gu Mesek ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa. Manyuarã masande gu ayiwa ara ku fɔ kuɣa ara.<verse eid="EZK 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14" />" 'Bet Togarma marɛrɛ̃ ɔnyuarã karabara apɔngɔ, kakpã apɔngɔ gu mafiripɔngɔ itã fɔ kuɣa ara.<verse eid="EZK 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15" />" ' Rode marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa, ne sipokpokpo gbodzoo ɔɖe fɔ masisi. Matã-ɔ kuso ku sisogbɛ gu kudziri kpinakpina.<verse eid="EZK 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16" />" ' Aram ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa ala fɔ ara gbodzoo. Manyuarã rubin, sikati pɛɛ̃, ndzɛ matsue ara mapia, ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa sɛɛ, ita nɛ lofɔkuɣa marɔ sɔ koral gu koral rɛtɛa ku fɔ kuɣaiɖe ara.<verse eid="EZK 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17" />" 'Yuda gu Israel ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa. Manyuarã kakpã ga lobɔrɛ i Minit gu araɖea ku tsitsere mɛrɛ̃mɛrɛã, maɣendu, nnɔĩ gu ayɛinɔĩ ku fɔ ara.<verse eid="EZK 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18" />" ' Damasko, ala fɔ kuɣa ara gbodzoo gu ara karana siare ɔso ne, ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa i wain wɔ lobɔrɛ i Xelbon gu bɔisiwɛrɛ̃ dzɛ mabɔrɛgu i Zaxar.<verse eid="EZK 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19" />"Ma Danse gu ma Greekise ma lobɔrɛ i Uzal ɔɣa fɔ kuɣa ara. Manyuarã ibɔrakpinaa mɔmɔ, kasia gu ɔkarɛkua ku fɔ kuɣa ara.<verse eid="EZK 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20" />" ' Dedan ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa i sikundu dzɛ nsɛ masia i mabɔi kama masɛ iso.<verse eid="EZK 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21" />" ' Arabia gu Kedar maɖeisoi ɔɖuɖu loɖe fɔ masisi. Maɖegu-ɔ kuɣa i sɛrɛrerɔ̃ abi, akpalasa gu masɛrɛtepu ame.<verse eid="EZK 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22" />" ' Seba gu Raama kuɣamaɖese ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa ne manyuarã akɔrɔ̃kɔrɔ̃ra sɛɛ i wã agbã ɔɖuɖu ame gu atafɔkuɣa agbãagbã gu sikãrɛtɛa.<verse eid="EZK 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23" />" ' Xaran, Kane gu Eden gu Asur gu Kilmad gu Seba kuɣamaɖese ɔɖegu-ɔ kuɣa. <verse eid="EZK 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24" />I fɔ kuɣaame ne maɖegu-ɔ kuɣa i arapia wa nto alɛnyɔ, bulu sikati, ndzɛ matsue ara mapia gu makundu ma mapia kukua gbodzoo ku awɛĩ wa mawe fiɛ mapɛ akpo teteree.<verse eid="EZK 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25" />" ' Tarsis nduisoabuɛ lobara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:25">fɔ kuɣaiɖe ara isore karabara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:25">Ayigu ato wa mba ɔrɔrã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:25">i ɔpo iso.<verse eid="EZK 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26" />Fɔ sikolomawadze ɔsu-ɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:26">makɛlɛgu ɔpo iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:26">Ɣɛɛ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ɔwiri to ɔ̃abibiɛ-ɔ pasapasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:26">dzoroo i ɔpo iso.<verse eid="EZK 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27" />Fɔ karana, ara itã kuɣaiɖe gu ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">fɔ ɔkolo ame marabaradze, mma nsɛ makɛlɛ ɔpo iso gu mma nsɛ maledza ɔkolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">fɔ kuɣamaɖese gu fɔ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">gu ɔturi ɔrere wɔ i ɔkolo ame</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">to ɔ̃asɛ ndu dzoroo i ɔpo iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">ku iyi nɛ nduisoibuɛ ɔrɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28" />Nrɔ̃ mɛ i ɔpokpokpo to miati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:28">si fɔ ɔpoisomasɛdze ɔbiɛ ku kulu.<verse eid="EZK 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29" />Mma ɔɖuɖu nsɛ mala ɔkoloiwasidziri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:29">to maarui manyua ma nduisoabuɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">nduisoibuɛ ame marabaradze, mma nsɛ makɛlɛ ɔpo iso ɔɖuɖu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:29">to maaya i ɔkpokpo.<verse eid="EZK 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30" />Mato maakɔlɛ ma silɔ kato</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:30">mabiɛ ku isoma i fɔ iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">Mato masa ɔsebu mafere i ma ati iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:30">fiɛ mamelɛ̃ i ndɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31" />Mato maakparɛ̃ ati ala fɔ ɔso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:31">fiɛ mato maapia ipundusikoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">Mato maabiɛ i fɔ iti ku ibɛbɛrɛ i kame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:31">fiɛ mato mamararã so ku isoma ibɛbɛrɛ.<verse eid="EZK 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32" />Gɔ mato mabiɛ fiɛ mato mamararã so i fɔ iti ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:32">mato maapia sikpibiɛnɔ i fɔ iso sɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">"Nna kowũ loɔwɔ i ɔpo ndɛ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:32">lɛ Tiro igbã ɔnya?"<verse eid="EZK 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33" />Ɔwi wɔ i fɔ kuɣaiɖe ara ɔsɛ sipo iso ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:33">atã nɖebi gbodzoo ɔmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">ku fɔ karana gbodzoo gu fɔ ara ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:33">atã karɔ̃ iso magara ɔna karana.<verse eid="EZK 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34" />Kiniɔ ne ɔpo ɔɔbibiɛ-ɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:34">ɔkɛlɛgu-ɔ ndu wodoroa kayirinɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">Fɔ ara gu fɔ maturi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:34">ɔɔsɛgu-ɔ ndu.<verse eid="EZK 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35" />Sitsue ɔbɔrɛ mma ɔɖuɖu nsi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:35">i ɔposikpokpo i fɔ iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">Ma magara ɔyigu itiikpakpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:35">fiɛ ma ntɔ̃ ɔkɛrɛ̃ ku ifɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36" />Kuɣamaɖese ma i nɖebi ame to mama-ɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:36">ɔba aabo i kawirikɔ̃ nyanyariã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:36">fiɛ aisibawe.' "<verse eid="EZK 27:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Tiro Igara Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɣere Tiro ɔɖeisoi sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">" 'I fɔ ɔtu katoikɔlɛso ame ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">asɛ aɣɛ sɔ, "ɣaa ɔwɛ̃ loɖe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Losi i ɣaa ɔwɛ̃ sigaraiyara iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">i sipo ndɛndɛ̃."</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Ɣɛɛ ɔturi awune kere aɖe fiɛ aiɖe ɣaa ɔwɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">atoasɔ asɛ abu sɔ aɣe iwola lɛ Ɣaa ɔwɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3" />Aɣe iwola aɖo Daniel?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:3">Ku iwɛrɛra kuiwɛ̃ iiwɛrɛ-ɔ?<verse eid="EZK 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4" />Iki i fɔ iwola gu karɔ̃inɔ ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:4">ɔɔna ara karana atã so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:4">Ne ɔɔna sikãrɛtɛa gu sikãfudza akpe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:4">afu i fɔ arakukɔlakɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5" />Iki i fɔ kusɛ̃ siare i kuɣaiɖe ame ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:5">ɔɔɣe fɔ karana asia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:5">Ana ne, ala fɔ karana ɔso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:5">fɔ ɔtu ɔɔkɔlɛ so kato.<verse eid="EZK 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6" />" 'Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:6">" 'Ala asɛ anyɔ sɔ aɣe iwola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:6">aɣe iwola lɛ ɣaa ɔwɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:7" />Nto loba loakpadzɛ̃ mafɔ lobɔ mata maya-ɔ iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:7">Kaɖe ga mba ɔtile kaɖo i nɖebi ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">Mato maakpadzɛ̃ ma apɛmi masia i fɔ kulɛ gu fɔ iwola iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:7">fiɛ maawɔra fɔ kulɛ ifiɛ.<verse eid="EZK 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8" />Mato maakpasera-ɔ mapia i iwo ame.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:8">Ne ato aakpi kukpi nyanyariã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:8">i sipo ndɛndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9" />Iyɔ ne ka ato aaɣɛ sɔ, "ɣaa ɔwɛ̃ loɖe,"</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:9">i mma loɖue-ɔ anɔmi ame?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">Ato aaɖe ɔturi awune kere, iiɖe ɣaa ɔwɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:9">i mma loɖue-ɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10" />Ato aakpi ature kukpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:10">i mafɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 28:10">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, Mme loɔɖeika.' "<verse eid="EZK 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Tiro Igara Ikpase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, pia isomanɔ nrɔɔ̃ ise i Tiro igara iso si aɣere wũ sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:12">" 'Fɔ loɖe ira nɛ loyi pelepele igbã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:12">ayigu iwola fiɛ fɔ kulɛ ɔyi.<verse eid="EZK 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13" />Awe i Ɣaa kawĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">Eden ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Itafukuɣa biara:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">rubin, topas gu emerald,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">krisolit, oniks, Yaspis gu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">safir ɔkɛrɛ-ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Fɔ ara wa masɛ gu nwa maɣedza ne, sikãrɛtɛa masu mabara wã.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">Maledza wã ku iyi nɛ mabara-ɔ.<verse eid="EZK 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14" />Masɔla-ɔ nnɔĩ lɛ kerubi wɔ nsɛ ɔdzuɛ̃ ira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:14">alasɔ kumɛɔ lobara-ɔ ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Awe i Ɣaa kube sekelea iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:14">Asɛ aki i atafɔkuɣa wa nto afiɛ ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15" />Iɣɛrɛ kuiwɛ̃ iiwe i fɔ nsɛgbai iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:15">ita i iyi nɛ mabara-ɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:15">gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ manya ɔtile i fɔ ame.<verse eid="EZK 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16" />Iki i fɔ kuɣaiɖe nɛ loɣa ikpa ame ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">ayigu amumuɣɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">ne abara ikpi ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Ne ɔso losa-ɔ ku kunuarɛ lobɔrɛgu i Ɣaa kube iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">Ne lotɛ̃-ɔ ɔri, kerubi wɔ nsɛ ɔdzuɛ̃ ira lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">lobɔrɛgu i atafɔkuɣa ifiɛ ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17" />Fɔ ɔtu ɔkɔlɛ so kato</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">ala fɔ kulɛ iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Ne anina fɔ iwola</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">ala fɔ ikɛrɛso ɔso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Ne ɔso lofuĩdza-ɔ lowuĩ i karɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">ne loɖi-ɔ losɛ sɔ magara si manyɔ-ɔ.<verse eid="EZK 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18" />Iki i fɔ akpi gbodzoo gu ɔnukuare idaaɖe kuɣaiɖe ame ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">apia fɔ kusɔrɛkɔ̃ ɔgu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Ne ɔso lotã ɔtɔ ɔbɔrɛ i fɔ ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">ne ɔtsuedza-ɔ ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Ne lobara-ɔ akpese ndɔ̃ i karɔ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">i mma ɔɖuɖu nto manyɔ-ɔ anɔmi ame ne.<verse eid="EZK 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19" />Nɖebi ɔɖuɖu mɛ lotsue-ɔ ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:19">sitsue ɔbɔrɛ ma i fɔ iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:19">Ɔɔba aabo kawirikɔ̃ nyanyariã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:19">fiɛ aisibawe kuiyikuiyi.' "<verse eid="EZK 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Sidon Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, tara fɔ anɔ sɔ̃ Sidon, si aɖikanya ata aya wũ iso <verse eid="EZK 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22" />si aɣɛ sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">" 'Lotsiri-ɔ lo, Sidon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">fiɛ nto loaɖi wũ ikpawaĩ kayi i nnɛ loto loabara-ɔ ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">Mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">si lokpadzɛ̃ wũ kutsue</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">fiɛ loɖi so lote sɔ losekele i ɔ̃ kame.<verse eid="EZK 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23" />Loto loasese kukpakpi i ɔ̃ iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">fiɛ nto loatã ima ɔbore i ɔ̃ sivurã iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Mato maaɖue maturi mafere i ɔ̃ ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">ku ipɛmi i ɔ̃ iso i kasɛ biara iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne.<verse eid="EZK 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24" />" 'Israel maturi iisibawe magbamikui matsirise ma nse lɛ kuposɛ̃ gu agba wa itsue nsɛ abo. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso ne.<verse eid="EZK 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Si losa Israel maturi kanya lobɔrɛgu i nɖebi mɛ ame masame mapia ne, nto loaɖi so lote sɔ losekele i ma ndɛ̃ i nɖebi anɔ. Iyɔ Israel maturi to maasɛ i ma mɔmɔ karɔ̃ iso, nga lotã wũ ɔɖabo Yakob. <verse eid="EZK 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26" />Mato maasɛ i mmɔ i kaɣɔ ame, ne mato maatsue ayo makpɛ̃ wainnkpɛkɔ̃. Mato maasɛ i kaɣɔ ame, si lokpadzɛ̃ ma magbamikui ɔɖuɖu ma lonyɔ ma pupurii maɖaa ma kutsue. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ma Ɣaa ne.' "<verse eid="EZK 28:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Egipte Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1" />I ikɔ iweova i ma Yudase kuwa kuweova iyi iweonyɔare iso ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, tara fɔ anɔ sɔ̃ Egipte Igarakpakpa iso si aɖikanya ata aya i ma gu ma Egiptese ɔɖuɖu iso. <verse eid="EZK 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3" />Ɖeikagu wũ si aɣere wũ sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">" 'Lota loɣɛ-ɔ iso, Egipte Igarakpakpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:3">bɔisiare wɔ nrɛ i fɔ kuworei ndɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Asɛ aɣɛ sɔ, "Nil ɔwore ɖe wũ ɔre.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:3">Mme lobara wũ lotã so."<verse eid="EZK 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4" />Ɣɛɛ nto losu kugodai lopia-ɔ i fɔ aregba ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:4">fiɛ loatã afara wa i fɔ kuworei ame ɔpɛ kumatã i fɔ awoloba iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Loto loakpadzɛ̃-ɔ loɖi i fɔ kuworei ndɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:4">ku afara ɔɖuɖu wa mmatã i fɔ awoloba iso.<verse eid="EZK 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5" />Nto loanyua-ɔ losɛ i fafuĩ ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">mi gu afara ɔɖuɖu wa i fɔ kuworei ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Mito miarɔ̃ mifere i karɔ̃ ga nfere kakpa iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">fiɛ maibamala mi ɣee maibasu mi i mmɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Nto loasu mi lotã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">karɔ̃ iso mabɔisiare gu ɔwiri ame kurodzai lɛ aɖera.<verse eid="EZK 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6" />Iyɔ mma ɔɖuɖu nsi i Egipte karɔ̃ iso to maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 29:6" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:6">" 'Ɔɔse lɛ tsatsakua ɔsɛdziri atã Israel kaɖe. <verse eid="EZK 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7" />Ɔwi wɔ mamɔɛ̃-ɔ mala ku ma nrɔɔ̃ ne, abɛse ne atsue ma amɔiti, gɔ mapiɛtɛ-ɔ iso ne, afɛ̃ ne mafɛ̃ kama ne.<verse eid="EZK 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8" />" 'Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Nto loakpadzɛ̃ ipɛmi losia-ɔ iso fiɛ mato maaɖue fɔ maturi gu ma mabɔi. <verse eid="EZK 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9" />Egipte karɔ̃ to kaakpese ikpakpi karɔ̃. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:9">" 'Ala aɣɛ sɔ, "Nil ɔwore ɖe wũ ɔre, mme lobara wũ ɔso." <verse eid="EZK 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10" />Ne ɔso lotsiri-ɔ fiɛ lotsiri fɔ kuworei, fiɛ nto loabara Egipte karɔ̃ ɔwɔ gu kakpese ikpakpi gu fafuĩ ita i Migdol ikɛlɛ Aswan, ikɛlɛ ta Kus kume iso. <verse eid="EZK 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11" />Ɔturi awune kuwɛ̃ ɣee bɔi kuwɛ̃ kukpa iibaki i kame mafe, kuwɛ̃ iibawe i mmɔ itã akɔ sina. <verse eid="EZK 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12" />Loto loabara Egipte karɔ̃ kakpese ikpakpi i nrɔ̃ mɛ lonina ndɛ̃. Ne ɔ̃ simagɛ̃siare to siakpese ikpakpi itã akɔ sina i simagɛ̃siare dzɛ mawɔra ndɛ̃. Ne nto losamera ma Egiptese lopia i nɖebi ndɛ̃ fiɛ loasa ma lofere i nrɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13" />" 'Ɣɛɛ nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Akɔ sina kawirikɔ̃ ne, nto loasa ma Egiptese kanya lobɔrɛgu i nɖebi mɛ ame masame mabo. <verse eid="EZK 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14" />Nto loaɖi ma lobɔrɛgu i kafɔrɔ̃ ame lokpesera ma lobɔ i Egipte Kakpagɛkɔ̃, i ma mawa karɔ̃ iso. Mmɔ mato maaɖe sigarakaɖekɔ̃ dzɛ lofɛ̃ ne. <verse eid="EZK 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15" />Sito siaɖe sigarakaɖekɔ̃ dzɛ lofɛ̃ siɖo fiɛ siisibatara so kato i nɖebi mama iso kuiyikuiyi ana. Loto loabara sɛ̃ sifɛ̃ sɔ siisibaɖe nɖebi mama iso kuiyikuiyi ana. <verse eid="EZK 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16" />Egipte iisibaɖe ngbegɔ i Israel mabi aasiaiti iso. Ɣɛɛ iaɖe ikpi inyigira itã ma sɔ maisibabie kabuai mabɔrɛgu i Egipte kɔrɛ. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso.' "<verse eid="EZK 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igara Nebukadnezar To Ɔ̃amɔɛ̃ Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17" />Iyi ɖeakatɔ̃ i ma Yudase kuwa kuɖeakatɔ̃ ame i ikɔ sinyɔikɔdzɛva ame ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, Babilon igara Nebukadnezar ɔsɛgu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri ku anɔmi rɛtɛa ɔsɛ ɔ̃akpɛ̃ Tiro teteree, iti biara ɔbɛbɛ fiɛ imɔiti biara ana ɔbɛbɛ. Ɣɛɛ ma gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze iina ku kuso kuwɛ̃ i kakpã ga ɔta i Tiro iso ame. <verse eid="EZK 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19" />Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Nto loba loasu Egipte lopia i Babilon igara Nebukadnezar nrɔɔ̃ ame fiɛ ɔ̃asore Egipte karana ɔruigu. Ɔto ɔ̃ayu fiɛ ɔ̃amɔɛ̃ ara i karɔ̃ ame lɛ kuso itã ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri. <verse eid="EZK 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20" />Loɔsu Egipte lotã wũ lɛ kuso itã ɔ̃ kubɛ alasɔ ma gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔbara ne matã me, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21" />"Iyi nɛmɔ ne nto loatã isa ɔre itã Israel iyo. Ne loabusi-ɔ kanya aɖeika i ma ndɛ̃. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>."<verse eid="EZK 29:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔkpibiɛnɔ Itã Egipte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya si aɣɛ sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">" 'Biɛ si aɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:2">"Ndzo mitã iyi nɛmɔ!"<verse eid="EZK 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3" />Ala iyi nɛmɔ ɔɔbore imatã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:3">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyi ɔɔbore ibo -</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">adɔdɔ iyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:3">ɔwi wɔ nɖebi to miawɔ.<verse eid="EZK 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4" />Ipɛmi to iaba iata iya i Egipte iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">ne ibo gu ibɛbɛrɛ to aaba i Kus maturi iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Ɔwi wɔ i mma maɔɖue aarɔ̃ marɛ i karɔ̃ i Egipte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">Matsirise to maasore Egipte karana maruigu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">Ne mabibiɛ ɔ̃ sikaĩ mafere ne.<verse eid="EZK 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5" />" ' Kus gu Put, Lidia gu Arabia ɔɖuɖu, Libia gu ndamu karɔ̃ maturi to maarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya ku ma Egiptese.<verse eid="EZK 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">" 'Mma mpia i Egipte kasɛ to maarɔ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">ne ɔ̃ ɔle wɔ ɔto ɔte so ala to ɔ̃abakarɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Ita i Migdol ikɛlɛ Aswan ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">maturi to maarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya i ɔ̃ kame.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="EZK 30:6">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7" />"Mato maakpese ikpakpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:7">i akpakpi nrɔ̃ ndɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:7">Ne ma simagɛ̃siare to siawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:7">i simagɛ̃siare dzɛ mawɔra ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8" />Si lotsue ɔtɔ lopia i Egipte ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:8">fiɛ ɔ̃ mabuaidze ɔɖuɖu ɔɔwɔ ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:8">iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9" />" 'Iyi nɛmɔ iso ne makpabo to maabɔrɛ i wũ kɔrɛ, mawe i nduisoabuɛ ame mapia Kus ifɔ̃ i ɔ̃ kaɣɔ ifɔiɖe nɛ ɔba ame. Ibo gu ibɛbɛrɛ to aafɔ ma ku Egipte iwɔyi, alasɔ gbaã ito iaba.<verse eid="EZK 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:10">" 'Loto loawɔra Egipte karana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:10">iki i Babilon igara Nebukadnezar nrɔɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11" />Ma gu ɔ̃ makpakɛpɛ̃dze - ma mba ɔtile maɖo i nɖebi ame -</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:11">mato maakpadzɛ̃ mabɔ sɔ mawɔra karɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">Mato maata mabo i Egipte iso ku apɛmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:11">ne maturi ma maɖue to maayi i karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="EZK 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12" />Loto loatã Nil kuworei ɔsɔ̃</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:12">ne loanyua karɔ̃ losu lopia i maturi nyanyariã nrɔɔ̃ ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Loto loanina karɔ̃ gu irabiara nɛ mpia i kã iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:12">iki i mafɔ nrɔɔ̃ iso.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 30:12">Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika.<verse eid="EZK 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Egipte Katoikɔlɛso Simagɛ̃siare To Siawɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">" 'Nto loawɔra arapɔa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:13">fiɛ loatuĩdza kumiamia gɔ i Memfis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Ɔɖeisoi kuwɛ̃ iisibawe i Egipte karɔ̃ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:13">ne loatã ifɔ̃ ɔfɔ karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso.<verse eid="EZK 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14" />Nto loanina Egipte Kakpagɛkɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:14">lopia Zoan ɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:14">fiɛ nto loakpadzɛ̃ ma Tebese kutsue.<verse eid="EZK 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15" />Nto loaɖi wũ sikpã teterea lofere i Pelusium iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:15">ngbegɔ nɖe Egipte ɔlekasɛkɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:15">Ne loawɔra Tebes karana.<verse eid="EZK 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16" />Nto loapia Egipte ɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:16">Pelusium to ɔ̃awana i ibo ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Awɛ to abibiɛ Tebes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:16">Memfis to ɔ̃awe i ibo ame sɔɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17" />Xeliopolis gu Bubastis maporoporoi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:17">to maarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:17">Ne simagɛ̃siare ame maturi to maakɛlɛ kafɔrɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18" />Si loba nto lobiɛ Egipte ɔle ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">ito iaɖe Tapanxes idududu iyi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">Mmɔ i Egipte iteso ɔle to ɔ̃aba katuĩ ne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">Adɔdɔ to aaɣa afu wũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">ne mamɔɛ̃ ɔ̃ kumagɛĩ maturi makɛlɛgu i kafɔrɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19" />Ne ɔso nto loakpadzɛ̃ Egipte kutsue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:19">iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' "<verse eid="EZK 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabiɛ Egipte Igara Ɔle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20" />Kuwa ɖeakatɔ̃ iyi kɔdzɛva i ikɔ iweoɖeakatɔ̃ ame ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, loɔfɛ̃ Egipte Igarakpakpa kɔrɔ̃. Mainyi kɔ̃ kuakpi ɣee mainyi kɔ̃ ku sidzirisɛi sɔ kuana ɔle kumɔɛ̃ ipɛmi. <verse eid="EZK 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22" />Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Lotsiri Egipte Igarakpakpa. Nto loafɛ̃ ɔ̃ nrɔɔ̃ minyɔ ɔɖuɖu, kusɛɛ gu ngɔ maɔfɛ̃. Ne loatã ipɛmi ɔkpase wũ i kɔrɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23" />Nto loasamera ma Egiptese lopia i nɖebi ame fiɛ loasa ma lofere i nrɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24" />Nto loapia Babilon igara kɔrɔ̃ ɔle. Ne loasu wũ ipɛmi lopia i ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ ame. Ɣɛɛ nto loafɛ̃ Egipte Igarakpakpa kɔrɔ̃, ne ɔto ɔ̃atɔrɛ̃ i Babilon igara anɔ lɛ ɔturi wɔ makpira. <verse eid="EZK 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25" />Nto loapia Babilon igara kɔrɔ̃ ɔle ɣɛɛ Egipte Igarakpakpa nrɔɔ̃ to miafɛ̃ misalaka. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, si losu wũ ipɛmi lopia i Babilon igara kɔrɔ̃ ame fiɛ ɔsu ne ɔta ɔya i Egipte iso. <verse eid="EZK 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26" />Nto loasamera ma Egiptese lopia i nɖebi ame fiɛ loasa ma lofere i nrɔ̃ ame. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>."<verse eid="EZK 30:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31" />
  <para style="s1">Sedar Ɔwɛ̃ Wɔ i Lebanon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1" />Iyi ɖeakatɔ̃ i kuwa tɛare i ikɔ iweoɖeakatɔ̃ ame ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɣere Egipte Igarakpakpa gu ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:2">" 'Nna maawo ɔsu makateragu-ɔ ku fɔ ɔle?<verse eid="EZK 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3" />Dzuĩ Asiria, ɔwi ɔwɛ̃ ne ɔɖe sedar i Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:3">ku akpai wa nto alɛnyɔ gɔ aɣa afɔ ipo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">kukɔlɛ kukpa kato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:3">ne kɔ̃ kato ɔwe i ipo tikpiriã kato.<verse eid="EZK 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4" />Ndu lotã kɔ̃ kuya kumɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">ndu mɛ i karɔ̃ lotã kumɔ kukɔlɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Ndu mɛ i karɔ̃ kuworei ɔbore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">kuki kulɔ kɔ̃ i karɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">Ne kuworei ɔbore i kɔ̃ iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">sikɛlɛ adziri ɔɖuɖu wa i karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="EZK 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5" />Ne ɔso kukɔlɛ kukɛlɛ kato</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">kuɖo adziri ɔɖuɖu i karɔ̃ iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">Kɔ̃ akpa mɔmɔ ɔsi abua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">ne kɔ̃ akpai ɔkarã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">ne awarɛ afere ala ndu gbodzoo ɔso.<verse eid="EZK 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6" />Ɔwiri ame kurodzai ɔɖuɖu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">ɔbara arodzayo i kɔ̃ akpai ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Kuputubɔi ɔɖuɖu sɛ kuɣe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">abi i kɔ̃ akpai kayirinɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Nɖebi siare ɔɖuɖu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">ɔwe i kɔ̃ kusɔ kayirinɔ.<verse eid="EZK 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7" />Kuwe kulɛ gbaã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:7">ku kɔ̃ akpai wa lowarɛ afere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">Ala kɔ̃ siɖu ɔkɛlɛ ndu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:7">gbodzoo kɔrɛ i karɔ̃ ame ɔso.<verse eid="EZK 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8" />Sedar adziri wa i Ɣaa kawĩ ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">iibawo ɔwãrarã ku kɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">ɣee besibe adziri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">iikategu kɔ̃ akpai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">ɣee adziri siare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">iikategu kɔ̃ akpai -</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">kudziri kukuwɛ̃ na i Ɣaa kawĩ ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">kukategu kɔ̃ kulɛ.<verse eid="EZK 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9" />Mme lobara kɔ̃ kulɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:9">ku akpai gbodzoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">Kudziri biara i Eden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:9">i Ɣaa kawĩ ame ɔrɛtɛ anɔmi i kɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="EZK 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10" />" 'Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Ala kukɔlɛ ta kato fiɛ kukɔlɛ kuɖo adziri mama wa ku ayata tikpirii fiɛ kute so ala kɔ̃ kukɔlɛ ɔso ne, <verse eid="EZK 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11" />Losu kɔ̃ lopia i nɖebi ɔɖeisoi kɔrɔ̃ ame, sɔ ɔbara kɔ̃ i kɔ̃ ɔtile kanya. Loɖi kɔ̃ losɛ ise, <verse eid="EZK 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12" />ne kafɔɖe ga mba ɔtile kaɖo i mafɔ nɖebi ame, ɔwɔra kɔ̃ fiɛ ɔrui ɔnyua kɔ̃. Kɔ̃ akpai ɔkpase asia i abe iso gu kugbolomi ɔɖuɖu ame, kɔ̃ akpai ɔfɛfɛ̃ i kuwɛlagbolomi ɔɖuɖu ame i karɔ̃ iso. Karɔ̃ iso nɖebi ɔɖuɖu ɔbɔrɛ i kɔ̃ kusɔ kayirinɔ ne marui manyua kɔ̃ ne. <verse eid="EZK 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13" />Ɔwiri ame kurodzai ɔɖuɖu ɔsɛ i kudziri gɔ loɔrɔ̃ iso, ne karɔ̃ iso kuputubɔi ɔɖuɖu ɔwe i kɔ̃ akpai ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14" />Ne ɔso kudziri mama gɔ i ndu kɔrɛ iisibakɔlɛ so kato ku iteso, kukɔlɛ kɔ̃ kato i adziri mama iso ku ipo tikpiriã kato kuiyikuiyi. Ku adziri kuawɛ̃ wa lona ndu kukaakɔ iisibana kukɔlɛ gɔmɔ igbã kuiyikuiyi. Wã ɔɖuɖu aakpi ku kawirikɔ̃, akɛlɛ karɔ̃ ga i kayirinɔ ame i maturi awune ndɛ̃, ku ma nsɛ makɛlɛ iwo ame.<verse eid="EZK 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Iyi nɛ makpadzɛ̃ kɔ̃ mabɔkarɔ̃ i ikpibiɔ ame ne, losu isoma i kɔ̃ iti lofu i ndu wodoroa iso. Losia kɔ̃ kuworei kɔrɔ̃ iso, ne kɔ̃ ndu gbodzoo ɔsɔ̃. Ne ɔso losu isoma lopia Lebanon, ne adziri ɔɖuɖu i karɔ̃ iso ɔɣɔ akpi. <verse eid="EZK 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16" />Lotã nɖebi ɔti mikpakpa i kɔ̃ irɔ̃ kulu ku ɔwi wɔ lobɔ kɔ̃ i ikpibiɔ ame, ku mma nsɛ makɛlɛ iwo ame. Kere ne adziri ɔɖuɖu wa i Eden, nwa nlɛ aɖo i Lebanon, adziri ɔɖuɖu wa lona ndu kukaakɔ ne, mapia ma kɔrɔ̃ i kayiri i karɔ̃ kayirinɔ. <verse eid="EZK 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17" />Mma losɛ i kɔ̃ kusɔ kayirinɔ, kɔ̃ isomaturi i nɖebi ndɛ̃, ɔɔkɛlɛ ikpibiɔ ame ku kɔ̃, mabua i mma maɖue i ipɛmi kanya iso.<verse eid="EZK 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18" />" 'Mme kudziri i Eden maawo ɔsu ɔkateragu fɔ kulɛ gu ɔle? Ɣɛɛ fɔ wũ ne, mato maabɔ-ɔ karɔ̃ ku Eden adziri ikɛlɛ karɔ̃ kayirinɔ. Ato aarɛ i mma loitu sirɛrɛ̃ ndɛ̃, ku mma maɖue ku ipɛmi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 31:18">" 'Nnɛgbe nɖe Egipte Igarakpakpa gu ɔ̃ karana gu maturi ɔɖuɖu, ɔkpɛ ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ.' "<verse eid="EZK 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔkpibiɛnɔ Itã Egipte Igarakpakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1" />Iyi ɖeakatɔ̃ i kuwa kuweonyɔare i ikɔ iweonyɔare ame ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, pia ɔkpibiɛnɔ nrɔɔ̃ ise i Egipte Igarakpakpa iso si aɣere wũ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">" 'Ase lɛ dzata i nɖebi ndɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">Ase lɛ bɔisiare i ɔpo ame</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">ato atere akiki i fɔ kuworei ame.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">Ato aɣa ndu ku fɔ ngba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">fiɛ ato alupura ndu ku iba.<verse eid="EZK 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">" 'Nto loasa wũ asabu lofere-ɔ iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:3">maturi kposu to maabuai me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:3">Ne mato maakpadzɛ̃-ɔ i wũ asabu ame mabɔ ɔkpokpo.<verse eid="EZK 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4" />Nto loafuĩdza-ɔ losɛ i karɔ̃ iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:4">ne loawɛrɛ̃-ɔ losɛ i karɔ̃ ga nfere kakpa iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">Nto loatã ɔwiri ame kurodzai ɔɖuɖu ɔba kuasɛ i fɔ iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:4">Ne karɔ̃ iso mabɔi ɔɖuɖu aarurui fɔ sina.<verse eid="EZK 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5" />Nto loasamera fɔ sosina lofere i abe iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:5">Ne loayira kugbolomi ku fɔ sosina kpia.<verse eid="EZK 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6" />Nto loatã karɔ̃ ɔbu ku fɔ ima nɛ nto ibore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:6">isɛ ikɛlɛ abe iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:6">Ne kuwɛlagbolomi aayigu fɔ sosina.<verse eid="EZK 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7" />Si lowɔra-ɔ loɖi ne, nto loakɔla kuɖokpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:7">ne loabara kɔ̃ awãmi guduu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">Nto loatã adɔdɔ ɔfu kuɣɛ̃ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:7">fiɛ ɔgbaleti iisibare.<verse eid="EZK 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8" />Nto loabara sitɔ ifiɛ ɔɖuɖu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:8">i kato guduu i fɔ iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:8">Nto loabɔ idududu i fɔ karɔ̃ iso.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="EZK 32:8">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ ne.<verse eid="EZK 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9" />Nto loaɖaa maturi gbodzoo situ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:9">si lobɔ fɔ iwɔ i nɖebi ndɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:9">i nrɔ̃ mɛ aitsue ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10" />Nto loatã sitsue ɔbɔrɛ maturi gbodzoo i fɔ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">si losarã wũ ipɛmi i ma anɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">Ne ma magara to maati makpakpa ku ifɔ̃ ala fɔ ɔso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:10">I iyi nɛ akpase ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">ma ɔbiara to ɔ̃ati ɔkpakpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">i ma ngbã ɔwi ɔɖuɖu ame.<verse eid="EZK 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11" />" 'Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:11">" ' Babilon igara ipɛmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:11">to iaba iata iya-ɔ iso.<verse eid="EZK 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12" />Nto loawɔra fɔ maturi gbodzoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">i makparɛrɛĩ apɛmi kanya -</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">mma nɖe matilese maɖo i nɖebi ɔɖuɖu ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">Mato mabibiɛ Egipte iteso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">ne mato maawuĩ ɔ̃ maturi gbodzoo i karɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13" />Nto loawɔra ɔ̃ ayomabɔi ɔɖuɖu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:13">loɖi i ndu gbodzoo kuruɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">Maturi ngba iisibabo i ndu ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:13">ɣee mabɔi ngba iisibalupura ndu mɛmɔ ku iba.<verse eid="EZK 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14" />Iyɔ nto loatã ɔ̃ ndu ɔse kpoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:14">fiɛ loatã ɔ̃ kuworei ɔbore lɛ nnɔĩ.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="EZK 32:14">
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15" />Si lobara Egipte karɔ̃ ɔkpese ikpakpi ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:15">loawɔra irabiara i kã ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">Si loɖue mma ɔɖuɖu nsi i mmɔ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:15">iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.'<verse eid="EZK 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16" />"Ɔkpibiɛnɔ wɔgbe mato maaka matã wũ ne. Nɖebi mabibirɔ̃gomi to maaka kɔ̃ matã wũ, itã Egipte gu ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu maaka kɔ̃ matã." <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Egipte Ɔkpase Ɔbo i Iwo Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17" />Iyi iweoruva i kuwa ɖeakatɔ̃ i ikɔ iweonyɔare ame ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, biɛ kaku i Egipte maturi gu nɖebi siare mama mabibirɔ̃gomi iti. Alasɔ nto loasese ma i karɔ̃ kayirinɔ ku mma nsɛ makɛlɛ iwo ame. <verse eid="EZK 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19" />Karɛ ma sɔ, 'Masɛ maɖuɛ-ɔ maɖo mamama? Kɛlɛ karɔ̃ ame si marara-ɔ i mma loitu sirɛrɛ̃ ndɛ̃.' <verse eid="EZK 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20" />Mato maarɔ̃ marɛ i mma maɖue ku ipɛmi ndɛ̃. Maɔɖi ipɛmi mato, mitã makpadzɛ̃ wũ ku ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu makɛlɛgu. <verse eid="EZK 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21" />Karɔ̃ ame i ikpibiɔ ame ne, matɔ̃ɖedze siare to maatofora Egipte gu ɔ̃ isomaturi ku aɣiãra maɣɛ sɔ, 'Maɔba i karɔ̃ ame, marɛ i mma loitu sirɛrɛ̃ fiɛ makpi i ipɛmi kanya ndɛ̃.'<verse eid="EZK 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22" />"Asiria maturi gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu pia i mmɔ. Ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu ma maɖue, mma ɔɖuɖu lorɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya akpibiɔ ɔki alɔ wũ. <verse eid="EZK 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23" />Ma akpibiɔ pia i ikpibiɔ kawodorokɔ̃ ne ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze rɛ maki malɔ ɔ̃ ikpibiɔ. Mma ɔɖuɖu loɔtã maturi ɔti makpakpa ku ifɔ̃ i magbanadze karɔ̃ iso, ɔɔrɔ̃ makpi i ipɛmi kanya.<verse eid="EZK 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24" />"Elam pia i mmɔ, ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔki malɔ ɔ̃ ikpibiɔ. Maɖue ma ɔɖuɖu, marɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya. Mma ɔɖuɖu loɔtã maturi ɔti makpakpa ku ifɔ̃ i magbanadze karɔ̃ iso ɔɔkɛlɛ karɔ̃ ame gɔ maitu sirɛrɛ̃. Mapia i ma kunuarɛ ame ku mma nsɛ makɛlɛ ikpibiɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25" />Masɛ Elam karɛkɔ̃ i mma maɖue ndɛ̃, gɔ i ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔki malɔ ɔ̃ ikpibiɔ. Ma ɔɖuɖu iitu sirɛrɛ̃, marɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya. Ala maɔtã maturi ɔti makpakpa ku ifɔ̃, ifɔ magbanadze karɔ̃ iso ɔso, ne mapia i ma kunuarɛ gɔ igbã mpia i mma nsɛ makɛlɛ ikpibiɔ ame iso, marara ma i mma maɖue ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26" />"Mesek gu Tubal pia i mmɔ, ne ma maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔki malɔ ma akpibiɔ. Ma ɔɖuɖu ɖe mma loitu sirɛrɛ̃, ne maɖue ma ku ipɛmi alasɔ matã maturi biara ɔti makpakpa ku ɔwi wɔ mawe i magbanadze karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27" />Maibiara ma ku kuwarɛ lɛ ma loitu sirɛrɛ̃ maturi ma lofɔ iyere. Mma loɔkɛlɛ ikpibiɔ ame ku ma akpakpɛ̃ra - ma akpirafɔra sia i ma kuturidziri iso fiɛ ma apɛmi pia i ma ati kayirinɔ. Ma aɣɛrɛ sia i ma akui iso, atoasɔ mmagbe ɔfɔ iyere ne, matã ɔturi biara ɔti ɔkpakpa gɔ mawe i magbanadze karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28" />"Fɔ wũ, O Egipte Igarakpakpa, ato aafɛ̃ fiɛ aarɛ i mma loitu sirɛrɛ̃ ndɛ̃, ku mma lorɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya.<verse eid="EZK 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29" />"Edom pia i mmɔ, ɔ̃ magara gu ɔ̃ matɔ̃ɖedze ɔɖuɖu ne, maɔrara ma ku mma lorɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya atoasɔ mawe ɔle. Marɛ ku mma loitu sirɛrɛ̃ ku mma nsɛ makɛlɛ ikpibiɔ ame.<verse eid="EZK 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30" />"Katikpe matɔ̃ɖedze ɔɖuɖu gu ma Sidonse pia i mmɔ. Atoasɔ ma ɔle ɔtã maturi ɔti makpakpa ne, ka makpagu mma maɖue i kunuarɛ ame. Marɛ gɔ maitu sirɛrɛ̃ ku mma lorɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya fiɛ mapia i kunuarɛ ame ku mma nsɛ makɛlɛ ikpibiɔ ame.<verse eid="EZK 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31" />"Egipte Igarakpakpa - ma gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu - to maanya ma ne ɔ̃ maturi ma maɖue ku ipɛmi to maatã wũ ndzo. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ sɔ: Atoasɔ lotã ɔtã maturi ɔti makpakpa i magbanadze karɔ̃ iso ne, Igarakpakpa gu ɔ̃ maturi ɔɖuɖu to maarɛ i mma loitu sirɛrɛ̃ ndɛ̃, ku mma maɖue ku ipɛmi."<verse eid="EZK 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33" />
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Ɔɖi Ezekiel Lɛ Israel Dzuɛ̃se Awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖe fɔ kaɖemabi ika si aɣere ma sɔ, 'Si lobɔ ipɛmi i karɔ̃ kawɛ̃ iso fiɛ karɔ̃ iso maturi ɔɖi ma ɔturi ɔwɛ̃ sɔ ɔɖe ma dzuɛ̃se ne, <verse eid="EZK 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3" />fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔnya sɔ ipɛmi to iba i karɔ̃ iso, ne ɔsɛ ɔfɛ̃ kadadã si ɔsɛ̃ maturi ne, <verse eid="EZK 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4" />iyɔ si ɔrere ɔnɔ kadadã silɔ ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ifɔ isɛ̃itã, ne ipɛmi ɔba fiɛ ɔkpi ne, ɔ̃ ima aasia i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ iti iso. <verse eid="EZK 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5" />Gɔ ɔnɔ kadadã silɔ ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ifɔ isɛ̃itã ne, ɔ̃ ima asia i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ iti iso. Si ɔfɔ ɔfɔ isɛ̃itã ne, tee ɔ̃aɖi so ngbã. <verse eid="EZK 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6" />Ɣɛɛ si dzuɛ̃se ɔnya tsirise to ɔba fiɛ ɔ̃isɛ ɔfɛ̃ kadadã ɔsɛ̃ maturi fiɛ tsirise ɔba fiɛ ɔɖue ɔturi i ma ndɛ̃ ne, nwɔmɔ to ɔ̃akpi ala ɔ̃ ikpi iti ɣɛɛ loakarɛ ɔ̃ ima iti i dzuɛ̃se nrɔɔ̃ ame.'<verse eid="EZK 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, loɔbara-ɔ dzuɛ̃se lotã Israel kaɖe, ne ɔso nɔ nnɛ nto loɣɛ si atã ma isɛ̃itã nɛ lobɔrɛ i wũ kɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8" />Si loɣere ɔtilese sɔ, 'Ɔtilese, gbaã ato aakpi lo,' fiɛ aiɣɛ sɔ ɔfiriki i ɔ̃ siri iso ne, ɔtilese wɔmɔ to ɔ̃akpi ala ɔ̃ ikpi ɔso, ne nto loakarɛ ɔ̃ ima iti i fɔ kɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9" />Ɣɛɛ si asɛ̃ atã ɔtilese sɔ ɔfiriki i ɔ̃ siri iso fiɛ ɔ̃isɛ ɔbara i ne iso ne, ɔto ɔ̃akpi i ɔ̃ akpi iti ɣɛɛ fɔ ne ɔɔɖi fɔ ngbã.<verse eid="EZK 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbiara To Ɔ̃abara Akɔnta i ɔ̃ Karabara Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɣere Israel kaɖe sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe mito miɣɛ ne: "Bo akpi gu aɣɛrɛ sia i bo iso ku ɔrɔrã, ne bopia i imɔrɛ̃ ame gbaã ala wã iti. Nda boawo ngbã ɔwe?" ' <verse eid="EZK 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11" />Ɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔkã sɔ, Ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, loisɛ lona isoɣɔ i matilese kukpi iso ɣɛɛ bowũ sɔ si mafiriki mabɔrɛ i ma siri iso si masɛ ngbã. Mifiriki! Mifiriki mibɔrɛ i mi siri nyanyariã iso! O Israel kaɖe be ɔso miakpi?'<verse eid="EZK 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12" />"Ne ɔso, ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɣere fɔ kaɖemabi sɔ, "Ɔturi sibɔlɔlɔ iibaɖi wũ si ɔbara ikpi. Ɔtilese ɔtile iibatã ɔrɔ̃ si ɔfiriki ɔbɔrɛ i ne ame. Ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa si ɔbara ikpi ne, ɔ̃ibasɛ ngbã ala ɔ̃ sibɔlɔlɔ kuere ɔso.' <verse eid="EZK 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13" />Si loɣere ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa sɔ ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã ɣɛɛ ɔsiaiti i ɔ̃ sibɔlɔlɔ iso ne ɔbara iranyanyariã ne, maisibanyigi ɔ̃ sibɔlɔlɔ ara wa ɔ̃ɔbara kuiwɛ̃. Ɔto ɔ̃akpi ala iranyanyariã ne ɔ̃ɔbara ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14" />Ana ne si loɣere ɔtilese sɔ, 'Gbaã ato aakpi,' ɣɛɛ kere ne ɔfiriki ɔbɔrɛ i ɔ̃ ikpi ame ne ɔsɛ ɔbara nnɛ loya gu isɛɛ - <verse eid="EZK 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15" />si ɔtilese ɔkpesera nnɛ ɔfɔ lɛ ayaikama i kuso gɔ ɔnyɛ ɔtã iti ne, ɔkpesera nnɛ ɔ̃ɔyu ɔtã, ne ɔsiai asɛ̃ra wa nsɛ atã ngbã fiɛ ɔ̃isɛ ɔbara iranyanyariã kuiwɛ̃ ne, gbaã ne ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã, ɔ̃ibakpi. <verse eid="EZK 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16" />Maisibanyigi ikpi kuiwɛ̃ nɛ ɔbara ana. Ɔ̃ɔbara isɛɛ gu nnɛ loya, gbaã ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã.<verse eid="EZK 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17" />"Ɣɛɛ fɔ kaɖemabi sɛ maɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔri iiya.' Ɣɛɛ ne ma ɔri bowũ loiya. <verse eid="EZK 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18" />Si ɔturi bɔlɔlɔa ɔfiriki ɔbɔrɛ i ɔ̃ sibɔlɔlɔ ame ne ɔbara iranyanyariã ne, ɔto ɔ̃akpi i ne iti. <verse eid="EZK 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19" />Si ɔtilese ɔfiriki ɔbɔrɛ i ɔ̃ ɔtile ame, ne ɔsɛ ɔbara isɛɛ gu nnɛ loya ne, ɔto ɔ̃asɛ ngbã ala nnɛ ɔbara ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20" />Ɣɛɛ Israel kaɖe, asɛ aɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔri iiya.' Ɣɛɛ nto loaɣɛgu ɔbiara atɔ̃me i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ siri iso."<verse eid="EZK 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Ikpase Itɔ̃me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21" />Iyi ruva i kuwa weova ame i ikɔ iweonyɔare i bo kafɔrɔ̃ ame ikɛlɛ ame ne, ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ wɔ lorui ɔtere i Yerusalem ɔba i wũ kɔrɛ ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔmagɛ̃siare ɔɔkpase!" <verse eid="EZK 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22" />Kiniɔ ne kutsuɛ gɔ lofe fiɛ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔba ɔ̃ɔbo ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɔ̃ ɔsia me iso, ne ɔbusi me kanya fiɛ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔba i wũ kɔrɛ ku kaya. Ne ɔso mabusi me kanya fiɛ loisilokanana.<verse eid="EZK 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaɖe Akpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, maturi ma nsi i Israel karɔ̃ akpakpi ame to maɣɛ sɔ, ' Abraham ɔɖe ɔturi ɔwɛ̃ ɣɛɛ ɔwe karɔ̃. Ɣɛɛ bo ne bosi gbodzoo, gbaã ne maɔsu karɔ̃ matã bo lɛ bo kare.' <verse eid="EZK 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25" />Ne ɔso ɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Misɛ miɖe sina dzɛ ima ɔkpese ipia i kame fiɛ misɛ misumu arapɔa ne misɛ miɖue maturi. Iyɔ ne minyɔ sɔ karɔ̃ si kaɖe mi kare? <verse eid="EZK 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26" />Misɛ misiaiti i mi ipɛmi iso, misɛ mibara anyanyara fiɛ misɛ mirɛgu mi manyii mare. Iyɔ ne minyɔ sɔ karɔ̃ si kaɖe mi kare?'<verse eid="EZK 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27" />"Ɣere ma nnɛgbe sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, mma lokuti i akpakpi simagɛ̃siare ame to maarɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya. Mma i karɔ̃ ame ne nto loasu lotã mabɔi nyanyariã sɔ makɛkɛ fiɛ mma i ɔlekusɛkɔ̃ gu sikpolo ame to maakpi ala inyɛpɛ̃ ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28" />Nto loabara karɔ̃ ɔkpese ikpakpi fiɛ loatuĩdza Israel iteso ɔle. Ne Israel abe aakpese ikpakpi sɔ kuwɛ̃ iibasɛ ɔri ɔki i wã iso. <verse eid="EZK 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29" />Iyɔ ne mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, si loɔbara karɔ̃ kakpese ikpakpi ala anyanyara ɔɖuɖu wa maɔbara.'<verse eid="EZK 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnɛ Lobɔrɛ i Kanyaɖidze Karabara Ame.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30" />Ɣɛɛ fɔ, ɔturi awune ɔbi ne, fɔ kaɖemabi to maɖegu so ika i fɔ iso i abere kuruɛ gu i ayo akui kɔrɛ, mato maɣere so sɔ, 'Ba nɔ kanya ga loɔbɔrɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ kaba.' <verse eid="EZK 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31" />Wũ maturi sɛ maba fɔ kɔrɛ, lɛ kumɛgɔ masɛ mabara, masɛ masɛ i fɔ anɔ makã fɔ atɔ̃me atsue. Ɣɛɛ maisɛ mabara i wã iso. Masɛ maɖeika lɛ masɛ maɖuɛ me ɣɛɛ ma situ siai sikã ibie siri lalaa. <verse eid="EZK 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32" />Ɔnukuare ne, i ma kɔrɛ ne aire kuira iɖo ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔka kuɖuɛ aka ku silɔ mɛrɛ̃mɛrɛã gu ara isa kukaakɔ. Alasɔ masɛ manɔ fɔ atɔ̃me ɣɛɛ maisɛ mabara masia i wã iso.<verse eid="EZK 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33" />"Si ara ɔɖuɖu wagbe sɛ aba i kame ne, - fiɛ gbaã ito iaba ne - iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Ɣaa kanyaɖidze ɔwɛ̃ ɔɔwe i ma ndɛ̃."<verse eid="EZK 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Matɔ̃ɖedze Lalaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya i Israel manyɔisose iso, ɖikanya si aɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ndzo mitã Israel manyɔisose ma nsɛ masu ira i ma mɔmɔ ma ɔnɔwɛ̃ iso! Manyɔisose ne iiɖe masɛrɛ akuri masɛ manyɔiso ɣɛɛ? <verse eid="EZK 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3" />Misɛ minɛ inyɛndu, mipia so arapia ku bɔi siwɛrɛ̃ fiɛ misɛ miɖue mabɔi ma nlɛ, ɣɛɛ miisɛ minyɔ masɛrɛ iso. <verse eid="EZK 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4" />Miipia mma lofɛ̃ ɔle ɣee misa manyɛse ɣee minyi mma makpira agbɛ. Miisɛ mikɔ mma loyu mibɔ ɣee minyɔnyɔ mma loyu. Miɔɖe ma iso ku ɔtile gu amumuɣɔ. <verse eid="EZK 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5" />Ne ɔso maɔsame alasɔ nyɔisose kuwɛ̃ na. Ana ne gɔ maɔsame ne makpese aɖera matã kuputubɔi ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6" />Wũ masɛrɛrrerɔ̃ ɔɔkila i abe ɔɖuɖu gu kabemi kɔlɛa biara iso. Masamera ma mapia i karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso ne kuwɛ̃ iinyɔnyɔ ɣee ɔbie ma.<verse eid="EZK 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7" />" 'Ne ɔso, manyɔisose, minɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔkã sɔ: Ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, ala wũ masɛrɛ na nyɔisose fiɛ maɔnyua ma makpese araɖea matã kuputubɔi ɔɖuɖu, fiɛ ala wũ manyɔisose iinyɔnyɔ wũ masɛrɛ ɣɛɛ manyɔsoiso bowũ maɖo wũ masɛrɛ, <verse eid="EZK 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9" />ne ɔso manyɔisose minɔ lo <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me sɔ: <verse eid="EZK 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10" />Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Lotsiri manyɔisose fiɛ loakarɛ ma itɔ̃me i nnɛ loba i wũ masɛrɛ ikuri iso. Loto loaɖi manyɔisose i masɛrɛ inyɔiso ame si manyɔisose iisibanyɔsoiso. Loto loaɖi wũ masɛrɛ lobɔrɛgu i ma nnya ame fiɛ iisibaɖe araɖea itã ma.<verse eid="EZK 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛrɛkɔdze Sɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11" />" 'Ala nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Mme, wũ mɔmɔ loto loanyɔnyɔ wũ masɛrɛ fiɛ loanyɔ ma iso. <verse eid="EZK 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12" />Lɛ kumɛgɔ i nyɔisose sɛ ɔnyɔ ɔ̃ masɛrɛ ma losame iso si ɔpiagu ma ne, ngbɔ nto loanyɔ wũ masɛrɛ iso ne. Nto loaɖi ma lobɔrɛgu i ngɔi ɔɖuɖu mɛ masamera ma mapia ku adɔdɔ gu idududu iyi iso. <verse eid="EZK 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13" />Nto loakɔ ma lobɔrɛgu i nɖebi gu nrɔ̃ ame, ne loabɔ ma i ma mɔmɔ karɔ̃ iso. Nto loatã ma araɖea i Israel abe gu i siwore kɔrɛ gu i ngɔi ɔɖuɖu i ngbegɔ i maturi sɛ mawe. <verse eid="EZK 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14" />Loto loatã ma sikuakaɖekɔ̃ sɛɛ i Israel abe wa loaɖe ma araɖea karɔ̃. Mmɔ mato maarɛ i karɔ̃ i araɖea iɖe karɔ̃ sɛɛ iso, ne i mmɔ mato maaɖe araɖea i sikuakaɖekɔ̃ ga mba iɖa i Israel abe iso. <verse eid="EZK 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15" />Mme wũ mɔmɔ nto loanyɔ wũ masɛrɛ iso fiɛ loatã marɛ i karɔ̃, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16" />Nto loanyɔnyɔ masɛrɛ ma loyu fiɛ loakpesera mma loyu lobɔ. Nto loanyi mma lofɔ agbɛ fiɛ loapia mma lofɛ̃ ɔle. Ɣɛɛ mma lona so fiɛ maba ɔle ne loawɔra ma. Nto loanyɔ masɛrɛ iso ku itɔ̃meɣɛiriso.<verse eid="EZK 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17" />" 'Ɣɛɛ fɔ, wũ masɛrɛ ikuri ne, nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Nto loaɣɛ itɔ̃me ku sɛrɛrerɔ̃ gu ɔmama ndɛ̃ fiɛ loaɣɛ atɔ̃me i akpalasa gu masɛrɛtepu ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18" />Iisi mi sɔ miaɖe ara i sikuakaɖekɔ̃ sɛɛ? Ikote sɔ mianene sikuakaɖekɔ̃ tsɔra ku mi ngba? Iisi mi sɔ mianɛ ndu mɛ lokpa ɣɛɛ? Ikote sɔ mianene sitsɔra ku mi ngba mipia i iba ame ana? <verse eid="EZK 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19" />Ikote sɔ wũ masɛrɛ ikuri aaɖe ara i nwa miɔnene iso fiɛ maanɛ nwa miɔnene mipia i iba ku mi ngba?<verse eid="EZK 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20" />" 'Ne ɔso nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Nyɔ, Mme wũ mɔmɔ nto loaɣɛ atɔ̃me i masɛrɛrerɔ̃ ma lona so gu mma lokore ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21" />Ala mi, masɛrɛ ma lona so ɔtsue mma nto manyɛ mafɛ̃ asa gu amɔiti gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miɔsa ma miruigu. <verse eid="EZK 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22" />Nto loaɖi wũ masɛrɛrerɔ̃ ikuri, fiɛ maisibayu ma. Nto loaɣɛ atɔ̃me i sɛrɛrerɔ̃ ɔwɛ̃ gu ɔmama ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23" />Nto loaɖi nyɔisose ɔwɛ̃ i masɛrɛ iso, wũ ɔɖabo David, ɔto ɔ̃anyɔ ma iso. Ɔto ɔ̃anyɔ ma iso fiɛ ɔto ɔ̃aɖe ma nyɔisose. <verse eid="EZK 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24" />Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loaɖe ma Ɣaa, fiɛ wũ ɔɖabo David to ɔ̃aɖe ɔɖeisoi i ma ndɛ̃. Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika.<verse eid="EZK 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosate Isobuɛ Ndamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25" />" 'Nto lobara isobuɛ ndamu ku wũ maturi fiɛ loaɖi kuputubɔi i karɔ̃ iso. Iyɔ wũ maturi to maawe i fafuĩ ame fiɛ maarɛ i ipo ame i kaɣɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26" />Nto loafere ma kusɛkusɛ gu karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ga loki kalɔ wũ kabemi. Nto loasese kado i ɔwi iso. Kado sɛɛ wɔgbe to ɔ̃abɔ ara itã maturi. <verse eid="EZK 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27" />Adziri wa i nkpɛkɔ̃ to miaɣɔ̃ wã adziribi fiɛ karɔ̃ to kaatã kã ɔraɖui. Maturi to maawe i kaɣɔ ame i ma karɔ̃ iso. Mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, si lobiɛ ma ɔmeisodziri fiɛ loɖi ma lobɔrɛgu i mma lobara ma masande nrɔɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28" />Nɖebi iisibayu ma ɣee kuputubɔi iisibawe ma. Mato maasɛ i kaɣɔ ame fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iibapia ma ifɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29" />Nto loatã ma karɔ̃ ɔfɔ iyere ala kã ɔraɖui ilɛ ɔso. Ne maisibaweinyɛ i karɔ̃ iso ala kukãsiare ɔso ɣee nɖebi mama ɔma ma. <verse eid="EZK 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme, ma Ɣaa <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne, lopiagu ma ne ma, Israel kaɖe ɖe wũ maturi. <verse eid="EZK 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ, Mi wũ masɛrɛrerɔ̃, wũ sikuakaɖekɔ̃ masɛrɛrerɔ̃, , wũ maturi, Mme nɖe mi Ɣaa ne.' "<verse eid="EZK 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Edom Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, su fɔ anɔ sɔ̃ i Seir Kube iso si aɖikanya i kɔ̃ iso <verse eid="EZK 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3" />aɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Lota loɣɛ-ɔ iso, Seir Kube, nto loanabarã wũ kɔrɔ̃ lota loya-ɔ iso fiɛ loabara-ɔ aɖe ikpakpi gu fafuĩ. <verse eid="EZK 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4" />Nto loabara fɔ simagɛ̃ ɔkpese ikpakpi fiɛ aakpese fufuĩ ame. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5" />" 'Ala mitsiri Israel ɔwi biara ɔso ne, misu ma mipia i ipɛmi kanya ku ɔwi wɔ kukpakpi ɔba i ma iso, ku ɔwi wɔ mapia i kutsueikpadzɛ̃ ɔwi tsɔra ame, <verse eid="EZK 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ ne ɔso ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, nto loasu-ɔ lopia i ituriɖue nrɔɔ̃ ame fiɛ ito iasiai-ɔ. Gɔ aisɛ̃ ituriɖue ne, ituriɖue to iatere isiai-ɔ. <verse eid="EZK 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7" />Nto loabara Seir kube ɔkpese ikpakpi gu fafuĩ ame fiɛ loawɔra maturi ɔɖuɖu ma nsɛ maba fiɛ masɛ makpese i kɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8" />Nto loayira fɔ abe ku makpise, mma maɖue ku ipɛmi to marɔ̃ i fɔ abemi iso gu i fɔ kugbolomi gu i siwore ɔɖuɖu kɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9" />Nto loabara-ɔ aɖe ikpakpi gu fafuĩ ɔwi daaro. Maturi iisibasɛ i fɔ simagɛ̃ ame. Iyɔ ato aatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10" />" 'Ala ɔɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nɖebi minyɔ mɛgbe gu nrɔ̃ to miaɖe bo mire fiɛ boto boafɔ me," atoasɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔwe i mmɔ. <verse eid="EZK 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ne ɔso ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ne, nto loabara-ɔ i sikpã gu sirerɛ dzɛ aɖikayi i fɔ itsiri nɛ aba atã ma ame kanya. Ne nto loatã Israel ɔtsue me i ma ndɛ̃ si lokpadzɛ̃-ɔ kutsue. <verse eid="EZK 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12" />Iyɔ ato aatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> lonɔ sitia ara ɔɖuɖu wa aɣɛ ata aya i Israel abe iso. Aɣɛ sɔ, "Maɔbara ma makpese ikpakpi fiɛ maɔsu ma mapia i bo nrɔɔ̃ ame sɔ bokɛkɛ." <verse eid="EZK 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13" />Aɖe ndamu i wũ iso ne aɖeika ata aya me iso gɔ aipia ɔnyagɛmi i irɛkpo, ne lonɔ ne. <verse eid="EZK 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Nto loabara-ɔ akpese ikpakpi iyɔ kayiiso maturi ɔɖuɖu to mana isoɣɔ. <verse eid="EZK 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15" />Ala ana isoɣɔ ku ɔwi wɔ i Israel kaɖe kaɖekɔ̃ ɔkpese ikpakpi ɔso ne, kumɛɔ ame nto loabara-ɔ ne. Ato aakpese ikpakpi lo, Seir Kube, mi gu Edom karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' "<verse eid="EZK 35:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36" />
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Kusɛkusɛ i Israel Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya tã Israel abe si aɣɛ sɔ, 'O Israel abe, minɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me. <verse eid="EZK 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Tsirise ɔɣɛ i mi iso sɔ, "Ɛɣɛɛ̃! Kokowi abemi ɔɔkpese bo are." ' <verse eid="EZK 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3" />Ne ɔso ɖikanya si aɣɛ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ala mi matsirise ɔta mabo i mi iso i kasɛ biara, ne mikpese nɖebi tsɔra mire gu maturi akaɖe nyanyariã gu iyerenina ne. <verse eid="EZK 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4" />Ne ɔso Israel abe minɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso itɔ̃me lo: <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣere abe gu abemi, siwore gu kugbolomi, akpakpi gu simagɛ̃ dzɛ matere manyua fiɛ maɔmɔɛ̃ ara fiɛ nɖebi mɛ loki milɔ sɛ̃ to sibara sɛ̃ aɣiãra ne - <verse eid="EZK 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5" />nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Wũ sirerɛ sikpã to sitsue i nɖebi tsɔra gu Edom ɔɖuɖu iso, alasɔ ku isoɣɔ gu ituridaawarɛ i ma situ ame ne, masu wũ karɔ̃ lɛ ma kare si maamɔɛ̃ ara i kã sikuakaɖekɔ̃.' <verse eid="EZK 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6" />Ne ɔso ɖikanya ise i Israel karɔ̃ iso si aɣere abe gu abemi, siwore gu kugbolomi sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Nto loɖeika ku wũ sirerɛ sikpã alasɔ ɔɔweinyɛ i nɖebi aɣiãra ame. <verse eid="EZK 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7" />Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Lotara wũ kɔrɔ̃ i kato nto lokã sɔ nɖebi mɛ loki milɔ-ɔ ana, to miaki i aɣiãra wa ame aki.<verse eid="EZK 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8" />" 'O Israel abe, ɣɛɛ mi ne, mito miaɖi akpai fiɛ miaɣɔ̃ abi mitã wũ maturi Israel. Ala mato maaba kaa i ɔwi kurukutu ame ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9" />Losu ira i mi iso fiɛ nto loanyɔ mi nnya fiɛ mato maakpɛ̃ karɔ̃ mapia ɔraɖui iso, <verse eid="EZK 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10" />fiɛ nto loatã maturi ɔɣe masia i mi iso, ta Israel iyo ɔɖuɖu kɔraa. Maturi to maasɛ i simagɛ̃ ame fiɛ maaledza akpakpi itsue. <verse eid="EZK 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11" />Nto loatã maturi gu mabɔi ɔsi fiɛ mala iɣe fiɛ maasi gbodzoo. Nto loasɛra maturi i mi ame lɛ ise saa fiɛ loatã ana isaruɛ abua iɖo saa. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="EZK 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12" />Nto loatã maturi, wũ kaɖe Israel, ɔsɛ i mi iso. Ma ire miaɖe fiɛ miaɖe ma kaɖekɔ̃ fiɛ aisibasɛ̃ ma mabi itã kuiyikuiyi ana.<verse eid="EZK 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13" />" ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ala maturi sɛ maɣere mi sɔ, "Misɛ miwe maturi fiɛ misɛ mitã sɔ kaɖe iisɛ kana mabi ne," <verse eid="EZK 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14" />ne ɔso miisibawe maturi ɣee miisibatã mi kaɖe ɔɖe silɛma, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15" />Loisibatã sɔ aanɔ nɖebi aɣiãra gu sitia fiɛ aisibanɔ maturi aɣiãra ɣee maisibatã fɔ kaɖe ɔrɔ̃, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.' "<verse eid="EZK 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Mabi Ngbã Ɣɛtɛ Isɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me ana sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɔwi wɔ i Israel maturi ɔsɛ i ma mɔmɔ karɔ̃ iso ne, mapukutura kã ala ma nsɛgbai gu arabarara ɔso. Ma nsɛgbai ɔse lɛ kumɛgɔ i ɔrɔ̃go iisɛ ɔsekele i wũ anɔ si ɔya i kayoma i kuwa ame. <verse eid="EZK 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18" />Ne ɔso loɖi wũ sikpã teterea losia i ma iso alasɔ maɔfere ima i karɔ̃ iso fiɛ alasɔ maɔpukutura kã ku ma arapɔa. <verse eid="EZK 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19" />Losamera ma lopia i nɖebi ndɛ̃ ne masame mawe i nrɔ̃ ame ne. Loɣɛgu ma itɔ̃me i ma nsɛgbai gu arabarara kanya. <verse eid="EZK 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20" />Ne ku kakɔi biara ga makɛlɛ i nɖebi ndɛ̃ ne, mapukutura wũ iyere sekelea, ala maɔɣɛ i ma iso sɔ, "Mmagbe nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> maturi ɣɛɛ ne ɔrui ilɛ sɔ maɔrui i ɔ̃ karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="EZK 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21" />Loɔsu ira i wũ iyere sekelea iso, nnɛ i Israel iyo ɔpukutura i nɖebi mɛ ndɛ̃ maɔkɛlɛ.<verse eid="EZK 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22" />"Ne ɔso ɣere Israel kaɖe sɔ, '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Iiɖe mi Israel kaɖe lo, ɔso nto loabara ara wagbe, ɣɛɛ ala Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyere sekelea iti, nnɛ miɔpukutura i ngbegɔ miɔkɛlɛ i nɖebi ame. <verse eid="EZK 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23" />Nto loaɖi wũ iyere siare isekele lote. Iyere nɛ miɔpukutura i nɖebi ndɛ̃, iyere nɛ miɔpukutura i ma ndɛ̃. Si loɖi so lote sɔ losekele iki i mi iso i nɖebi anɔmi ame ne, iyɔ nɖebi to miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24" />" 'Ala nto loaɖi mi lobɔrɛgu i nɖebi ame. Nto loasa mi kanya lobɔrɛgu i nrɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ame, lokpesera mi lobɔ i mi mɔmɔ karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25" />Nto loawɛwɛ̃ ndu mɛ lokpa lofere i mi iso fiɛ miakpa. Loto loasekelera mi lobɔrɛgu i mi ara wa loikpa ame gu i mi arapɔa ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="EZK 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26" />Nto loatã mi ɔtu ɣɛtɛ ne loapia siwarã ɣɛtɛ i mi ame. Nto loamɔɛ̃ ɔtu wɔ mba ɔle lɛ ita loɖi i mi ame fiɛ loatã mi ɔtu wɔ loɣɔ lɛ sina. <verse eid="EZK 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27" />Ne nto loasu wũ Siwarã lopia i mi ame fiɛ loakã mi misiai wũ asɛ̃ra fiɛ loatã miɣara so mimɔɛ̃ wũ mmara mila kukaakɔ. <verse eid="EZK 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28" />Mito miasɛ i karɔ̃ ga lotã mi mawa iso. Mito miaɖe wũ maturi fiɛ loaɖe mi Ɣaa. <verse eid="EZK 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29" />Nto loaɖi mi lobɔrɛgu i mi idaasekele ɔɖuɖu ame. Nto loatã ɔraɖui ɔlɛ fiɛ ɔto ɔ̃asi fiɛ loibabɔ kukãsiare i mi iso. <verse eid="EZK 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30" />Nto loatã adziri ɔɣɔ̃ abi asi gu ɔraɖui i nkpɛkɔ̃ ame ana, si miisibaɖe kunuarɛ i nɖebi ndɛ̃ ala kukãsiare iti. <verse eid="EZK 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31" />Iyɔ mito mianyigi mi aranyanyariã siri gu mi ɔtile arabarara ne mianyɔ so pupurii i mi akpi gu anyanya kubarara iti. <verse eid="EZK 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32" />Nto lobie sɔ miatsue sɔ loito lobara nnɛgbe i mi iti, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. Kunuarɛ sikukpɛ̃ mi si misopa ala mi nsɛgbai iti Israel kaɖe lo!<verse eid="EZK 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33" />" '<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Iyi nɛ loasekelera mi lobɔrɛgu i mi akpi ɔɖuɖu ame ne, Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nto loabara sɔ maturi si masɛ i mi simagɛ̃ ame fiɛ maaledza akpakpi itsue. <verse eid="EZK 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34" />Karɔ̃ ga lokpese ikpakpi ne, mato maakpɛ̃ kã iɖo sɔ kafere kere, i mma ɔɖuɖu nto maki kã ame mafe anɔmi ame. <verse eid="EZK 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35" />Mato maaɣɛ sɔ, "Karɔ̃ ga manina ɔɔkpese lɛ Eden kawĩ. Simagɛ̃siare dzɛ loɖe akpakpi fiɛ mawɔra sɛ̃ kuwɛ̃ na i kame, ɔɔyigu maturi fiɛ kiniɔ ne maɔtsue abere mapia sɛ̃." <verse eid="EZK 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36" />Iyɔ nɖebi mɛ lokuti miki milɔ mi ma lokuti to maatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔtara nnɛ mawɔra fiɛ loɔɣedza nnɛ loɖe ikpakpi. Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika fiɛ nto loabara ne.'<verse eid="EZK 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37" />"<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Loto loatã Israel kaɖe ɔkarɛ me ira ana fiɛ loabara nnɛgbe lotã ma: Nto loatã ma maturi ɔɣe masia lɛ masɛrɛ awe, <verse eid="EZK 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38" />mato maasi lɛ masɛrɛ ma masɛ masu mabɔ lɛ asɔrɛ i Yerusalem ku ayiɖea wa masɛ iso. Ngbɔ ame i simagɛ̃siare dzɛ manina to siayigu maturi kposu ne. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>."<verse eid="EZK 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37" />
  <para style="s1">Akui Korea Kagbolomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɔ̃ ɔsia me iso, ne ɔkɔ me ɔbɔrɛgu ku <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Siwarã ne ɔsɛra me i kagbolomi ndɛndɛ̃ ne. Kagbolomi ɔyigu akui. <verse eid="EZK 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2" />Ɔkɔ me ɔsɛgu ɔkpesegu i wã ndɛ̃, ne lonya akui gbodzoo i kagbolomi karɔ̃, akui wa lobua akore. <verse eid="EZK 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3" />Ɔkarɛ me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, akui wagbe aawo ngbã ɔwe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 37:3">Loɣɛ sɔ, "O <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso fɔ ɔnɔwɛ̃ pɛ nɣe."<verse eid="EZK 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4" />Kere ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɖikanya tã akui wagbe si aɣere wã sɔ: 'Minɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me, akui korea! <verse eid="EZK 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣere akui wagbe sɔ: Loatã siwarã ɔbo i mi ame fiɛ miaba ngbã. <verse eid="EZK 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6" />Nto loatã sitɔbɛ ɔmatã mi iso fiɛ loatã siturina ɔfu i mi iso ku ɔko. Nto loapia siwarã i mi ame, ne miaba ngbã. Iyɔ ne mito miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.' "<verse eid="EZK 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7" />Ne ɔso loɖikanya lɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me. Ne ngbɔ ame nto loɖikanya ne, akui ipɛpɛguso silɔ ɔre ne akui ɔsakanya, ikui i ikui iso. <verse eid="EZK 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8" />Lonyɔ, ne sitɔbɛ gu sosina ɔte so i akui iso, ne sosina ɔko ɔfu i wã iso ɣɛɛ siwarã iiwe i wã ame.<verse eid="EZK 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9" />Kere ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɖikanya tã siwarã, ɖikanya ɔturi awune ɔbi, si aɣere sɛ̃ sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: O siwarã, bɔrɛ i siwiri ina ame ba. Warã pia i mma maɖue ame, si maawe ngbã.' " <verse eid="EZK 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10" />Ne ɔso loɖikanya lɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me, ne siwarã ɔbo i ma ame. Maba ngbã ne maya i ma ngba iso - makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri siare loya.<verse eid="EZK 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11" />Kere ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, akui wagbe nɖe Israel iyo ɔɖuɖu ne. Masɛ maɣɛ sɔ, 'Bo akui ɔɔkore fiɛ bo ɔriinyɔ ɔɔyu, maɔtu bo maɖi.' <verse eid="EZK 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12" />Ne ɔso ɖikanya si aɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: O wũ maturi, nto loba loabusi mi akpibiɔ fiɛ loaɖi mi lobɔrɛgu i wã ame. Loto loakpesera mi lobɔ i Israel karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13" />Iyɔ mi, wũ maturi to miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, si lobusi mi akpibiɔ fiɛ lotara mi lobɔrɛgu i wã ame. <verse eid="EZK 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14" />Nto loasu wũ siwarã lopia i mi ame fiɛ miawe ngbã ne nto loasɛra mi i mi mɔmɔ karɔ̃ iso. Iyɔ mito miatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖeika, fiɛ loɔbara i ne iso, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɣɛ ne.' "<verse eid="EZK 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Gu Israel Ɔɖe Sigarakaɖekɔ̃ Siwɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, su kakolosɛi si atsɛrɛ asia i kã iso sɔ, 'Iɖe Yuda gu Israel mabi ma mpiagu wũ ɔkpɛ.' Iyɔ si asu kakolosɛi mama, si atsɛrɛ asia i kã iso sɔ, 'Iɖe Efrayim ɔdziri, iɖe Yosef gu Israel iyo ma mpiagu wũ ɔkpɛ.' <verse eid="EZK 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17" />Sa kukolosɛi kanya si ibara ɔdziri ɔwɛ̃ sɔ maaɖe iwɛ̃ i fɔ kɔrɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18" />"Si fɔ kaɖemabi ɔkarɛ-ɔ sɔ, 'Aito aɣere bo nnɛgbe karɔ̃ ɣɛɛ?' <verse eid="EZK 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19" />Ɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Nto loba loasu Yosef kakolosɛi - nga mpia i Efrayim kɔrɔ̃ ame - gu Israel mabi kumele gɔ mpiagu wũ, losu losakanya gu Yuda kakolosɛi, lobara kɔ̃ kakolo ɔdziri ɔwɛ̃, ne mato maakpese mawɛ̃ i wũ kɔrɔ̃ ame.' <verse eid="EZK 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20" />Mɔɛ̃ kudzirii gɔ iso ɔɔtsɛrɛ ara asia la i ma anɔmi ame <verse eid="EZK 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:21" />si aɣere ma sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Nto loaɖi Israel mabi lobɔrɛgu i ngbegɔ makɛlɛ. Nto losa ma kanya lobɔrɛgu i ngbegɔ masame mapia fiɛ loakɔ ma lokpesegu ma lobɔ i ma mɔmɔ karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22" />Nto loabara ma kaɖe kawɛ̃ i karɔ̃ ame, i Israel abe iso. Igara ɔwɛ̃ to ɔ̃aɖe ma ɔɖuɖu iso fiɛ maisibaɖe nɖebi minyɔ kuiyikuiyi ana ɣee maisibaɣɛ ma mapia i sigarakuɖekɔ̃ kunyɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23" />Maisibapukutura so ku ma arapɔa gu kumiamia nyanyariã ɣee ku ma aɣɛrɛ, alasɔ nto loaɖi ma lobɔrɛgu i ma kamaisɛ i wũ iso akpi ame, ne nto loasekelera ma. Mato maaɖe wũ maturi fiɛ Mme nto loaɖe ma Ɣaa.<verse eid="EZK 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24" />" 'Wũ ɔɖabo David to ɔ̃aɖe igara i ma iso, ne ma ɔɖuɖu aawe nyɔisose ɔwɛ̃. Mato maasiai wũ mmara fiɛ maamɔɛ̃ wũ asɛ̃ra mala kukaakɔ. <verse eid="EZK 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25" />Mato maasɛ i karɔ̃ ga losu lotã wũ ɔɖabo Yakob ame, karɔ̃ ga iso mi mawa ɔsɛ. Ma gu ma mabi gu ma mawa to maasɛ i mmɔ ɔwi daaro fiɛ wũ ɔɖabo David to ɔ̃aɖe ma igara ɔwi daaro. <verse eid="EZK 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26" />Nto loabara isobuɛ ndamu ku ma. Ito iaɖe ndamu mɛ loase ɖaa. Nto loasɛra ma fiɛ loatã maɣe masia i kukame ame, ne loasu wũ isɔrɛyo lopia i mi ndɛ̃ ɔwi daaro. <verse eid="EZK 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27" />Wũ kawekɔ̃ aawegu ma. Loto loaɖe ma Ɣaa fiɛ maaɖe wũ maturi. <verse eid="EZK 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28" />Iyɔ i nɖebi to miatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> lobara Israel sekelee, si wũ isɔrɛyo ka ipia i ma ndɛ̃ ɔwi daaro.' "<verse eid="EZK 37:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38" />
  <para style="s1">Kanyaiɖi Ita Iya i Gog Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> itɔ̃me ɔba me sɔ, <verse eid="EZK 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, su fɔ anɔ karã i Gog iso i Magog karɔ̃ iso, nwɔ nɖe ɔɖeisoi pelepele i Mesek gu Tubal. Ɖikanya ta ya i ɔ̃ iso <verse eid="EZK 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3" />si aɣɛ sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Gog, ɔɖeisoi pelepele i Mesek gu Tubal, lotsiri-ɔ lo. <verse eid="EZK 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4" />Nto loapɛ-ɔ lofirikira, lopia-ɔ kugodai i aregba. Nto lokpadzɛ̃-ɔ ku fɔ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu - fɔ apɔngɔ, fɔ pɔngɔmasɛdze ma lonyi so akpadza, gu maturi kposu ma nto akpirafɔra kosoi gu asiare fiɛ ma ɔɖuɖu to mapɛ ipɛmi. <verse eid="EZK 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5" />Persia, Kus gu Put piagu ma, ma ɔɖuɖu ɔtɔme abɔrakoto ne mato akpirafɔra. <verse eid="EZK 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6" />Ana ne Gomer ku ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze akuri ɔɖuɖu gu Bet Togarma ma lobɔrɛ dzoroo i katikpe ku ma makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu - nɖebi gbodzoo ɔbua i fɔ iso.<verse eid="EZK 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7" />" 'Miledza so, miwe i iledzaso ame, mi gu maturi kposu ɔɖuɖu ma mpia i fɔ kɔrɛ si aɖisilɔ atã ma. <verse eid="EZK 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8" />Ayi gbodzoo kama ne mato maakpere mi sɔ mita kakpã. I akɔ wa i katɔ̃ ame ne, ato aata abo i Israel karɔ̃ ame. Karɔ̃ ga loɔbɔrɛ i kakpã ame fiɛ maɔsa kã maturi kanya mabɔrɛgu i nɖebi ndɛ̃, mabɔ Israel abe iso ngbegɔ loɔɖe ikpakpi ifegu ifɔ ɔwi. Maɔɖi ma mabɔrɛgu nɖebi ndɛ̃ fiɛ kiniɔ ne ma ɔɖuɖu ka masi i kaɣɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9" />Mi gu fɔ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu gu nɖebi gbodzoo ma mpiagu-ɔ to miata, misɛ mikɛlɛ lɛ awɛ awe. Mito miase lɛ idɔdɔ nfu i karɔ̃ iso awe.<verse eid="EZK 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10" />" ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Iyi nɛmɔ ne adzuni to aaba-ɔ i iti ame ne ato aata ɔri nyanyariã. <verse eid="EZK 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11" />Ato aaɣɛ sɔ, "Nto loata lobo i karɔ̃ ga maitsue abere mapia kumagɛĩ ame. Loata lobo i maturi ma mpia i isobuɛ ame fiɛ mapia i ifɔiɖe nɛmɔ ame. - ma ɔɖuɖu si i kumagɛĩ ame gɔ abere na fiɛ kuyogodɔ̃ gu kɔ̃ isɛ̃sidziri na ame. <verse eid="EZK 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12" />Nto loamɔɛ̃ fiɛ loayu ma fiɛ loaɖi wũ kɔrɔ̃ losia i maturi ma akpakpi maledza isɛra gu maturi ma masakanya mabɔrɛgu i nɖebi ame fiɛ maba karana gu ayomabɔi gu ara fiɛ masi i karɔ̃ ndɛndɛ̃." <verse eid="EZK 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13" />Seba gu Dedan gu Tarsis kuɣamaɖese gu ɔ̃ kumagɛĩ ɔɖuɖu to maaɣere-ɔ sɔ, "Ɔba ɔɔba sɔ aamɔɛ̃ ara? Ɔsa ɔɔsa fɔ makpakpɛ̃dze kanya si miyu ara, misore sikãrɛtɛa gu sikãfudza si misu ayomabɔi gu ara si mimɔɛ̃ ara gbodzoo ku ɔɣiɛ?" '<verse eid="EZK 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14" />"Ne ɔso, ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya si aɣere Gog sɔ, ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ nsiguso sɔ: Ato aasɛ ne ikpo si iyi nɛmɔ ne, wũ maturi Israel ka masi i kaɣɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15" />Ato aabɔrɛ i fɔ kasɛkɔ̃ dzoroo i katikpe, mi gu nɖebi gbodzoo ma mpiagu-ɔ, ma ɔɖuɖu si i apɔngɔ iso maɖe maturi kposu, makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri siare miba. <verse eid="EZK 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16" />Ato aata akɛlɛ wũ maturi Israel iso lɛ idɔdɔ nɛ nsɛ ifu i karɔ̃ iso. Ayi wa nto aba ame, Gog nto loakpadzɛ̃-ɔ lobɔ ata aya i wũ karɔ̃ iso lo. Nto loabara ngbɔ, si nɖebi si mitsue me si lote so sekelee iki i fɔ iso i ma anɔmi ame.<verse eid="EZK 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ sɔ: Iiɖe fɔ iso loɖeika losegu ku kokowi iki i wũ maɖabo Israel kanyamaɖidze iso ɣɛɛ? Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne maɖikanya akɔ gbodzoo masɛ sɔ nto lokpadzɛ̃-ɔ lobɔ i ma iso.<verse eid="EZK 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa To Ɔ̃akpadzɛ̃ Gog Kutsue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18" />Nnɛgbe nto iaba ku iyi nɛmɔ ne: Si Gog ɔta ɔbo i Israel karɔ̃ ame ne, wũ sikpã dzɛ mba ɔtɔ to siasakɛ, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19" />I wũ sirerɛ gu sikpã dzɛ nsɛ sitsue lɛ ɔtɔ ame ne, loɣɛ ku ɔwi wɔmɔ ame sɔ Israel karɔ̃ to kaati teteree. <verse eid="EZK 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20" />Ɔpo ame afara, ɔwiri ame kurodzai gu kuputubɔi, irabiara nɛ nsɛ isɛ i karɔ̃ iso gu maturi ɔɖuɖu ma i karɔ̃ iso, to maati makpakpa i wũ anɔ. Abe to aakɔlɛ afu, kuwɛla to kuakarĩ fiɛ ibere biara to iarɔ̃ ifere i karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Nto loakpere ipɛmi lopia Gog i wũ abe ɔɖuɖu iso. Ɔturi biara to ɔ̃ata ɔya i ɔ̃ ɔnyii iso ku ipɛmi. <verse eid="EZK 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22" />Loto loakpadzɛ̃ wũ kutsue ku kukpakpi gu imaiferekarɔ̃. Nto loatã kado ɔpɛ, atumagirĩ gu kuɖu gɔ nto kutsue i ɔ̃ iso gu i ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze iso gu i nɖebi gbodzoo mɛ mpiagu wũ iso. <verse eid="EZK 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23" />Ne ɔso nto loɖi wũ sisiare gu isekele lote fiɛ wũ mɔmɔ loaɖi so lote i nɖebi gbodzoo anɔmi ame. Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.'<verse eid="EZK 38:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39" />
  <para style="s1">Maɖe Gog Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɖikanya i Gog iso si aɣɛ sɔ: Gog lotsiri-ɔ lo, fɔ wɔ nɖe ɔɖeisoi pelepele i Mesek gu Tubal. <verse eid="EZK 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2" />Loto loapɛ-ɔ lofirikira fiɛ loakpadzɛ̃-ɔ lokɛlɛgu. Loto loakɔ-ɔ lobɔrɛgu i katikpe dzoroo fiɛ nto loasese-ɔ ata aya i Israel abe iso. <verse eid="EZK 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3" />Iyɔ nto lowuĩ fɔ kuta loɖi i fɔ kubena kɔrɔ̃ ame fiɛ loatã fɔ mirɛ̃ i fɔ kuɖearɔ̃ ame ɔkpase. <verse eid="EZK 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4" />Ato aarɔ̃ i Israel abe iso, mi gu fɔ makpakpɛ̃dze gu nɖebi ɔɖuɖu mɛ mpiagu-ɔ. Loto loasu-ɔ lotã kurodzai agbãagbã ɔɖuɖu gɔ lokɛkɛ ara gu lotã kuputubɔi lɛ araɖea. <verse eid="EZK 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5" />Mito miarɔ̃ mirɛ i karɔ̃ kpawee iso alasɔ loɔɖeika, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6" />Nto loasese ɔtɔ i Magog gu i mma nsi i kaɣɔ ame i sipokpokpo. Ne mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7" />" 'Loto loatã matsue wũ iyere sekelea i wũ maturi Israel ndɛ̃. Loisibatã mapukutura wũ iyere sekelea. Ne nɖebi to maatsue sɔ Mme <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Mme nɖe Ɔsekelea i Israel ne. <verse eid="EZK 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8" />Ito iba! Gbaã ne ito iaba i ne ame, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. Nnɛgbe nɖe iyi nɛ iso loɔɖeika losegu ne.<verse eid="EZK 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9" />" 'Iyɔ mma nsi i Israel simagɛ̃ ame to maabɔrɛ fiɛ maasu ma akpakpɛ̃ra mapia i ɔtɔ matsuedza - akpirafɔra kosoi gu asiare, kuta gu mirɛ̃, kakpã akpo gu afele. Mato maasu wã mapia ala ɔtɔ itã akɔ akɔdzɛ. <verse eid="EZK 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10" />Iisibanya sɔ maabie ndɔrɛ̃ mabɔrɛgu i karɔ̃ iso ɣee matu ndɔrɛ̃ mabɔrɛgu i apo ame, alasɔ mato maasu akpakpɛ̃ra lɛ nnɛ maapia i ɔtɔ. Ne mato maamɔɛ̃ kakpãramɔɛã mabɔrɛgu i mma lomɔɛ̃ ma are mafegu, ne mato maayu mma loyu ma mafegu, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gog Ibiara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11" />" 'Iyi nɛmɔ iso ne, nto lotã kakɔi mabiara Gog i Israel, marisɛi kagbolomi ame i ɔpo kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. Ito iatɛ̃ marisɛi ɔri, alasɔ mato maabiara Gog gu ɔ̃ maturi kposu ɔɖuɖu i mmɔ. Ne ɔso mato maakpere mmɔ sɔ Xamon Gog Kagbolomi.<verse eid="EZK 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12" />"Israel kaɖe to maala maɔbiara ma itã awa akɔdzɛ si maasekelera karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13" />Maturi ɔɖuɖu ma i karɔ̃ iso to maabiara ma, ne iyi nɛ loaɖi wũ ikpawaĩ lote ne, ito iaɖe iyi nɛ maibaɣara itã ma, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14" />" 'Mato matã maturi karabara ɔwi ku ɔwi sɔ masekelera karɔ̃. Mawɛ̃ to maaki i karɔ̃ ame, isu ibua i ma iso ne, mawɛ̃ to maabiara makpise ma lokuti i karɔ̃. Awa akɔdzɛ kawirikɔ̃ ne mato masɛ makpise inyɔnyɔ karɔ̃ ana. <verse eid="EZK 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15" />Kumɛgɔ ame masɛ mato makiki i karɔ̃ iso fiɛ ɔturi ɔrere ɔnya ɔturi ikui ne, ɔto ɔ̃aɣedza ikparĩ i ne kuruɛ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ makurise aaba maasu ne mabiara i Xamon Gog Kagbolomi ame. <verse eid="EZK 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16" />(Ana ne ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ marɔ sɔ Xamona ana pia i mmɔ.) Ne ɔso mato maasekelera karɔ̃.'<verse eid="EZK 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Kpere karodzai igbã biara gu kuputubɔi ɔɖuɖu: 'Mibɔrɛ i ngɔi pelepele miba miasakanya si misɔrɛ ara wa nto loledza losɛ mi, isɔrɛ siare i Israel abe iso. Mmɔ mito miawe sina fiɛ mianɛ ima. <verse eid="EZK 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18" />Mito miawe makpãrɛrɛĩ sina fiɛ mianɛ karɔ̃ iso maɖeisoi ima lɛ akpalasa gu sɛrɛrerɔ̃ abi, kutepuĩ gu manantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ maɖe awe - ma ɔɖuɖu ɖe Basan mabɔi ma mbaso ku iɖa. <verse eid="EZK 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19" />I isɔrɛ nɛ nto lobara lotã mi ame ne, mito miaɖe iɖa gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ifã mi fiɛ mito mianɛ ima gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miarɛ̃ lɛ ndã. <verse eid="EZK 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20" />I wũ ɔpɔrɔ̃ katukɔ̃ ne mito miaɖe ara i apɔngɔ gu wã masɛdze, makpãrɛrɛĩ gu makpakpɛ̃dze igbã biara iso mimi,' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maledza Israel Isɛra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21" />"Nto loaɖi wũ ikpawaĩ lote i nɖebi ndɛ̃, iyɔ nɖebi ɔɖuɖu to maanya kutsueikpadzɛ̃ gu kɔrɔ̃ gɔ loasia i ma iso. <verse eid="EZK 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22" />Ita i iyi nɛmɔ ito ikɛlɛ ne Israel kaɖe to kaatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ma Ɣaa. <verse eid="EZK 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23" />Ana ne nɖebi to maatsue sɔ Israel maturi ɔkɛlɛ kafɔrɔ̃ ame ala ma ikpi iti, alasɔ maiɖe ɔnukuare matã me. Ne ɔso lokɔla wũ anɔmi i ma kɔrɛ, ne losu ma lopia i ma matsirise nrɔɔ̃ ame. Ne Israel maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔrɔ̃ i ipɛmi kanya. <verse eid="EZK 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24" />Lobara ma i ma akpi gu idaasekele kanya ne lokɔla wũ anɔmi i ma kɔrɛ.<verse eid="EZK 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25" />"Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Kiniɔ ne ka loaɖi Yakob lobɔrɛgu i kafɔrɔ̃ ame. Lokpesera wũ lobɔ fiɛ loanyɔ Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu nnya. Loto loakpɛ̃ sirerɛ lotã wũ iyere sekelea. <verse eid="EZK 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26" />Israel maturi to maaɣara ma kunuarɛ gu ma ɔnukuare idaaɖe ɔɖuɖu, nwa mabara i wũ iso, si makpese masi i karɔ̃ iso i kaɣɔ ame fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iisibapia ma ifɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27" />Ɔwi wɔ loɔɖi ma lobɔrɛgu i nɖebi ame fiɛ loɔsa ma kanya lobɔrɛgu i ma matsirise nrɔ̃ ame, lokpesera ma lobɔ ne, nto loaɖi so lote sɔ nse sekelee iki i ma iso i nɖebi gbodzoo anɔmi ame. <verse eid="EZK 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28" />Iyɔ mato maatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ma Ɣaa, alasɔ atoasɔ losese ma i kafɔrɔ̃ ame i nɖebi ndɛ̃ ne, nto loasa ma kanya lobɔ i ma mɔmɔ karɔ̃ iso, loibakuti kuwɛ̃ losɛ i kama. <verse eid="EZK 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29" />Loisibakɔla wũ anɔ i ma iso, alasɔ nto loafere wũ Siwarã i Israel kaɖe iso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ."<verse eid="EZK 39:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40" />
  <para style="ms">KAƉIKATE GA LOƉI ISƆRƐYO NƐ LOABA IASE KATE</para>
  <para style="s1">Isɔrɛyo Ɣɛtɛ Kasɛkɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1" />I ikɔ sinyɔruva i bo kafɔrɔ̃ iwe ame ne, i ikɔ karɔ̃kasɛkɔ̃ ne, iyi weova i kuwa ame i ikɔ iweonaare i Yerusalem ɔmagɛ̃siare ikpase kama ne - iyi nɛmɔ tutuutu ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɔ̃ ɔsia me iso ne ɔkɔ me ɔkɛlɛgu i mmɔ. <verse eid="EZK 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2" />I Ɣaa kuɖikute ame ne ɔkɔ me ɔkɛlɛgu i Israel karɔ̃ ame, ne ɔɣedza me i kube kuwɛ̃ gɔ lokɔlɛ gbaã iso. Kɔ̃ kagbalɔ ibaba ne ayo awɛ̃ ɔwe gɔ inyɔ lɛ ɔmagɛ̃siare awe. <verse eid="EZK 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3" />Gɔ ɔkɔ me ɔkɛlɛgu i mmɔ ne, lonya ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ wɔ nto ɔfiɛ lɛ ayiwa awe. Ɔta ɔɣɛ i kabɔrɛnya ɔto ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa iwɛĩ gu ara isusudziri i kɔrɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4" />Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, nya ku fɔ anɔmi si ka anɔ ku fɔ atsue, si asɛ irabiara nɛ nto loba loate-ɔ ikpo. Ala ne ɔso maɔkɔ-ɔ mabɔ i ngbe ne. Ɣere Israel kaɖe irabiara nɛ asɛ anya."<verse eid="EZK 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuaruɛ Kasarɛkɔ̃ Ikɛlɛ Kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ Kayogodɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5" />Lonya ibere gɔ iki ilɔ isɔrɛyo kasɛkɔ̃ pelepele. Ara isusudziri wɔ i ɔrɛrɛ̃ kɔrɔ̃ ame ɔkarã meta itɛ gɔ ibiara ɔkarã meta kaku gu setimeta fainafaina. Ɔsusu ibere, ne itiri isusudziri meta itɛ fiɛ ikɔlɛ kumɛɔ ame.<verse eid="EZK 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6" />Kere ne ka ɔkɛlɛ kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃. Ɔsɛ ɔya kã asɛtiĩ iso ne ɔsusu kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya, iwodoro isusudziri ɔwɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7" />Madzuɛ̃se kuyoi gɔ i kuyogodɔ̃ ababa iso ɔkarã meta itɛ fiɛ kubɛ meta itɛ. Abere wa mpia i kuyoi ndɛ̃ ɔtiri meta inyɔ gu kaku. Ne kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya ga mpia i pato kɔrɛ to kanyɔ isɔrɛyo ɔbɛ meta itɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 40:8" />Ne ɔsusu kakikɔ̃ pato; <verse eid="EZK 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 40:9" />iwodoro meta ina ne ibere ɔtiri meta ɔwɛ̃. Ne kakikɔ̃ pato ɔnyɔ isɔrɛyo isɛ.<verse eid="EZK 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:10" />I kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ kayogodɔ̃ ame ne kuyoi kutɛ ɔwe i kasɛ biara iso. Kuyoi kutɛ̃ kususume ɔɖe iwɛ̃ fiɛ abere wa loɣɛ kuyoi ndɛ̃ i kasɛ biara iso ɔwe kususume kuwɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11" />Kere ne ka ɔsusu kakikɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya kubɛme, iɖe meta iru fiɛ ne kukarãme ɔɖe meta ikuɔ gu kaku. <verse eid="EZK 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12" />I kayoi biara katɔ̃ ne ibere nɛ lokɔlɛ meta kaku ɔwe, ne kuyoi ɔɖe meta itɛ i kubɛme gu meta itɛ i kukarãme ame. <verse eid="EZK 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13" />Kere ne ka ɔsusu kakikɔ̃ ita i kayoi kawɛ̃ kama lɛ ibere kato ikɛlɛ kayoi ga mpia i kanɔsɔ̃ ibere kato. Igu ɔɖe meta iweo-inyɔ gu kaku ita i kabusikɔ̃ kawɛ̃ ikɛlɛ nga i kanɔsɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14" />Ɔsusu kakikɔ̃ ibere nɛ nɣɛ i katɔ̃ ɔkidza i kakikɔ̃ kame - meta sitɛ. Ne isusume ɔkɛlɛ ta pato iso to inyɔ kasarɛkɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15" />Ita i kakikɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya ikɛlɛ pato kawirikɔ̃ tsɔra igu ɔɖe meta sinyɔ-iru. <verse eid="EZK 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16" />Kuyoi gu abere wa nɣɛ i kakikɔ̃ ame kubusikɔ̃ mɔmɔriã ɔki kulɔ, lɛ ise i pato, kubusikɔ̃ ɔki kulɔ to kunyɔ kame isɛ. Mata abɛrɛdziri masia i kame abere iso.<verse eid="EZK 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuaruɛ Kasarɛkɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17" />Kere ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkɔ me ɔbogu i kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ ame. Mmɔ lonya kuyoi kuwɛ̃ gu kanenekɔ̃ ga maɔbara maki malɔ kasarɛkɔ̃. Kuyoi sitɛ pia i kanenekɔ̃ iso ikɛlɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18" />Kanenekɔ̃ ɔmatã i kakikɔ̃ ababa ne kakarã lɛ kubɛ, ngbe loɖe karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃ kanenekɔ̃ ne. <verse eid="EZK 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19" />Kere ne ɔsusu igu ita i karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃ kakikɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kame kasarɛkɔ̃ inyamɔ. Iɖe meta siru i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ibaba isɛ ne kumɛɔ ame i katikpe isɛ ne.<verse eid="EZK 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katikpe Kayogodɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20" />Kere ne ɔsusu kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ katikpe isɛ kubɛme gu kukarãme, kayogodɔ gagbe to kakɛlɛ kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21" />Kã kuyoi ɔɖe kutɛ i ibaba biara iso - kɔ̃ ndɛ̃ abere wa nɣɛ gu ne pato ɔwe kususume kuwɛ̃ lɛ ngɔ i kakikɔ̃ ɖeakatɔ̃ ame. Iɖe meta iweo-inyɔ gu kaku i kukarãme fiɛ meta iweo-inyɔ gu kaku i kubɛme ame. <verse eid="EZK 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22" />Ne kubusikɔ̃, ne pato gu ne ikɛrɛ abɛrɛdziri ɔwe kususume lɛ kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ɔkpɛ. Asɛtiĩ akɔdzɛ pia ikɛlɛ ne iso gɔ ne pato pia i wã kanɔsɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23" />Kayogodɔ̃ ɔwe ikɛlɛ kame kasarɛkɔ̃ to inyɔ katikpe kayogodɔ̃, lɛ kumɛgɔ ame iwe i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ɔkpɛ. Ɔsusu kayogodɔ̃ kawɛ̃ ikɛlɛ nga i kanɔsɔ̃, iɖe meta siru.<verse eid="EZK 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kagbalɔ Kayogodɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24" />Ne ɔkɔ me ɔkɛlɛgu i kala isɛ ne lonya kayogodɔ̃ to kanyɔ kagbalɔ. Ne ɔsusu ne ndɛ̃ abere gu ne pato, ne lɛ amama awe ne mawe kususume kuwɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25" />Kakikɔ̃ gu kã pato ɔwe kubusikɔ̃ mɔmɔriã kuki kulɔ, lɛ amama kubusikɔ̃ awe. Ikarã meta sinyɔ-iru fiɛ ibɛ meta iweo-inyɔ gu kaku. <verse eid="EZK 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26" />Asɛtiĩ akɔdzɛ pia ikɛlɛ ne iso, ku ne pato i kɔ̃ kanɔsɔ̃. Mata abɛrɛdziri masia i ndɛ̃ abere ntɔ̃ iso, i ibaba biara iso. <verse eid="EZK 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27" />Kame kasarɛkɔ̃ ana ɔwe kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ kala, ne ɔsusu ita i kayogodɔ̃ gagbe iso ikɛlɛ kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ i kala ibaba, iɖe meta siru.<verse eid="EZK 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyogodɔ̃ Gɔ Lokɛlɛ Kame Kasarɛkɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28" />Kere ne ɔkɔ me ɔkigu i kagbalɔ kayogodɔ̃ ame ɔbɔ kame kasarɛkɔ̃. Ne ɔsusu kagbalɔ kayogodɔ̃, iwe kususume lɛ kumama. <verse eid="EZK 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29" />Ne kuyoi, ne abere wa nɣɛ gu ne pato ɔwe kususume lɛ amama. Kakikɔ̃ gu kã pato ɔwe kubusikɔ̃ kuki kulɔ. Ikarã meta sinyɔ-iru fiɛ ibɛ meta iweo-inyɔ gu kaku. <verse eid="EZK 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30" />(Kukikɔ̃ mapato ma mpia maki malɔ kame kasarɛkɔ̃ ɔkarã meta iweo-inyɔ gu kaku fiɛ mawodoro meta inyɔ gu kaku.) <verse eid="EZK 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31" />Ne pato to ɔnyɔ kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃. Mata abɛrɛdziri masu makɛrɛ ne ndɛ̃ abere, ne asɛtiĩ fainafaina ɔya akɛlɛ ne iso.<verse eid="EZK 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kame Ame Kasarɛkɔ̃: Kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ Kayogodɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32" />Kere ne ɔkɔ me ɔbɔ kame kasarɛkɔ̃ i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ibaba, ne ɔsusu kakikɔ̃. Iwe kususume lɛ amama. <verse eid="EZK 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33" />Ne kuyoi, kɔ̃ ndɛ̃ abere wa nɣɛ gu ne pato ɔwe kususume lɛ amama. Kakikɔ̃ gu kã pato ɔwe kubusikɔ̃ kuki kulɔ. Ikarã meta sinyɔ-iru fiɛ ibɛ meta iweo-inyɔ gu kaku. <verse eid="EZK 40:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34" />Ne pato ɔnyɔ kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃, mata abɛrɛdziri masu makɛrɛ ne ndɛ̃ abere wa nɣɛ i ababa anyɔ, ne asɛtiĩ fainafaina ɔya akɛlɛ ne iso.<verse eid="EZK 40:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kame Ame Kasarɛkɔ̃: Katikpe Kayogodɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35" />Kere ne ɔkɔ me ɔbɔ i katikpe kayogodɔ̃ kɔrɛ ne ɔsusu kã. Iwe kususume lɛ kumama awe, <verse eid="EZK 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36" />lɛ wã kuyoi ne, ne ndɛ̃ abere wa nɣɛ gu ne pato ɔwe kubusikɔ̃ kuki kulɔ. Ikarã meta sinyɔ-iru fiɛ ibɛ meta iweo-inyɔ gu kaku. <verse eid="EZK 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37" />Ne pato ɔnyɔ kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃, mata abɛrɛdziri masu makɛrɛ ne ndɛ̃ abere wa nɣɛ i ababa anyɔ, ne asɛtiĩ fainafaina ɔya akɛlɛ ne iso.<verse eid="EZK 40:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyoi Itã Asɔrɛ Ibara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38" />Kayoi ku kabɔrɛnya ɔwe i kame kukikɔ̃ pato biara kɔrɛ, ngbegɔ mafore sina itã araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 40:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39" />I pato kakikɔ̃ ne sipɔrɔ̃ inyɔ ɔse i ibaba biara iso, ndzɛ iso maɖue araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ, ikpi asɔrɛ gu iɣɛrɛkuso asɔrɛ mabɔi. <verse eid="EZK 40:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40" />Ibere nɛ i pato kakikɔ̃ kuruɛ i inyamɔ ne, imatã asɛtiĩ wa i kabɔrɛnya to ikɛlɛ katikpe kakikɔ̃ ne sipɔrɔ̃ inyɔ ɔwe, ne i asɛtiĩ ibaba mama iso ne sipɔrɔ̃ inyɔ ɔwe. <verse eid="EZK 40:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41" />Ne ɔso sipɔrɔ̃ ina ɔwe i kakikɔ̃ ibaba iwɛ̃ ne sipɔrɔ̃ ina ɔwe i ibaba mama iso - siɖe sipɔrɔ̃ fainafaina - dzɛ iso maɖue asɔrɛ mabɔi. <verse eid="EZK 40:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42" />Sipɔrɔ̃ ina dzɛ masu ata wa matu mabara ala itã araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ ɔwe, ɔbiara ɔkarã sentimeta sikɔdzɛ-iru fiɛ ɔbɛ kumɛɔ ame ne ɔkɔlɛ sentimeta siru. Masu arɔi itã araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu asɔrɛ mama iɖue masia i sɛ̃ iso. <verse eid="EZK 40:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43" />Ne masu kugodai kunyɔ masakanya gɔ lokarã setimeta fainafaina, masa i ibere iso maki malɔ. Sipɔrɔ̃ ɔse sitã asɔrɛ sina.<verse eid="EZK 40:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyoi Kutã Masɔrɛdze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44" />Kuyoi kunyɔ ɔwe i kame kasarɛkɔ̃, kawɛ̃ ɔwe i katikpe kayogodɔ̃ kuruɛ to inyɔ kagbalɔ, ne iwɛ̃ ɔwe i kagbalɔ kayogodɔ̃ kuruɛ ne to kanyɔ katikpe. <verse eid="EZK 40:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45" />Ɔɣere me sɔ, "Kayoi ga nto kanyɔ kagbalɔ nɖe masɔrɛdze ma nto manyɔ isɔrɛyo iso ɔkpɛ, <verse eid="EZK 40:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46" />ne kayoi ga nto kanyɔ katikpe ɖe masɔrɛdze ma nto manyɔ isɔrɛkasege iso ɔkpɛ. Mmagbe nɖe Zadok mabibirɛrɛĩ, ma nɖe ma Levise ma kere loabore mamatã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> masɔrɛ i ɔ̃ anɔ."<verse eid="EZK 40:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kame Ame Kasarɛkɔ̃ Gu Isɔrɛyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47" />Kere ne ɔsusu kasarɛkɔ̃: ikate i kukarame gu i kubɛme ame - ikarã meta siru fiɛ ibɛ meta siru. Ne isɔrɛkasege ɔwe i isɔrɛyo katɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 40:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48" />Ɔkɔ me ɔbɔ isɔrɛyo pato ame ne ɔsusu pato ndɛ̃ abere, abɛ meta inyɔ gu kaku i ababa anyɔ ɔɖuɖu. Kabɔrɛnya kubɛme ɔɖe meta ikɔdzɛ, ne ndɛ̃ abere wa nɣɛ ɔbɛ meta ɔwɛ̃ gu kaku i ababa anyɔ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 40:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49" />Pato ɔbɛ meta iweo, ne ɔkarã meta ikuɔ ita i katɔ̃ ikɛlɛ ne kama. Asɛtiĩ ɔya akɛlɛ ne iso, ne akpa ɔwe i ndɛ̃ abere i ibaba biara iso.<verse eid="EZK 40:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1" />Ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkɔ me ɔbogu i isɔrɛyo iyo mɔmɔ ame. Ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔsusu ndɛ̃ abere wa nɣɛ i kukui kabɔrɛnya ababa anyɔ. Wã ibiara kubɛme i ababa anyɔ ɔɖe meta itɛ, itɛ. <verse eid="EZK 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2" />Kabɔrɛnya ɔbɛ meta iru, ne abere wa nɣɛ ne ababa ɔtiri meta inyɔ gu kaku. Ɔsusu isɔrɛyo mɔmɔ ana, ikarã meta sinyɔ fiɛ ibɛ meta iweo.<verse eid="EZK 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3" />Kere ne ɔkɛlɛ kame iyo i isɔrɛyo ame ne ɔsusu ndɛ̃ abere wa nɣɛ i kabɔrɛnya, ibiara ɔbɛ meta ɔwɛ̃. Kabɔrɛnya ɔbɛ meta itɛ. Ne kabɔrɛnya abere wa nɣɛ i ne ibaba biara ɔtiri meta itɛ gu kaku. <verse eid="EZK 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4" />Ne ka ɔsusu isɔrɛyo kame ife isɔrɛyo mɔmɔ kawirikɔ̃, ne kukarãme ɔɖe meta iweo, ne kubɛme ɔɖe meta iweo. Ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ngbe nɖe Kasekelekɔ̃ Ame Kasekelekɔ̃."<verse eid="EZK 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayo Wa Matsue i Isɔrɛyo Abere Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5" />Kere ne ka ɔsusu isɔrɛyo ibere, itiri meta itɛ, isɔrɛyo kuyoi gɔ loki kulɔ ababa ibiara ɔbɛ meta inyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6" />Isɔrɛyo kuyoi gɔ i ababa ne awe i itsueisia atɛ ame, iwɛ̃ ɔsia imama kato, kuyoi sitɛ ɔwe i itsueisia biara ame. Matsue kuberei mamatã i isɔrɛyo ibere mɔmɔ iso maki malɔ ne, si iɖe ipuarã itã ababa kuyoi. Ise ngbɔ si ipuarã kuberei iibabo i isɔrɛyo ibere mɔmɔ ame. <verse eid="EZK 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7" />Ababa isɔrɛyo kuyoi itsueisia sɛ ibɛ ibua ita i itsueisia ɖeakatɔ̃ iso ikɛlɛ imama iso. Nwa matsue maki malɔ isɔrɛyo ne, matsue wã maya kato ku ne ngbegɔ isia, sɔ kuyoi ɔbɛ kubua ku ngbegɔ kusia gɔ ame ɔturi to ɔya ɔkɛlɛ kato. Asɛtiĩ ɔri ɔya ɔbɔrɛ i karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃ karɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kato karɔ̃ iki i ndɛndɛ̃ karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="EZK 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8" />Lonya sɔ isɔrɛyo ɔwe karɔ̃isɛ ipuarã nɛ makpagɛra maki malɔ iyo, ne iɖe ababa kuyoi ɔkaĩ, iɖe isusudziri kukarãme, meta itɛ. <verse eid="EZK 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 41:9" />Ababa kuaruɛ ibere ɔtiri meta inyɔ gu kaku. Ngbegɔ manyua masɛ i ababa isɔrɛyo kuyoi ndɛ̃ <verse eid="EZK 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 41:10" />gu masɔrɛdze kuyoi ɔbɛ meta iweo iki ilɔ isɔrɛyo ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:11" />Kubɔrɛnya ɔwe i ababa kuyoi iso, ita i ngbegɔ manyua masɛ, kawɛ̃ ɔwe i katikpe fiɛ kamama ɔwe i kagbalɔ. Ne karɔ̃isɛ ga makpagɛra isagu ngbegɔ manyua masɛ ɔbɛ meta inyɔ gu kaku iki ilɔ isɔrɛyo.<verse eid="EZK 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyo Nɛ i Kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12" />Iyo nɛ nto inyɔ isɔrɛyo kasarɛkɔ̃ i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ ibaba ɔbɛ meta sitɛ-iru. Iyo nɛmɔ ibere ɔtiri meta inyɔ gu kaku fiɛ ne kukarãme ɔɖe meta sina-iru iki ilɔ.<verse eid="EZK 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13" />Kere ne ɔsusu isɔrɛyo, ikarã meta siru, ne isɔrɛyo kasarɛkɔ̃ gu iyo ku ne abere ana ɔkarã meta siru. <verse eid="EZK 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14" />Isɔrɛyo kasarɛkɔ̃ ga i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isu ibua i isɔrɛyo katɔ̃ ɔbɛ meta siru.<verse eid="EZK 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15" />Kere ne ɔsusu iyo nɛ nto inyɔ kasarɛkɔ̃ i isɔrɛyo kama, isu ibua ne abodɛ̃ i ababa anyɔ iso, ikarã meta siru.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 41:15">Isɔrɛyo mɔmɔ, kame iyo gu pato wɔ nto ɔnyɔ kasarɛkɔ̃ <verse eid="EZK 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:16" />gu kubokɔ̃ gu mafesere mɔmɔriã gu wã atɛ aki alɔ ne,- irabiara nɛ lofe gu ibua i kabokɔ̃ ne mafu kukolo iso. Karɔ̃isɛ, ibere ibo mafesere gu mafesere ne mafu wã ara. <verse eid="EZK 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17" />I kabɔrɛnya igbado nɛ i inyamɔ kato, ikɛlɛ kame isɔrɛyo gu abere wa i igu iwɛ̃ pia i wã ɔɖuɖu ndɛ̃ ɔki alɔ kame ame gu isɔrɛyo mɔmɔ. <verse eid="EZK 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:18" />Ne mata makerubi gu abɛrɛdziri masia iso. Abɛrɛdziri gu makerubi ɔnyuarã so. Kerubi biara ɔwe ntɔ̃ minyɔ: <verse eid="EZK 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19" />ɔturi awune katɔ̃ ɔnyɔ kubɛrɛ isɛ i ibaba iwɛ̃ ne dzata katɔ̃ ɔnyɔ kubɛrɛ isɛ i ibaba mama iso. Mata wã masia i isɔrɛyo ɔɖuɖu iso maki malɔ. <verse eid="EZK 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20" />Ita i karɔ̃isɛ ikɛlɛ ngbegɔ mpia i kabɔrɛnya kato ne, mata makerubi gu abɛrɛdziri masia i isɔrɛyo mɔmɔ ibere iso.<verse eid="EZK 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21" />Isɔrɛyo mɔmɔ ɔwe kukui faramdziri wɔ lowe ababa ana gɔ anyɔ ɔkarã aɖo amama, fiɛ nwɔ i Kasekelekɔ̃ Ame Kasekelekɔ̃ ɔse lɛ ɔɖeakatɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22" />Isɔrɛkasege ga masu kukolo mabara ɔwe gɔ kakɔlɛ meta ɔwɛ̃ gu kaku, kakarã meta ɔwɛ̃, ne kabɛ meta ɔwɛ̃. Masu kukolo mabara kã siɣokã, karɔ̃isɛ gu kã ababa. Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔɣere me sɔ, "Nya ɔpɔrɔ̃ wɔ masɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ ngbe ne." <verse eid="EZK 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23" />Isɔrɛyo mɔmɔ gu Kasekelekɔ̃ Ame Kasekelekɔ̃ ɔwe akui wa masɛ mabusi ababa anyɔ. <verse eid="EZK 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24" />Kukui biara ɔwe asɛ anyɔ - asɛ anyɔ wa mamɔɛ̃ ku ɔbɔi itã kukui biara. <verse eid="EZK 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25" />Ne mata makerubi gu abɛrɛdziri masia i isɔrɛyo mɔmɔ akui iso lɛ nwa mata masia i abere iso. Ne masu kakolo mabara gɔ isa i pato katɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26" />I pato ababa abere iso ne mafesere mɔmɔriã ɔwe gɔ mawe abɛrɛdziri masia ibaba biara iso. Isɔrɛyo ababa kuyoi ana ɔwe kukolo gɔ masa i kɔ̃ kato.<verse eid="EZK 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42" />
  <para style="s1">Ayo Wa i Isɔrɛyo Kɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1" />Ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkɔ me ɔkɛlɛgu kato isɛ ikɛlɛ kuaruɛ inyamɔ ne ɔkɔ me ɔbɔ i kuyoi gɔ mpia i isɔrɛyo kasarɛkɔ̃ kanɔsɔ̃ gu i kuaruɛ ibere i katikpe ibaba. <verse eid="EZK 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2" />Iyo nɛ kukui lonyɔ katikpe ɔkarã meta siru fiɛ ibɛ meta sinyɔ-iru. <verse eid="EZK 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3" />Wã anyɔ ɔɖuɖu ɔwe i kasɛ ga loɖe meta iweo ibɔrɛ i kame inyamɔ gu i kasɛ ga mpia i kuaruɛ inyamɔ kanenekɔ̃ kanɔsɔ̃ abere to anyɔ abere i kusiakɔ̃ kutɛ iso. <verse eid="EZK 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4" />I kuyoi katɔ̃ ne, kame ibodɛ̃ri wɔ lobɛ meta iru fiɛ ɔkarã meta siru ɔwe. Kuyoi akui to anyɔ katikpe. <verse eid="EZK 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5" />Kiniɔ ne kakpagɛkɔ̃ kuyoi ɔnyɔ mɔmɔrĩ koɖo, alasɔ abodɛ̃ siri ɔfɔ kasɛkɔ̃ i wã kɔrɛ iɖo iyo kuyoi gɔ i karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃ gu ndɛndɛ̃ kuyoi karɔ̃isɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:6" />Kuyoi gɔ i kasiakɔ̃ tɛare iiwe akpa, lɛ kusarɛkɔ̃ ɔwe. Ne ɔso kuse tɛmi i karɔ̃isɛ kumɔme kuɖo ngɔ i karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃ gu i ndɛndɛ̃ nrɔ̃isɛ. <verse eid="EZK 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7" />Kuaruɛ ibere ɔwe gɔ isɛ ikpa ku kuyoi gu kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃, ifere i kuyoi katɔ̃ itã meta sinyɔ-iru. <verse eid="EZK 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 42:8" />Gɔ i kuyoi gɔ i ɔkpɛ gɔ mpia kasɛ ga mmatã kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ ɔkarã meta sinyɔ-iru ne, ɔkpɛ wɔ mmatã i isɔrɛyo ɔɖo ɔkarã meta siru. <verse eid="EZK 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:9" />Kuyoi gɔ i karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃ ɔwe kabɔrɛnya i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ si ɔturi ɔbɔrɛ i kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ ɔsɛ ɔbo i kɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="EZK 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10" />I kagbalɔ ibaba gɔ isɛ to ikɛlɛ kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ ibere kukarãme isɛ ne, to isagu isɔrɛyo kasarɛkɔ̃ fiɛ ipia i kuaruɛ ibere kanɔsɔ̃ ne, kuyoi ɔwe <verse eid="EZK 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11" />ku ibodɛ̃ri i wã katɔ̃. Kuyoi gɔgbe ɔse lɛ gɔ i katikpe. Kuwe kukarãme gu kubɛme kuwɛ̃ gu kubɔrɛnya gu kususume gɔ lore so. Lɛ kumɛgɔ i kubɔrɛnya gɔ i katikpe ɔse ne <verse eid="EZK 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12" />kumɛɔ loɖe kuyoi gɔ i kagbalɔ kubɔrɛnya ne. Kukui ɔwe i abodɛ̃ri karɔ̃kasɛkɔ̃ wɔ nrɛ ɔkpa lɛ ne ibere nɛ nkpa kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ, nwɔ iso i ɔturi sɛ ɔsɛ ɔbo i kuyoi ame.<verse eid="EZK 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13" />Kere ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Katikpe gu kagbalɔ kuyoi gɔ nto kunyɔ isɔrɛyo kasarɛkɔ̃ nɖe masɔrɛdze kuyoi. Mmɔ i masɔrɛdze ma nsɛ masɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ to maaɖe asɔrɛ wa losekele aɖo. Mmɔ mato maasu asɔrɛ wa losekele aɖo masɛ - geɖebu asɔrɛ, ikpi asɔrɛ gu iɣɛrɛkuso asɔrɛ - ala kasɛkɔ̃ se sekelee ɔso. <verse eid="EZK 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14" />Si masɔrɛdze ɔɔna mabo i kasekelekɔ̃ ne, maisibakɛlɛ kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ maaɖi ma arapia wa masumu ala masɛ, alasɔ aɖe ara wagbe nse sekelee. Ikote sɔ maapia arapia mama fiɛ maakɛlɛ ngbegɔ nɖe maturi nsɛkɔ̃."<verse eid="EZK 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɔrɛyo Kasɛkɔ̃ Kususume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15" />Ɔwi wɔ i ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔ̃ɔro nnɛ mpia i isɔrɛyo kasɛkɔ̃ ɔsusu ne, ɔkɔ me ɔkigu ɔbɔrɛgu i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ kayogodɔ̃, ne ɔsusu isɔrɛyo kasɛkɔ̃ ɔki ɔlɔ: <verse eid="EZK 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16" />Ɔsusu kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ibaba ku isusudziri, iɖe meta alafa anyɔ gu siru. <verse eid="EZK 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 42:17" />Ɔsusu katikpe ibaba ku isusudziri, iɖe meta alafa anyɔ gu siru. <verse eid="EZK 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 42:18" />Ɔsusu kagbalɔ ibaba ku isusudziri, iɖe meta alafa anyɔ gu siru. <verse eid="EZK 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:19" />Kere ne ɔfiriki ɔkɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ ibaba, ne ɔsusu ku isusudziri, iɖe meta alafa anyɔ gu siru. <verse eid="EZK 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20" />Ne ɔso ɔsusu ababa ana ɔɖuɖu kasɛkɔ̃. Iwe ibere iki ilɔ ne, ikarã meta alafa anyɔ gu siru fiɛ ibɛ meta alafa anyɔ gu siru. Ibere loɖi isekelea ise ibɔrɛgu i nnɛ kere kɔrɛ.<verse eid="EZK 42:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43" />
  <para style="s1">Ikpawaĩ Ɔkpese Iba i Isɔrɛyo Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1" />Kere ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkɔ me ɔbɔ i kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2" />Ne lonya Israel Ɣaa ikpawaĩ ɔbɔrɛ i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ito iba. Ɔ̃ silɔ ɔse lɛ ndu mɛ ntere silɔ, ne karɔ̃ to kafiɛ ku ɔ̃ ikpawaĩ. <verse eid="EZK 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3" />Kaɖikate ga lonya ɔse lɛ kaɖikate ga loɔnya ku ɔwi wɔ ɔba ɔ̃ɔwɔra ɔmagɛ̃siare awe gu lɛ kuɖikute gɔ loɔnya i Kebar Ɔwore kɔrɛ. Ne lokɔlɛ anɔ lofu i karɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ ɔki i kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ɔbo i isɔrɛyo ame. <verse eid="EZK 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5" />Kere ne Siwarã ɔkɔlɛ me kato ne sikɔ me sibogu i kame kasarɛkɔ̃, ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ ɔyi i isɔrɛyo ame.<verse eid="EZK 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6" />Gɔ ame i ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɣɛ i wũ kɔrɛ ne, lonɔ ɔturi ɔwɛ̃ to ɔɖe me ika ɔbɔrɛgu i isɔrɛyo ame. <verse eid="EZK 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7" />Ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ngbe nɖe wũ sigaraiyara kasɛkɔ̃ gu wũ ngbatata kasiakɔ̃ ne. Ngbe nto loawe i Israel mabi ndɛ̃ ɔwi daaro. Israel kaɖe iisibapukutura wũ iyere kuiyikuiyi ana. Maturi mɔmɔ oo, ma magara oo iisibabara asɔrɔ̃ra ku ma arapɔa i magara kpia kuseme i ma kusɔrɛkɔ̃ mapukutura me. <verse eid="EZK 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8" />Gɔ masu ma arapɔa masɛ i wũ ire kanya, masu ma akuidziri masɛ i wũ ire kuruɛ, ne itã sɔ ibere kere loɣɛ bo gu ma ndɛ̃. Mapukutura wũ iyere sekelea ku ma anyanya kubarara. Ne ɔso lowɔra ma i wũ sikpã ame. <verse eid="EZK 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9" />Kiniɔ ne tã maɖi ma asɔrɔĩɖe gu ma arapɔa i magara kpia kuseme i wũ iso, si loawe i ma ndɛ̃ ɔwi daaro.<verse eid="EZK 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10" />"Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ɣere Israel maturi kumɛgɔ i isɔrɛyo se, si maakpɛ̃ kunuarɛ i ma akpi iti. Tã manyɔ ne ɔriita, <verse eid="EZK 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:11" />si kunuarɛ ɔkpɛ̃ ma ala ara ɔɖuɖu wa maɔbara iti ne, tã matsue isɔrɛyo ɔriita - gɔ masɛ ne ara, ne kubɔrɛkɔ̃ gu kubɔrɛnya - ne ɔriita ɔɖuɖu gu ne asɛra ɔɖuɖu gu mmara. Tsɛrɛ ara wagbe sɛ i ma anɔ, sɔ si maaɖe ɔnukuare i ne ɔriita ame fiɛ maasiai ne asɛra ɔɖuɖu.<verse eid="EZK 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12" />"Isɔrɛyo mmara i ngbe ne: Ngɔi ɔɖuɖu mɛ loki milɔ kasɛkɔ̃ ga i kube kato to iase sekelee iɖo gbaã. Kumɛɔ nɖe mmara i Isɔrɛyo iso ne.<verse eid="EZK 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɔrɛkasege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13" />"Nwagbe nɖe isɔrɛkasege kususume i meta kukarãme, meta kaku ɖe meta kaku. Ne iwo nɛ maɖi maki malɔ ne ɔwodoro meta kaku fiɛ ibɛ meta kaku, ku sitsueti kukikulɔ lɛ sentimeta sinyɔ-inyɔ. Nnɛgbe nɖe isɔrɛkasege kukɔlɛme: <verse eid="EZK 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14" />Ita i iwo i karɔ̃ iba kã karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃ ne, ikɔlɛ meta ɔwɛ̃ fiɛ ibɛ meta kaku. Ita ne katɛmikɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kamɔkɔ̃ ikɔlɛ meta inyɔ fiɛ ibɛ meta kaku. <verse eid="EZK 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 43:15" />Isɔrɛkasege ɔtɔkapiakɔ̃ ɔkɔlɛ meta inyɔ ne asa ana ɔbɔrɛ aɣɛ ikɛlɛ kato i ɔtɔkapiakɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:16" />Isɔrɛkasege ɔtɔkapiakɔ̃ ɔkate i kukarãme gu i kubɛme ame, ikarã meta ikuɔ ne ibɛ meta ikuɔ. <verse eid="EZK 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17" />Kakpagɛkɔ̃ isɛ ana ɔkate i kukarãme gu i kubɛme ame, kaɖe meta ikɔdzɛ i kukarãme fiɛ kabɛ ngbɔ ame, ku sitsueti giligilia sentimeta sinyɔ-iru gu iwo meta kaku ɔki ilɔ kã. Isɔrɛkasege asɛtiĩ si anyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ."<verse eid="EZK 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɔrɛkasege Isekelera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18" />Kere ne ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Nnɛgbe loaɖe asɛra itã araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu ima iwɛwɛ̃ i isɔrɛkasege iso si maɔtsue kã. <verse eid="EZK 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19" />Ato aasu nantsuĩ poroporoi atã masɔrɛdze, ma nɖe ma Levise, i Zadok iyomaturi ma nsɛ mabore mabo masumu i wũ anɔ, masɔrɛ ikpi isɔrɛ, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20" />Ikote sɔ aasu ne ima iwɛ̃ apie i isɔrɛkasege asa ana iso gu i kakpagɛkɔ̃ isɛ siɣokã ina gu sitsueti giligilia ɔɖuɖu iso si asu asekelera isɔrɛkasege si abara ikpikusoisɔrɛ atã kã. <verse eid="EZK 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21" />Ilɛ sɔ aasu nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ itã ikpi isɔrɛ atsuedza i isɔrɛyo kasɛkɔ̃ i kasekelekɔ̃ kuaruɛ i kakɔi ga masɛ matã ne.<verse eid="EZK 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22" />"Iyi nyɔare iso ne, su katikpɛĩ ga loyi abara ikpi isɔrɛ. Ikote sɔ maasekelera isɔrɛkasege lɛ kumɛgɔ masekelera kã ku nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ ima awe. <verse eid="EZK 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23" />Si ɔɔsekelera kã aro ne, ilɛ sɔ aasɔrɛ nantsuĩ poroporoi wɔ loyi gu si aɖi ikpalasa nɛ loyi abɔrɛgu i masɛrɛrerɔ̃ ikuri ame asɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:24" />Ilɛ sɔ aasɔrɛ ma i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ, ne masɔrɛdze aawɛwɛ̃ mma i ma iso fiɛ maasɔrɛ ma lɛ araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25" />" Iyi biara itã ayi akɔdzɛ ne, ilɛ sɔ ato aatã katikpɛĩ itã ikpi isɔrɛ. Ana ne ikote sɔ aatã nantsuĩ poroporoi wɔ loyi gu ikpalasa nɛ loyi abɔrɛgu i masɛrɛrerɔ̃ ikuri ame. <verse eid="EZK 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26" />Ayi akɔdzɛ ilɛ sɔ maabara ikpikusoisɔrɛ matã isɔrɛkasege, maasekelera kã iyɔ maɔɖi kã masɛ ise. <verse eid="EZK 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27" />Ayi wagbe kawirikɔ̃ ne, ita i iyi fainafainava iso ne, masɔrɛdze aabara araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu isobuɛ asɔrɛ i isɔrɛkasege iso. Iyɔ nto loafɔ mi lopia, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ."<verse eid="EZK 43:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44" />
  <para style="s1">Kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ Kayogodɔ̃ Iso Karabara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1" />Kere ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkɔ me ɔbɔ kama i isɔrɛyo kuaruɛ kayogodɔ̃, nga nto kanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ɣɛɛ masɛ̃ kã. <verse eid="EZK 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ikote sɔ kayogodɔ̃ gagbe ne maasɛ̃ kã masɛ. Iikote sɔ maabusi kã fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iibaaki i kã ame ɔbo i kame. Ikote sɔ maasɛ̃ kã alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Israel Ɣaa ɔɔki i kã ame ɔbo. <verse eid="EZK 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3" />Israel ɔɖeisoi mɔmɔ nɖe ɔturi wɔ pɛ loasɛ i kakikɔ̃ ɔɖe ara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ. Ɔ̃aki i pato kakikɔ̃ ame ɔbo i kame fiɛ mmɔ ame ɔ̃aki ɔbɔrɛ ne."<verse eid="EZK 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Mɛ Iso Maafɔ Ɔturi Ɔbo i Isɔrɛyo Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4" />Kere ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkɔ me ɔkigu kayogodɔ̃ ga i katikpe ame ɔbɔ i isɔrɛyo katɔ̃. Lonyɔ ne lonya <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ikpawaĩ to iyi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> isɔrɛyo ame, ne lokɔlɛ anɔ lofu i karɔ̃ ne.<verse eid="EZK 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, nyɔ totoroo, si akã irabiara nɛ loaɣere-ɔ ise i asɛra ɔɖuɖu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> isɔrɛyo iso atsue kukaakɔ. Si anyɔ asɛra i isɔrɛyo kubokɔ̃ gu ne kabɔrɛnya ɔɖuɖu iso kukaakɔ. <verse eid="EZK 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6" />Ɣere ɔtusele Israel kaɖe sɔ, 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: O Israel kaɖe ka ilɛ ku mi anyanya kubarara! <verse eid="EZK 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7" />Isu ibua i mi anyanya kubarara mama ɔɖuɖu iso ne, miɔkɔ mafɔ ma loitu sirɛrɛ̃ fiɛ masɛ̃ ifiriki mibogu i wũ isɔrɛyo ame - maturi ma nna ɔtu matã Ɣaa. I ɔri wɔgbe iso ne mipia wũ isɔrɛyo ɔgu atoa gɔ mito misɔrɛ aɖera, iɖa gu asɔrɛ ima mitã me, ne mitu wũ ndamu. <verse eid="EZK 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8" />Gɔ tee miabara karabara ise i wũ ara sekelea iso ne, i ne kanya misu wũ isɔrɛyo mipia i maturi mama nrɔɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="EZK 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9" />Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Ɔfɔ kuwɛ̃ wɔ loiwarɛ ara fiɛ ɔ̃itu sirɛrɛ̃ na ɔri ɔbo i wũ isɔrɛyo ame, nane mafɔ ma nsi i Israel mabi ndɛ̃ kɔraa na ɔri mabo i mmɔ.<verse eid="EZK 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɖi Ma Levise i Sisɔrɛdzeiɖe Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ, " 'Ma Levise ma lore me kama dzoroo ku ɔwi wɔ i Israel ɔyu ɔri fiɛ manyua me masɛ, masiai ma arapɔa ne, ikote sɔ ma Levise mamɔ aafɔ ma ikpi kuso. <verse eid="EZK 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11" />Maawo ɔsumu i wũ isɔrɛyo ame, manyɔ isɔrɛyo kuyogodɔ̃ iso fiɛ maasumu i ne ame. Maawo mabɔi ma mabɔ itã araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu asɔrɛ ɔɖue fiɛ maaya i maturi anɔ masumu ma. <verse eid="EZK 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso sɔ ala masumu arapɔa i maturi anɔ fiɛ matã Israel kaɖe ɔbo i ikpi ame, ne ɔso loɔkã ku kɔrɔ̃ i kato sɔ ikote sɔ maafɔ ma akpi kuso. <verse eid="EZK 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13" />Iikote sɔ maabore maba sɔ maasumu me lɛ masɔrɛdze ɣee maibabore mabo wũ ara sekelea ɣee wũ asɔrɛ wa losekele aɖo kɔrɛ. Ikote sɔ maawe i ma anyanya kubarara kunuarɛ ame. <verse eid="EZK 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14" />Ɣɛɛ losɛra ma i isɔrɛyo karabara gu karabara ɔɖuɖu ga maabara i ne ame kanya.<verse eid="EZK 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masɔrɛdze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15" />" 'Ɣɛɛ masɔrɛdze ne, mma nɖe ma Levise mabɔrɛ i Zadok ɔkparɛ ame fiɛ mabara wũ isɔrɛyo karabara ku ɔnukuare, ku ɔwi wɔ i Israel mabi ɔyu wũ ɔri ne, maabore maba maasumu i wũ anɔ. Maaya i wũ anɔ masɔrɛ iɖa gu ima matã me, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16" />Ma ɔnɔwɛ̃ loabo i wũ kasekelekɔ̃ ame, ma ɔnɔwɛ̃ loabore maba i wũ ɔpɔrɔ̃ kɔrɛ masumu i wũ anɔ mabara wũ karabara.<verse eid="EZK 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17" />" 'Si mabo kame kasarɛkɔ̃ kuyogodɔ̃ ame ne, ikote sɔ maapia ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa arapia. Maaibapia arapia wa masu bɔi siwɛrɛ̃ mabara ala kuawɛ̃ gɔ mato masumu i kame kasarɛkɔ̃ kuyogodɔ̃ ɣee i isɔrɛyo ame. <verse eid="EZK 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18" />Ikote sɔ maatɔme ɔkati ɖɔbɔrɔa itinyira i ati iso gu wã karɔ̃ arapia i ma sisɔ ame. Iikote sɔ maapia irere nɛ loatã makpɛ̃ awururu. <verse eid="EZK 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19" />Si mabɔrɛ makɛlɛ kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ ngbegɔ i maturi pia ne, ikote sɔ maaɖi arapia wa mapia gɔ mato masumu masɛ i kuyoi sekelea ame. Maapia arapia mama si maibasekelera maturi iki i ma arapia sekelea iti.<verse eid="EZK 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20" />" 'Iikote sɔ maakparɛ̃ ati ɣee maibatã ma siwɛrɛ̃ ɔkarã tagbaraa, ɣɛɛ ikote sɔ maasisi ma ati siwɛrɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21" />Sɔrɛdze kuwɛ̃ daanɛ wain si ɔsɛ ɔbo i kame kasarɛkɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22" />Masɔrɛdze iibayiri kpisere ɣee marɔ̃go ma masɛ̃. Maawo marɔ̃go kugbɔɔ ma siɖu lobɔrɛ i Israel kere ɔyiri ɣee masɔrɛdze makpisere. <verse eid="EZK 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23" />Masɔrɛdze ilɛ sɔ maate wũ maturi ara masegu isekele gu nnɛ mpia kere fiɛ maate ma kumɛgɔ mapia ikpaki i isekele gu idaasekele ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24" />" 'I kulu kurere gɔ loaba ne, masɔrɛdze si mabara karabara lɛ matɔ̃meɣɛdze si masia ne ita i wũ asɛra kanya. Maamɔɛ̃ wũ mmara gu wũ asɛ̃ra mala itã wũ ayiɖea ɔɖuɖu wa masɛ fiɛ maamɔɛ̃ wũ Awarãyi sekelea ana mala.<verse eid="EZK 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25" />" 'Sɔrɛdze ne iikote sɔ ɔ̃apukutura so iki gɔ ɔ̃abore ɔbo ɔturi wɔ lokpi. Ɣɛɛ si nwɔ lokpi ɖe ɔ̃ ɔse ɣee ɔ̃ ɔnyi ɣee ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɣee ɔbibirɔ̃gomi, ɔnyibirɛrɛĩ ɣee ɔnyiiko wɔ loiyiri kurã ne, iyɔ ne sɔrɛdze aawo ɔpukutura so. <verse eid="EZK 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26" />Si ɔ̃ɔsekelera so ɔro kama ne, ikote sɔ ɔto ɔ̃atuĩ ɔwe ayi akɔdzɛ. <verse eid="EZK 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27" />Iyi nɛ iso ɔ̃abo i isɔrɛyo kame kasarɛkɔ̃ si ɔsumu i mmɔ ne, ikote sɔ ɔ̃asɔrɛ ikpi isɔrɛ ɔtã so, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28" />" 'Mme, wũ ɔnɔwɛ̃saã loaɖe kaɖekɔ̃ ga i masɔrɛdze ba. Miibatã ma kaɖekɔ̃ kukawɛ̃ i Israel. Mme loaɖe ma ire. <verse eid="EZK 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29" />Mato maaɖe geɖebu asɔrɛ, ikpi asɔrɛ gu iɣɛrɛkuso asɔrɛ gu irabiara nɛ i Israel sɛ matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ku kuɖuɛ ne, ito iaɖe masɔrɛdze ire. <verse eid="EZK 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30" />Aɖedziribi ɖeakatɔ̃ wa nlɛ aɖo gu mi karatã igbaɔ to aaɖe masɔrɛdze ɔkpɛ. Miatã ma mi araɖea ɖeakatɔ̃ wa mikɔtɛ si kusɛkusɛ aasia i mi ayomaturi iso. <verse eid="EZK 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31" />Iikote sɔ masɔrɛdze aaɖe irere, nnɛ lokpi, rodza ɣee bɔi ɣee nwa i kaputubɔi ɔkɛkɛ kasɛ kuiwɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 44:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45" />
  <para style="s1">Bosate Ɔkpɛ i Karɔ̃ Iɣɛ Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1" />" 'Si miɣɛ karɔ̃ lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ ne, ilɛ sɔ miaɖi karɔ̃ kasɛ kawɛ̃ lɛ ibuiti sekelea mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Ito iakarã meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) fiɛ iabɛ meta kukpi kuweo (10,000). Karɔ̃ kakɔi gamɔ ɔɖuɖu aase sekelee. <verse eid="EZK 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2" />I kã ame ne, maaɖi kakɔi ga lokarã meta alafa anyɔ-siru (250) fiɛ ibɛ meta alafa anyɔ-siru (250) itã isɔrɛyo. Maanyua kakɔi ga loabɛ meta sinyɔ-iru maki malɔ ne masɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3" />I ibuiti sekelea ame ne maasusu kakɔi ga lokarã meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) fiɛ kabɛ meta kukpi kuru (5,000) maɖi i kã ame. Kã ame i isɔrɛyo aawe, itã Kasekelekɔ̃ Ame Kasekelekɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4" />Ito iaɖe karɔ̃ kakɔi sekelea itã masɔrɛdze, mma nsɛ masumu i isɔrɛyo ame fiɛ masɛ mabore mabo <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ maasumu i ɔ̃ anɔ. Ito iaɖe kasɛkɔ̃ itã ma ayo gu kakɔi sekelea itã isɔrɛyo ana. <verse eid="EZK 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5" />Kasɛkɔ̃ mama ga lokarã meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) fiɛ kabɛ meta kukpi kuru (5,000) to iaɖe ma Levise ma nsɛ masumu i isɔrɛyo ame kare. Iaɖe ma ire itã simagɛ̃ dzɛ ame maasɛ i kã iso.<verse eid="EZK 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6" />" 'Ikote sɔ maakpɛti karɔ̃ i karɔ̃ sekelea kuruɛ matã Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu, sɔ maaɖaɛ ɔmagɛ̃siare masia iso. Kasɛkɔ̃ gagbe si kabɛ meta kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (2,500) si kakarã meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500).<verse eid="EZK 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔɖeisoi Karɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7" />" ' Ɔɖeisoi to ɔ̃awe karɔ̃ ga nse kume ku kasɛ ga nɖe ibuiti sekelea gu ɔmagɛ̃siare karɔ̃. Kaarɛ kabɔrɛ i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ ibaba fiɛ kaarɛ kabɔrɛ i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ibaba. Kaarɛ i kukarãme kata i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ kafe kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ kume iso, kaarɛ kakɛlɛ lɛ kamele kawɛ̃ kare rɛ awe. <verse eid="EZK 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8" />Karɔ̃ gagbe to kaaɖe ɔ̃ kare i Israel. Iyɔ wũ maɖeisoi kuiwɛ̃ iisibayika wũ maturi ɔbɔkarɔ̃ ɣɛɛ ɔ̃atã Israel kaɖe sɔ mawe karɔ̃ i ma kumele kanya.<verse eid="EZK 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛra Itã Maɖeisoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Miɔbara miɣede ka ilɛ lo, Israel maɖeisoi! Minyua mi amumuɣɔ gu iyikaibɔkarɔ̃ si mibara nnɛ loya fiɛ ilɛ. Minyua wũ maturi ara ifɔ, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10" />Ikote sɔ miabara akerera wa loyi gu akora wɔ loyi iso karabara. <verse eid="EZK 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11" />Efa gu ikere i lita nɛ loyi aaɖe kumɔme kuwɛ̃, ikere i lita nɛ loyi ba Xomer<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xomer: Iɖe ira ikere lɛ galo 40 ɣee lita 182</char></note> ikaweova, Xomer si ɔɖe nnɛ iso maasusu ara itã aka anyɔ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12" />Sekel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sekel: Sekel ɔwɛ̃ ɖe gram 11.4</char></note> si ɔwe gera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gera: Gera ɔwɛ̃ ɖe gram 0.57</char></note> sinyɔ. Sekel sinyɔ ibua i sekel sinyɔ-iru ibua i sekel iweo-iru nɖe mina ɔwɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɔrɛ Gu Ayi Sekelea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13" />" ' Karatã igbaɔ ga miatã ngbe ne: Miaɖi efa aka akuɔ iwɛ̃ i kakpã xomer biara iso, kamɔ ana kumɛɔ ne. <verse eid="EZK 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14" />Nnɔĩ kusime gɔ masɛ, maasusu i bat kanya, iɖe kor biara ame ne bat aka aweo ame ne maaɖi ika iwɛ̃ (kor ɖe bat iweo ɣee xomer ɔwɛ̃, ala bat iweo ɔkategu xomer ɔwɛ̃). <verse eid="EZK 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15" />Ana ne maaɖi sɛrɛrerɔ̃ ɔwɛ̃ i alafa-anyɔ ikuri biara ame mabɔrɛgu i ngbegɔ sikuakaɖekɔ̃ sɛɛ ku ndu pia i Israel. Nwagbe maasu matã geɖebu asɔrɛ, araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu isobuɛ asɔrɛ ibara si mabara ikpikusoisɔrɛ matã maturi, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16" />Maturi ɔɖuɖu to maapia kɔrɔ̃ i karatã igbaɔ itã ɔɖeisoi gɔ ɔ̃azã i Israel. <verse eid="EZK 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17" />Ito iaɖe ɔɖeisoi karabara sɔ ɔ̃atã araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ, geɖebu asɔrɛ gu arainɛ asɔrɛ ku iyiɖea iso, Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ gu Awarãyi iso - ku i ayiɖea ɔɖuɖu wa masɛ itã Israel kaɖe. Ɔ̃to ɔatã ikpi asɔrɛ, geɖebu asɔrɛ, araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu isobuɛ asɔrɛ si mabara ikpikusoisɔrɛ matã Israel kaɖe.<verse eid="EZK 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayiɖea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: I iyi ɖeakatɔ̃ i kuwa ɖeakatɔ̃ ame ne aasu nantsuĩ poroporoi wɔ loyi asekelera isɔrɛyo. <verse eid="EZK 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19" />Sɔrɛdze to ɔ̃asu ikpi isɔrɛ bɔi ima kɛkɛĩ ɔpie isɔrɛyo akuisidziri iso, i isɔrɛkasege kakpagɛkɔ̃ siɣokã gu i kame kasarɛkɔ̃ kuyogodɔ̃ sidziri iso. <verse eid="EZK 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20" />Ikote sɔ aabara ngbɔ ku iyi kɔdzɛva iso i kuwa ame atã ɔrere wɔ lobara ikpi gɔ ɔ̃iɖo ɔbara ɣee i idaatsue ame, ne ɔso aabara ikpikusoisɔrɛ atã isɔrɛyo.<verse eid="EZK 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21" />" 'Iyi iweonaare i kuwa ɖeakatɔ̃ ame ne, miaɖe Kukpiɔtakuwarabo iyiɖea nɛ nsɛ ifɔ ayi akɔdzɛ, gɔ i wã ame ne miaɖe boɖoboɖo wɔ maipia inyagɛ̃kua. <verse eid="EZK 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22" />Iyi nɛmɔ iso ne ikote sɔ ɔɖeisoi aatã nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ itã ikpi isɔrɛ itã ɔ̃ mɔmɔ gu itã karɔ̃ iso maturi ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="EZK 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23" />Iyi biara i ayi akɔdzɛ Iyiɖea ame ne ɔto ɔ̃atã manantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ ikɔdzɛ gu akpalasa akɔdzɛ wã ɔɖuɖu ɔyi itã araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ itã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> gu katikpɛĩ itã ikpi isɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24" />Nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ biara iso ne ɔto ɔ̃atã geɖebu isɔrɛ efa ɔwɛ̃, efa ɔwɛ̃ itã ikpalasa biara, gu nnɔĩ lita ina itã efa biara.<verse eid="EZK 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25" />" 'I ayi akɔdzɛ i Iyiɖea ame ne, nnɛ losɛkarɔ̃ i kuwa kɔdzɛva iyi iweoruva iso ne, ɔto ɔ̃atã ikpi asɔrɛ, araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ, geɖebu asɔrɛ gu nnɔĩ lɛ ɔtã ɔfegu awe.<verse eid="EZK 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔɖeisoi Gu Ayiɖea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1" />" ' <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wɔ Nsiguso sɔ: Kame kasarɛkɔ̃ kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ne, ikote sɔ maasɛ̃ kã ku ayi akuɔ wa mato mabara karabara. Ɣɛɛ Iwarãyi gu Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ iyi ne, ikote sɔ maabusi kã. <verse eid="EZK 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2" />Ɔɖeisoi aabɔrɛ i inyamɔ ɔki i pato kakikɔ̃ ɔbo fiɛ ɔ̃aya i kayogodɔ̃ kukuidziri kɔrɛ. Masɔrɛdze to maasɔrɛ ɔ̃ araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ gu ɔ̃ isobuɛ asɔrɛ. Ikote sɔ ɔ̃asumu i kakikɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya iyɔ ɔ̃abɔrɛ ɣɛɛ maibasɛ̃ kayogodɔ̃ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ kutsuɛ. <verse eid="EZK 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3" />Awarãyi iso gu Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ ayi ne, maturi ma i karɔ̃ iso to maasumu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ i kakikɔ̃ gamɔ kabɔrɛnya. <verse eid="EZK 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4" />Ara wa i ɔɖeisoi aabɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ku iwarãyi iso itã araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ nɖe akpalasa kosoi akuɔ gu ikpalasa, wã ɔɖuɖu aayi. <verse eid="EZK 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5" />Geɖebu isɔrɛ nɛ maatã ku ikpalasa nɖe efa ɔwɛ̃ gu geɖebu ku akpalasa kosoi aaɖe kumɛgɔ kanya ɔɖuɛ ku nnɔĩ lita ina itã efa biara. <verse eid="EZK 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6" />Ɔgbaleti Ɣɛtɛ iyi iso ne ɔto ɔ̃asɔrɛ nantsuĩ poroporoi, sɛrɛrerɔ̃ abi akuɔ gu ikpalasa, wã ɔɖuɖu aayi. <verse eid="EZK 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7" />Ɔto ɔ̃atã geɖebu isɔrɛ efa ɔwɛ̃ ku nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃, efa ɔwɛ̃ ku ikpalasa ne ku sɛrɛrerɔ̃ abi ne kusime lɛ ɔbie ku nnɔĩ lita ina ku efa biara iso. <verse eid="EZK 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8" />Ikote sɔ si ɔɖeisoi aabo ne, ɔ̃aki i pato kakikɔ̃ fiɛ mmɔ ame ɔ̃aki ɔbɔrɛ ne.<verse eid="EZK 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9" />" 'Si maturi ma i karɔ̃ iso ɔba i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ ku ayiɖea wa masɛ ne, ɔrere wɔ loki i katikpe kayogodɔ̃ ame si ɔsumu ne, ikote sɔ ɔ̃aki i kagbalɔ kayogodɔ̃ ame ɔbɔrɛ fiɛ ɔrere wɔ loki i kagbalɔ kayogodɔ̃ ame ɔbo ne, ɔ̃aki i katikpe kayogodɔ̃ ɔbɔrɛ. Iikote sɔ kuwɛ̃ aaki i kayogodɔ̃ ga ame ɔbo iyo ame si ɔto ɔbɔrɛ. Ɣɛɛ ɔbiara aaki i nga ame ɔki ɔbo kanɔsɔ̃ kare ame ɔbɔrɛ. <verse eid="EZK 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10" />Si mato mabo ne, ɔɖeisoi aabogu ma fiɛ si mato mabɔrɛ ne, ɔ̃abɔrɛgu ma.<verse eid="EZK 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11" />" 'I ayiɖea iso gu i nwa masɛ ame ne, geɖebu isɔrɛ aaɖe efa ɔwɛ̃ ku nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃, efa ɔwɛ̃ ku ikpalasa ku sɛrɛrerɔ̃ abi ne kusime lɛ ɔbie kanya, ku nnɔĩ lita ina itã efa biara. <verse eid="EZK 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12" />Si ɔɖeisoi ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kuɖuɛ isɔrɛ ne - si araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ ɣee isobuɛ asɔrɛ ne - ikote sɔ maabusi kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kaanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ matã wũ. Ɔto ɔ̃asɔrɛ ɔ̃ araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ ɣee ɔ̃ isobuɛ asɔrɛ lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔsɛ ɔbara ku Iwarãyi awe. Iyɔ ɔto ɔ̃abɔrɛ, ne kama si ɔ̃ɔbɔrɛ ne, ka maasɛ̃ kayogodɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyi Biara Isɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13" />" ' Iyi biara ne ikote sɔ ato aatã ikɔ iwɛ̃ sɛrɛrerɔ̃ ibi nɛ loyi itã araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ itã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kaya biara ne aatã ne. <verse eid="EZK 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14" />Ana ne ato aatã ne ku geɖebu isɔrɛ ku kaya biara, iaɖe efa ikakuɔva ku nnɔĩ ikatɛare si maalupu ku ɔraũ si ɔɣɔ. Geɖebu isɔrɛ nɛgbe itã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɖe isɛra nɛ nse ɖaa. <verse eid="EZK 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15" />Ne ɔso maatã sɛrɛrerɔ̃ ibi gu geɖebu isɔrɛ gu nnɔĩ ku kaya biara itã ɔwi araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ ɖaa.<verse eid="EZK 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔɖeisoi Gu Karɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16" />" 'Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: Si ɔɖeisoi ɔtã ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔwɛ̃ karatã ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔ̃ kaɖekɔ̃ ame ne, ito iaɖe ɔ̃ ɔbi wɔmɔ ɔkparɛ ire. Ito iaɖe ma ɔkpɛ lɛ kaɖekɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17" />Ɣɛɛ si ɔɖeisoi ɔtã ɔ̃ ɔɖabo ɔwɛ̃ karatã ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔ̃ kaɖekɔ̃ ame ne, ɔɖabo to ɔ̃ala ne gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ikɔ nɛ ɔ̃afɔ isɛguso. Iyɔ iakpese iba i ɔɖeisoi kɔrɛ. Ɔɖeisoi kaɖekɔ̃ ɖe ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ kere ɔkpɛ, ma ire iɖe. <verse eid="EZK 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18" />Iikote sɔ ɔɖeisoi aasa maturi ɔɖi i ma ara ame ɔfɔ ma kaɖekɔ̃ karere kukawɛ̃. Ikote sɔ ɔ̃atã ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ ma kaɖekɔ̃ ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ara ame. Iyɔ ne maibaɖi wũ maturi kuwɛ̃ i ɔ̃ ara ame.' "<verse eid="EZK 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Madzaɖe Ma i Isɔrɛyo Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19" />Kere ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkɔ me ɔkigu i kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya ga nto kakɛlɛ kuyoi sekelea gɔ nto kunyɔ katikpe ame, ngɔ nɖe masɔrɛdze kure ne ɔte me kakɔi i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ kawirikɔ̃. <verse eid="EZK 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20" />Ɔɣere me sɔ, "Kakɔi ga i ngbe i masɔrɛdze madzaɖe, ngbegɔ maawa iɣɛrɛkuso isɔrɛ gu ikpi isɔrɛ. Ngbe ame maafɛ̃ geɖebu isɔrɛ ne, si maibasu wã makɛlɛgu i kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ fiɛ maturi iso aasekele."<verse eid="EZK 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21" />Kere ne ka ɔkɔ me ɔbɔ i kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ ne ɔkɔ me ɔkigu i siɣokã ina iso, ne lonya kasɔrɛkɔ̃ mama i ɔɣokã biara ame. <verse eid="EZK 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22" />I kuaruɛ kasarɛkɔ̃ siɣokã ina ame ne, matɛ̃ ɔkpã mapia kusarɛkɔ̃ ikarã meta sinyɔ fiɛ ibɛ meta iweo-iru awe. Kasarɛkɔ̃ biara i siɣokã ina ɔɖuɖu ame ɔmɔ sikate. <verse eid="EZK 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23" />Masu ata masɛ maki malɔ kasarɛkɔ̃ biara i kɔ̃ kuna ame, ne matsue ɔtɔ mpiakɔ̃ maki malɔ i ata kayirinɔ. <verse eid="EZK 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24" />Ɔɣere me sɔ, "Nwagbe nɖe madzaɖe ma ame i mma nsɛ masumu i isɔrɛyo ame aawa maturi asɔrɛ."<verse eid="EZK 46:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔwore Wɔ Nto Ɔbore Ɔbɔrɛ i Isɔrɛyo Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1" />Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkpesera me ɔbɔ i isɔrɛyo kabɔrɛnya, ne lonya ndu to mibore mibɔrɛ i isɔrɛyo kukui kayirinɔ, mikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ (ala isɔrɛyo to inyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ). Ndu to mibɔrɛ i isɔrɛyo kagbalɔ ibaba kayirinɔ, i isɔrɛkasege kagbalɔ. <verse eid="EZK 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2" />Kere ne ka ɔkɔ me ɔbɔrɛgu i katikpe kayogodɔ̃, ne ka ɔkɔ me ɔkikigu i kayogodɔ̃ ga nto kanyɔ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ inyamɔ, ne ndu to mibore mibɔrɛ i kagbalɔ ibaba.<verse eid="EZK 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3" />Gɔ i ɔrɛrɛ̃ to isusuwɛĩ i kɔrɔ̃ ame to ɔkɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ ne, ɔsusu lɛ meta alafa aru (500) ne ɔkɔ me ɔkigu ndu mɛ lowodoro ibo ikpakpokpo. <verse eid="EZK 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4" />Ɔsusu meta alafa aru ne ɔkɔ me ɔkigu i ndu mɛ lowodoro ibo igɛgɛ̃. Ne ka ɔsusu meta alafa aru mama ne ɔkɔ me ɔkigu i ndu ame ne iwodoro ibo ɔsɔ. <verse eid="EZK 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5" />Ɔsusu meta alafa aru mama ɣɛɛ kiniɔ ne iɖe ɔwore wɔ loibawo ɔwara, ala ndu ɔɔkɔlɛ fiɛ misi gɔ ka maaɣa - ɔwore wɔ kuwɛ̃ iibawo ɔwara. <verse eid="EZK 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6" />Ɔkarɛ me sɔ, "Ɔturi awune ɔbi, ato anya nnɛgbe?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 47:6">Ne ɔkɔ me ɔkpesegu ɔkɛlɛgu i ɔworekpokpo. <verse eid="EZK 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7" />Gɔ lobo i mmɔ ne, lonya adziri kusime gbodzoo i ɔwore kasɛ biara iso. <verse eid="EZK 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8" />Ɔɣere me sɔ, "Ndu mɛgbe to mibore mikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ibuiti ame ne misɛ miso mikɛlɛ Araba, ngbegɔ misɛ mibo i Ɔpo ame. Si mibo i ɔpo ame ne misɛ mitã ndu ɔse kukaakɔ. <verse eid="EZK 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9" />Ara wa mba ngbã akuri to aawe i kakɔi karere ga i ɔwore sɛ ɔbore ɔkɛlɛ. Afara kusime gbodzoo to kuawe, ala ndu mɛgbe sɛ mibore mikɛlɛ i mmɔ fiɛ misɛ mibara mma ndu mise kukaakɔ. Ne ɔso kakɔi biara ga i ɔwore sɛ ɔbore ɔkɛlɛ ne irabiara sɛ iwe ngbã. <verse eid="EZK 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10" />Akpɛmaɖidze to maaya i ɔkpokpo ikɛlɛ, ita i En Gedi ikɛlɛ En Eglayim. Ito iaɖe ngɔi mɛ mapia asabu. Afara agbãagbã to aawe - lɛ afara wa mpia i Mediterania Ɔpo ame. <verse eid="EZK 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11" />Ɣɛɛ karɔ̃isɛkɔ̃ ga nsɛ kafɔ ndu gu karɔ̃ ga mpia i ndu gu karɔ̃ ndɛ̃ iito mialɛ, mito miase mitã mma. <verse eid="EZK 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12" />Aɖedziri igbã biara to aaya i siworekpokpo inyɔ ɔɖuɖu. Wã ayata iibaɣɔ ɣee aibasɛ̃ abi iɣɔ̃. Ato aaɣɔ̃ abi ku kuwa biara, ala ndu mɛ lobɔrɛ i isɔrɛyo ame sɛ mibore mikɛlɛ wã kɔrɛ ɔso. Wã adziribi to aaɖe aɖera fiɛ wã ayata to aaɖe ira itã isosarɛ."<verse eid="EZK 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ame Wa i Karɔ̃ iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13" />Nnɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso to ɔɣɛ ne: "Nwagbe nɖe ame wa iso aaɣɛ karɔ̃ ga nɖe kaɖekɔ̃ atã Israel kumele kuweo-kunyɔ ne, ku kusɛ aka anyɔ itã Yosef. <verse eid="EZK 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:14" />Ikote sɔ aaɣɛ karɔ̃ tsɛtsɛɛtsɛ atã ma. Ala lokã ku wũ kɔrɔ̃ i kato sɔ loatã fɔ mawa karɔ̃, karɔ̃ gagbe aakpese mi kaɖekɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15" />"Nnɛgbe loakpese karɔ̃ kume ne:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 47:15" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZK 47:15">"I katikpe isɛ ne, kume aata kubɔrɛ i Mediterania Ɔpo iso i Xetlon ɔmagɛ̃siare ɔri kɔrɛ ife Lebo Xamat ikɛlɛ Zedad, <verse eid="EZK 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16" />Berota gu Sibarayim (wɔ nrɛ i Damasko gu Xamat ndɛ̃), ikɛlɛ ta Xazar Xatikon wɔ mpia i Xauran kume iso. <verse eid="EZK 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17" />Kume to kuakɛlɛ ita i ɔpo iso ikɛlɛ Xazar Enan, kusɛ i Damasko katikpe kume iso, ku Xamat kume i katikpe. Nnɛgbe loaɖe katikpe kume.<verse eid="EZK 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18" />"I kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ ne kume to kuasɛ i Damasko gu Xauran ndɛ̃, ikɛlɛ Yordan gu Gilead ndɛ̃ gu Israel karɔ̃, ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ɔpo gu ta Tamar.<verse eid="EZK 47:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19" />"I kagbalɔ isɛ ɔkpɛ ne kuasɛ kuta i Tamar kukɛlɛ ta Meriba Kades ndu iso, iyɔ kuasɛ i Egipte Kagbolomi ame ikɛlɛ Mediterania Ɔpo iso. Nnɛgbe loaɖe Kagbalɔ kume ne.<verse eid="EZK 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20" />"I kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ ne, Mediterania ɔpo aaɖe kume ikɛlɛ kakɔi ga mpia Lebo Xamat kanɔsɔ̃. Nnɛgbe loaɖe kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ kume ne.<verse eid="EZK 47:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21" />"Ikote sɔ miaɣɛ karɔ̃ gagbe mitã so i Israel kumele kanya. <verse eid="EZK 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22" />Ikote sɔ miatã kã lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ mitã mi mɔmɔ gu mafɔ ma loɔsɛ i mi ndɛ̃ fiɛ maba mabi. Ilɛ sɔ miafɔ ma mipia lɛ Israel mabi godɛã, ku mi ilɛ sɔ maatã ma kaɖekɔ̃ i Israel kumele ndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23" />Ku kamele karere ga ame i ɔfɔ sɛ ɔsɛ ne, mmɔ miatã wũ ɔ̃ kaɖekɔ̃ ne," <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso nto ɔɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 47:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48" />
  <para style="s1">Karɔ̃ Iɣɛ Itã Israel Kumele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1" />"Israel kumele i ayere kanya i ngbe ne: Dan kamele kasɛ to kaawe i karɔ̃ i katikpe isɛ kume iso, kume ɔsiai i Xetlon ɔri iso ikɛlɛ Lebo Xamat, Xazar Enan gu Damasko katikpe kume isiai i Xamat to iaɖe ne kume kasɛ ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ kasɛ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ kasɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2" />"Aser aana karɔ̃ kasɛ kawɛ̃; kaase kume ku Dan kamele kare ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3" />"Kasɛ kawɛ̃ aaɖe Naftali ɔkpɛ; ito iase kume ku Aser kamele kare ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4" />"Manase aawe kasɛ kawɛ̃. Ito iase kume ku Naftali kamele ibuiti ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5" />"Efrayim to ɔ̃awe karɔ̃ kasɛ kawɛ̃; kaase kume ku Manase kamele ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6" />"Ruben to ɔ̃awe karɔ̃ kasɛ kawɛ̃. Ito iase kume ku Efrayim kamele ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7" />"Yuda to ɔ̃awe karɔ̃ kasɛ kawɛ̃. Kato kaase kume ku Ruben kare ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɛ Igbaɔ i Karɔ̃ ndɛndɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8" />"Karɔ̃ ga nse kume ku Yuda ne, kaaɖe kasɛ ga maasu matã lɛ karatã igbaɔ. Ito iabɛ meta kukpi kuweo kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) fiɛ kã kukarãme ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ aakategu kamele kawɛ̃ ɔkpɛ. Isɔrɛyo to iawe i kã ndɛndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9" />"Karɔ̃ igbaɔ nɛ maasu matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> aakarã meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) kabɛ meta kukpi kuru (5000). <verse eid="EZK 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10" />Nnɛgbe loaɖe kasɛ sekelea katã masɔrɛdze. Kato kaakarã meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) i katikpe kasɛ fiɛ kaabɛ meta kukpi kuru (5000) i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ meta kukpi kuru (5000) i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ fiɛ ikarã meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) i kagbalɔ kasɛ. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> isɔrɛyo aawe i kã ndɛndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11" />Nnɛgbe to iaɖe masɔrɛdze ma masekelera, ma Zadokse, ma loɖe ɔnukuare masumu me fiɛ maisɛnɛkɛ̃ lɛ kumɛgɔ i ma Levise ɔbara ku ɔwi wɔ i Israel ɔyu ɔri. <verse eid="EZK 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12" />Ito iaɖe karatã igbaɔ ga maɖi ise mabɔrɛgu i karɔ̃ kasɛ sekelea ame itã ma, kasɛ ga losekele kaɖo, kase kume ku ma Levise ibuiti. <verse eid="EZK 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13" />"I kasɛ ga nɖe masɔrɛdze ibuiti ne, ma Levise to maafɔ kasɛ i ma kɔrɛ kaakarã meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) kabɛ meta kukpi kuru (5000). Kã kukarãme ɔɖuɖu aaɖe meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (12,500) fiɛ kã kubɛme to kuaɖe meta kukpi kuru (5000). <verse eid="EZK 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14" />Iikote sɔ maarɔdɛ̃ ɣee manyuarã kã kasɛ kukawɛ̃. Kã nɖe kasɛɛ kaɖo i karɔ̃ ame fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iibafirikira kã kabo i nrɔɔ̃ mama ame, alasɔ kase sekelee katã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>.<verse eid="EZK 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15" />"Kasɛ ga lokuti kakarã meta kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa-aru (2,500) fiɛ kabɛ meta kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa aru aaɖe ngbegɔ i ɔmagɛ̃siare abara ne iso karabara matsue ayo gu mabɔi sikuakaɖekɔ̃. Ɔmagɛ̃siare to ɔ̃awe i kã ndɛndɛ̃ <verse eid="EZK 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16" />fiɛ kaakarã meta kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru (2,250) i katikpe isɛ, kagbalɔ kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru (2,250) kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru (2,250) kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru (2,250). <verse eid="EZK 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17" />Ɔmagɛ̃siare mabɔi sikuakaɖekɔ̃ aabɛ meta kulafa kuwɛ̃ gu sinyɔ-iru i katikpe gu meta kulafa kuwɛ̃ gu sinyɔ-iru i kagbalɔ, meta kulafa kuwɛ̃ gu sinyɔ-iru i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃, meta kulafa kuwɛ̃ gu sinyɔ-iru i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ. <verse eid="EZK 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18" />Karɔ̃ ga lokuti kase kume ku kasɛ sekelea fiɛ karɛ i kã kukarãme ne, kaaɖe meta kukpi kuru i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ fiɛ meta kukpi kuru i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ kasɛ. Kã iso maakpɛ̃ ɔraɖui wɔ loatã marabaradze araɖea i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame. <verse eid="EZK 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19" />Marabaradze ma loabɔrɛ i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame maakpɛ̃ kã ne maabɔrɛ i Israel kumele ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="EZK 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20" />Karɔ̃ kasɛ ɔɖuɖu aaɖe meta kukpi kuweo- kunyɔ gu alafa-aru i kasɛ biara. Lɛ karatã igbaɔ ne, maaɖi kasɛ sekelea ise, kawegu kasɛ ga nɖe ɔmagɛ̃siare ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21" />"Karɔ̃ ga lokuti i kasɛ sekelea ababa anyɔ gu ɔmagɛ̃siare kasɛ to kaaɖe ɔɖeisoi kasɛ. Kato kaakɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ siru (12,250) ita i kasɛ sekelea iso ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ kume iso, gu meta kukpi kuweo-kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru (12,250) ito ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ ibo kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ kume iso. Abodɛ̃ anyɔ wagbe rɛ i kumele kasɛ kukarãme to iaɖe ɔɖeisoi kasɛ, ne kasɛ sekelea gu isɔrɛyo aawe i wã ndɛndɛ̃. <verse eid="EZK 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:22" />Ne ɔso ma Levise karana gu ɔmagɛ̃siare kare to kaarɛ i kasɛ ga nɖe ɔɖeisoi kare ndɛndɛ̃. Kasɛ ga nɖe ɔɖeisoi kare to kaarɛ i Yuda kume gu Benyamin kume ndɛ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumele Mama Karɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23" />"Kumele tsɔra ɣɛɛ ne: Benyamin to ɔ̃awe kasɛ kawɛ̃; kato kaata i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ kafe kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24" />"Simeon to ɔ̃awe kasɛ kawɛ̃; kato kaase kume ku Benyamin kare ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25" />"Isakar to ɔ̃awe kasɛ kawɛ̃. Kato kaase kume ku Simeon kare ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26" />"Zebulon to ɔ̃awe kasɛ kawɛ̃. Kato kaase kume ku Isakar kare ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27" />"Gad kamele to kaawe kasɛ kawɛ̃. Kaase kume ku Zebulon kamele ita i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28" />"Gad kamele kagbalɔ kaɖekɔ̃ kume to kuata i Tamar ikɛlɛ Meriba Kades ndu kɔrɛ i kagbalɔ, isɛ Egipte kagbolomi ame ikɛlɛ Mediterania Ɔpo iso.<verse eid="EZK 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29" />Nnɛgbe nɖe karɔ̃ ga aaɣɛ atã Israel kumele lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ ne, fiɛ nwagbe loaɖe ma kusɛ ne," <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso loɣɛ.<verse eid="EZK 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔmagɛ̃siare Kuyogodɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30" />"Nwagbe loaɖe ɔmagɛ̃siare kuyogodɔ̃ gɔ ame maabɔrɛ i ɔmagɛ̃ ame ne: Isɛkarɔ̃ i katikpe isɛ nɛ lokarã meta kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru (2,250), <verse eid="EZK 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:31" />ɔmagɛ̃siare kuyogodɔ̃ ne maasia kɔ̃ Israel kumele iweo-inyɔ ayere. Kuyogodɔ̃ kutɛ gɔ i katikpe aaɖe Ruben kayogodɔ̃, Yuda kayogodɔ̃ gu Levi kayogodɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32" />"Kuyogodɔ̃ kutɛ gɔ i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ nɛ lokarã meta kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru, aaɖe: Yosef kayogodɔ̃, Benyamin kayogodɔ̃ gu Dan kayogodɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33" />"Kuyogodɔ̃ kutɛ gɔ i kagbalɔ isɛ nɛ lokarã meta kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru, aaɖe: Simeon kayogodɔ̃, Isakar kayogodɔ̃ gu Zebulon kayogodɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34" />"Kuyogodɔ̃ kutɛ i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ nɛ lokarã meta kukpi kunyɔ gu alafa anyɔ-siru, aaɖe: Gad kayogodɔ̃, Aser kayogodɔ̃ gu Naftali kayogodɔ̃.<verse eid="EZK 48:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35" />"Igu ne loki ilɔ pelepele aaɖe meta kukpi kaiwɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 48:35">"Ne ɔmagɛ̃siare iyere ita i ɔwi wɔmɔ iso to iaɖe:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="EZK 48:35">
    <char style="nd">BOSATE</char> PIA I MMƆ."<verse eid="EZK 48:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48" />
</usx>